  <data key="d5">1778710098</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Diabetes Mellitus Type 1</data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Mellitus Type 2">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 is a metabolic disorder characterized by insulin resistance and high blood glucose levels, often managed with lifestyle and medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 is a chronic condition where insulin therapy may become necessary as part of progressive treatment, not as a punishment.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 is a chronic metabolic disorder in adults that requires medical management, including insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes mellitus type 2 is a chronic metabolic disorder characterized by insulin resistance and high blood glucose levels, treated with Levemir alone or in combination with other antidiabetic agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2) is a metabolic disorder characterized by insulin resistance and impaired insulin secretion, which can benefit from improved glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc0edfe7c2736912a3aa78c50f72b99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdbc37da05a342443ccfd48642dd1c3b</data>
