<node id="Asymptomatic Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Asymptomatic Hypoglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Asymptomatic hypoglycemia is the condition where a person does not feel symptoms when blood sugar is dropping, making CGM valuable for early detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778708972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Asymptomatic Hypoglycemia</data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Insulin Pump is a medical device used for continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion in the management of diabetes, delivering rapid-acting insulin in precise amounts throughout the day and night. It functions by administering basal insulin continuously at programmed rates, which can be customized into multiple basal patterns to match an individual’s metabolic needs, and it also delivers bolus doses to cover meals or correct high blood glucose levels. These bolus doses can be calculated using built-in features such as the Bolus Wizard, which considers current glucose levels, insulin on board, and carbohydrate intake. The device typically consists of a reservoir, a piston-driven mechanism, a mini-computer for dose control, and an infusion set with a cannula that delivers insulin under the skin.

Insulin pumps, such as the MiniMed™ series including the MiniMed 770G and 780G models, are central components of modern insulin therapy and often integrate with continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems. This integration enables advanced functionalities like SmartGuard, which can automate insulin delivery based on real-time glucose data, and allows for suspension of insulin when glucose levels drop too low. The pump communicates with CGM devices and user inputs to adjust delivery in Manual or automated modes, and it provides status updates including active insulin, reservoir levels, and current basal rates. Safety features such as Autoapagado (automatic shutdown), alerts, alarms, and the Suspend All Delivery function help manage operational issues and prevent adverse events.

The device is portable and can be worn in various ways for comfort and convenience, though it must be disconnected during certain activities—such as sports, intimacy, or medical procedures—for up to two hours. Users are advised to handle the pump carefully, as extreme temperatures, radiation, or RF interference may affect its performance. It is incompatible with certain insulin types like Novolin® R Penfill® due to the risk of precipitation. Regular glucose monitoring and medical guidance are essential for proper configuration, including settings such as Max Basal, Max Bolus, and temporary basal rates. The insulin pump plays a critical role in diabetes therapy, enabling precise, flexible, and personalized insulin delivery while requiring vigilant monitoring, especially during illness or technical malfunctions.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pump is a medical device that delivers insulin continuously and can display real-time glucose data when integrated with SMCG systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc08a8bfb4a202cf5c302e80c55fdbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df59f6460ce09b02f1576e31831b6eb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cae8b84f90a8e9c929a19f036d8f1e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560db599319a34f19671d0bafeda5775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-682b7d7aa57e01aca00a1d4393db7bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1faf2db5ce0667a0d479a8832c2bc8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feedb8da72881894bf4c6529f7baca60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b28f926a642d5f692433ed41fafafa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec9910e322fb247c0bf85c8b8cb3e948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4dc17381a558f271a9da13b99091c2ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfad6c7b0e936c6a9c113798a2d963e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fe4cbdd5aa97cd45d28222067ba8cff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779002dab61d888870696234d1dbdf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91eefcd3f117b070db0c6aae336adcf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1250027f75a49e3288b12fc80a630d33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0f18d3b5098557dfd71a1955adc3a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23235296c6ccfffc5ec397dd6b0dc7b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc5f5eb70e79d2ce44b3ba795b76b3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec727091282384bd8f9c91eb1d29b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20fd2bf061c46e98e4d7791fe6728699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfb7ffc723b939ad50f1b00ca6ec8b9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b392b58ab9f757711d038354d82e450e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc5c57277d034fb00908385613bf5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbdbcaae1740f3543ed8a673ff203b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b299154da4c58d8322b7ac4e3af2f5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e93fcffd71ed0c035f0b03374608e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40aae9750bff384ac9028ae500bc1fb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6366eda06d68d222b47729f7ca841b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7220b25a27de0c76dc2804cda82d46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26f5ebaa0341f051ad33cfb9895a3851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9947b75a4183c17b6384b798fcda161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dfb1fdb931a758d328534e48eca5ad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc46b3924459ec23a123df1dad4bdcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cdb970e2c2f1aaaab96fdc11b589f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f0c4f9a47c13cec