  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Hemoglobin A1c</data>
</node>
<node id="Medtronic Minimed">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Minimed</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Minimed is a division or subsidiary of Medtronic involved in diabetes care technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic MiniMed is a medical device company that manufactures diabetes care products and holds several registered trademarks.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Minimed is one of the first continuous glucose monitoring devices that stored data for later analysis by healthcare professionals and required periodic calibration.</data>
