  <data key="d7">Medtronic Minimed</data>
</node>
<node id="FreeStyle Libre">
  <data key="d0">FreeStyle Libre</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FreeStyle Libre é um sistema de monitoramento contínuo de glicose que exige escaneamento do sensor para visualizar os dados.&lt;SEP&gt;FreeStyle Libre is a standalone glucose sensor widely used in Brazil that does not require calibration and functions for 14 days.&lt;SEP&gt;FreeStyle Libre is a glucose monitoring system available in Brazil that provides an 8-hour glucose level graph and integrates with a smartphone app for data reading and sharing, but lacks hypoglycemia and hyperglycemia alarms in its current version.&lt;SEP&gt;FreeStyle Libre is a flash glucose monitoring system that allows intermittent scanning of glucose levels using a sensor and reader, providing glucose trends and values without requiring fingerstick calibration.&lt;SEP&gt;FreeStyle Libre is a factory-calibrated continuous glucose monitoring system (SFMG) developed by Abbott for glucose measurement without routine calibration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-636a6ab7d0bef06e011ae7bf2140d2e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdbc37da05a342443ccfd48642dd1c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae76a096a2e7c5125f3d505a209605a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/glicemias capilares.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709732</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">FreeStyle Libre</data>
</node>
<node id="Dexcom">
  <data key="d0">Dexcom</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Dexcom é um sistema de monitoramento contínuo de glicose que exibe valores em tempo real diretamente no celular.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom is a glucose sensor system approved for insulin dosing decisions in the US, though not yet available in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom is a company that produces real-time continuous glucose monitoring systems, including the G6 model approved by the FDA in 2018.&lt;SEP&gt;Dexcom is a company that produces continuous glucose monitoring systems, including the Dexcom brand of sensors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdbc37da05a342443ccfd48642dd1c3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae76a096a2e7c5125f3d505a209605a</data>
