<node id="HbA1c">
  <data key="d0">HbA1c</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">HbA1c, also known as glycated hemoglobin, is a clinical and laboratory test that measures the average blood glucose levels over the past 2 to 3 months, serving as a key biomarker for long-term glycemic control in individuals with diabetes. It is widely used in both clinical practice and research to assess chronic hyperglycemia and evaluate the effectiveness of diabetes management strategies. As a primary or key efficacy endpoint in numerous clinical studies, HbA1c is instrumental in comparing the performance of various diabetes treatments, including different types of insulin such as Levemir®, NPH, and glargine.

The utility of HbA1c extends to specialized populations, including pregnant women with diabetes, where it is used to monitor glycemic control at specific intervals such as weeks 24 and 36 of pregnancy. Specific HbA1c targets are recommended before and during pregnancy to optimize maternal and fetal outcomes. Clinical trials frequently employ HbA1c as a primary outcome measure to evaluate treatment efficacy, with studies demonstrating that structured diabetes education and the use of insulin pens can lead to significant improvements in HbA1c levels, although not always increasing the proportion of patients achieving target levels such as &lt;7%.

Elevated HbA1c values are associated with an increased risk of microvascular complications in diabetes, reinforcing its importance in long-term disease management. The measure reflects average blood glucose exposure over several months and is used to guide therapeutic decisions, assess treatment response after six months of insulin therapy, and standardize outcomes across diabetes research. Overall, HbA1c remains a cornerstone in the assessment and monitoring of glycemic control across diverse clinical contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9266b0855586c9a971861beb4d3289fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e33f93b79c1061267614c8283508c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e2fd1844a95ab6fd4f7d89cdbddbc58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ced7d025f7f3232d1a0e28251b0fb63a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a1c7be3f5278cc80c8bc958c35be31c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fcb9633783dfd958b918dec57d02c8</data>
