<node id="GMI">
  <data key="d0">GMI</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">GMI, or Glucose Management Indicator, is a metric calculated from continuous glucose sensor data that estimates average glucose levels and serves as an alternative to HbA1c.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de</data>
