</node>
<node id="Diabetes Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes treatment involves managing blood sugar levels through monitoring, medication, and lifestyle changes to prevent complications.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical regimen involving injectable therapies such as insulin and GLP-1 agonists for managing blood sugar levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
