  <data key="d5">1778699868</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Lipohipertrofia</data>
</node>
<node id="Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is the Brazilian Diabetes Society, responsible for issuing official clinical guidelines on diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is the organization responsible for issuing clinical guidelines on diabetes management in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a professional organization in Brazil that publishes clinical guidelines for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a professional organization that publishes clinical guidelines for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a Brazilian organization that issued official positioning on injectable diabetes treatments and published educational materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A professional organization that published clinical guidelines in 2020 on diabetes management, available online.&lt;SEP&gt;Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes is an organization that issues guidelines for diabetes management, recommending self-monitoring of blood glucose since 2014.</data>
