<node id="Insulin Pens">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pens</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Disposable insulin pens are used for insulin delivery and must be disposed of properly after use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens, including disposable and reusable types, are devices for insulin administration and should be stored according to manufacturer guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Devices used to administer insulin, requiring needles and proper handling.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens are alternative devices for insulin delivery and should be available as backup during travel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-525086e26636af026c417773a8f11a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40aae9750bff384ac9028ae500bc1fb4</data>
