<node id="Safe Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Safe Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Safe disposal of diabetes-related sharps protects individuals, prevents disease transmission, and reduces environmental contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Safe disposal involves placing used needles in appropriate containers such as rigid plastic bottles or disposable boxes, never in PET bottles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-525086e26636af026c417773a8f11a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
