  <data key="d5">1778699903</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Safe Disposal</data>
</node>
<node id="Lipo-Hypertrophy">
  <data key="d0">Lipo-Hypertrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipo-hypertrophy refers to the formation of hard lumps or nodules under the skin due to repeated insulin injections, leading to irregular insulin absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipo-hypertrophy is a skin condition characterized by the formation of lumps or swellings due to repeated insulin injections in the same spot, impairing insulin absorption and glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699741</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Lipo-Hypertrophy</data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Type 2">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Type 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Type 2 is a condition where the body either does not produce enough insulin or cannot use it properly, sometimes requiring insulin treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Type 2 is a medical condition where lipo-hypertrophy can occur, with studies showing a prevalence between 28% and 64%.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Type 2 is a metabolic disorder characterized by insulin resistance and relative insulin deficiency, often managed with lifestyle changes and medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Type 2 is a form of diabetes where insulin is a natural part of treatment and should not be viewed as a punishment for poor self-care.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes type 2 is a condition where initial insulin dosage is often lower, around 0.3 to 0.6 UI/kg/day.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-525086e26636af026c417773a8f11a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986fc7ecc813c4b7942964d7fd64d429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1d7f92cdb7923807a9067d937837a4</data>
