  <data key="d0">Test Strip</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A component of the glucometer that contains an enzyme reacting with blood sugar to generate an electrical signal for glucose measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;Test strip is a component of the glucose meter that contains an enzyme reacting with blood sugar to generate an electrical signal for glucose measurement.</data>
