  <data key="d0">Syringe and Vial</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Syringe and Vial is a traditional method of insulin administration requiring careful preparation and handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
