  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Profissional De Saúde</data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Sugar Level">
  <data key="d0">Blood Sugar Level</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood sugar level refers to the concentration of glucose in the blood, which can be affected by incorrect insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood sugar level is a physiological measure that can increase or decrease due to incorrect insulin dosing or device malfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood sugar level is a physiological measurement that can increase or decrease based on the accuracy of insulin dosing and delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778708882</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Blood Sugar Level</data>
</node>
<node id="Dehydration">
  <data key="d0">Dehydration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dehydration is a condition that may necessitate hospitalization in diabetic patients due to increased metabolic instability.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration is a condition that can slow insulin absorption and lead to elevated blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration can affect insulin effectiveness by slowing its action and increasing blood sugar.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration can slow insulin absorption, leading to higher blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration reduces insulin absorption and can contribute to hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea83f440d1d3472e7a19b4ca0d941320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695951</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Dehydration</data>
</node>
<node id="Disposable Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d0">Disposable Insulin Pen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A disposable insulin pen comes pre-filled with insulin and is discarded after use, providing ease of use and portability.&lt;SEP&gt;A disposable insulin pen is a single-use device pre-filled with insulin, discarded after the insulin is depleted.&lt;SEP&gt;A disposable insulin pen is a single-use device for insulin delivery, used at room temperature once in use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Disposable Insulin Pen</data>
</node>
<node id="Reusable Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d0">Reusable Insulin Pen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A reusable insulin pen uses replaceable insulin cartridges (refills) of 3 mL and must be used with refills from the same manufacturer.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable insulin pen is designed for multiple uses with U100 insulin cartridges, requiring compatibility between the pen and cartridge from the same manufacturer.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable insulin pen contains a refillable cartridge and should not be stored in the refrigerator to avoid damage to its internal mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;A reusable insulin pen contains a refillable cartridge and should not be stored in the refrigerator to prevent damage to its internal mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
