</node>
<node id="Dysglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Dysglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dysglycemia refers to unstable blood sugar levels with frequent oscillations, contributing to long-term tissue and vascular damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysglycemia refers to abnormal blood glucose fluctuations, including both acute and chronic imbalances, leading to diabetic complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a1c7be3f5278cc80c8bc958c35be31c</data>
