<node id="Glycemic Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic monitoring is required during intravenous infusion of Novolin® R to ensure safe and effective blood glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic monitoring is recommended after changing injection sites from affected to unaffected areas to manage hypoglycemia risk.</data>
