<node id="SMCG">
  <data key="d0">SMCG</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SMCG, or Sensor de Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose, is a method that uses skin-attached sensors to measure glucose levels continuously every few minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;SMCG refers to continuous glucose monitoring, a method used for tracking glucose levels over time in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;SMCG stands for Continuous Glucose Monitoring System, a technology used to track glucose levels in real time for improved diabetes management.</data>
