<node id="Eversense">
  <data key="d0">Eversense</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Eversense é um sensor de glicose implantável que funciona por até 90 dias.&lt;SEP&gt;Eversense is a long-term implantable glucose monitoring system developed by Senseonics, consisting of a cylindrical sensor implanted in the upper arm, a transmitter, and a smartphone app, with a usage duration of up to 90 days or 180 days for the Eversense XLR model.&lt;SEP&gt;Eversense is a continuous glucose monitoring system developed by Senseonics, designed for long-term metabolic management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-636a6ab7d0bef06e011ae7bf2140d2e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dae76a096a2e7c5125f3d505a209605a</data>
