<node id="São Paulo">
  <data key="d0">São Paulo</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São Paulo is a city in Brazil where several diabetes-related publications were produced and published by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes and other organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes and Conselho Regional de Enfermagem de São Paulo are based.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is registered.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is headquartered.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. has an office registered at Rua Fidalga, 360.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda is located.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil, serving as the location for the technical responsibility and business operations related to the product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7da978df74ee7f686dcc3c260d75577&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54f4c3fffcb1c054dd2b100c36c64717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad7b7e8e5212b6d7ea0f4b0505f82c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f779e765cd1ec33782872b317bf8af11</data>
