  <data key="d2">The Ministério da Saúde is the Brazilian Ministry of Health responsible for public health policies and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministério da Saúde is the Brazilian government body responsible for health policies and the management of the Unified Health System.&lt;SEP&gt;Ministério da Saúde is the Brazilian health authority responsible for approving and regulating health product information, including the professional labeling of Novolin® R FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;Ministério da Saúde is the Brazilian health authority responsible for issuing official health guidelines and product documentation such as the Novolin® R FlexPen® professional label.</data>
