  <data key="d2">Metformin is an oral antidiabetic agent used in combination with liraglutide and insulin detemir for managing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Metformin is an oral antidiabetic medication commonly used in the management of type 2 diabetes, often combined with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Metformin is an oral antidiabetic drug commonly used as first-line therapy for type 2 diabetes, frequently combined with insulin or other agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Metformin is an oral antihyperglycemic agent commonly used in the management of type 2 diabetes.</data>
