<node id="Diabetes Care">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Care</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Care is a journal that published a double-blind, randomized dose-response study on the pharmacodynamic and pharmacokinetic properties of insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care is a peer-reviewed journal publishing research on diabetes, including clinical studies such as the 2005 dose-response study on insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care is a peer-reviewed medical journal where a study on insulin detemir was published in 2005.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care is a scientific journal that published the American Diabetes Association's Standards of Medical Care in Diabetes--2014 in its 2013 volume 37 (Suppl 1): S14-80.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care is a medical journal that publishes research and standards on diabetes treatment, including works by the American Diabetes Association and Pickup JC et al.</data>
