</node>
<node id="SmartGuard Technology">
  <data key="d0">SmartGuard Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SmartGuard technology is an automated insulin delivery feature used in the MiniMed 780G system to adjust insulin based on glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard™ technology automatically adjusts insulin delivery based on sensor glucose values without requiring blood glucose meter confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard technology is designed to work with compatible continuous glucose monitors and ACE pumps to automatically adjust basal insulin delivery and deliver correction boluses based on sensor glucose values, intended for managing Type 1 diabetes in individuals aged 7 and older.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard technology is a feature of the MiniMed 780G system that automates insulin delivery based on glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d5f110b7de186509276c52b62487bf1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf5718341c7a791a86f965a94ffbdbc</data>
