  <data key="d2">Insulin aspart is a rapid-acting insulin analog used as bolus insulin in combination with basal insulin in the treatment of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin aspart is a rapid-acting insulin analog used as bolus insulin in basal-bolus therapy for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin aspart is a rapid-acting prandial insulin used in combination with Levemir or NPH insulin in the basal-bolus regimen for pregnant women with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin aspart is a rapid-acting insulin analog used as a bolus insulin in basal-bolus therapy.</data>
