<node id="Diabetic Ketoacidosis">
  <data key="d0">Diabetic Ketoacidosis</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) is a serious, potentially life-threatening complication of diabetes mellitus, primarily associated with type 1 diabetes, though it can occur in other forms under certain conditions. It arises due to a critical deficiency of insulin, leading to uncontrolled hyperglycemia, the accumulation of high levels of blood glucose, and the metabolic production of ketone bodies as the body shifts to fat metabolism for energy. This cascade of physiological disruptions results in metabolic acidosis, which can rapidly progress to a life-threatening state if not promptly addressed.

The condition is commonly triggered by untreated or poorly managed hyperglycemia, illness, infection, or disruptions in insulin therapy, including the interruption of basal insulin delivery—particularly in individuals using insulin pump therapy, where mechanical or user-related failures can halt insulin administration. Diabetic ketoacidosis is preventable through consistent insulin administration, regular monitoring of blood glucose and ketone levels, and timely medical intervention during periods of physiological stress or illness. Symptoms necessitate immediate medical attention, as the condition can deteriorate quickly, leading to severe dehydration, electrolyte imbalances, and organ dysfunction.

Multiple descriptions emphasize the urgency of recognizing and treating diabetic ketoacidosis, underscoring that it requires emergency medical care. While some references use alternative abbreviations such as "CAD," the correct and widely accepted acronym is DKA. Overall, diabetic ketoacidosis remains a critical acute complication of diabetes, preventable with proper management but dangerous when overlooked or inadequately treated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00bac63e27caeb094fe802c0bfe00a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a4232687a569d10d6942d933172488f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23235296c6ccfffc5ec397dd6b0dc7b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d2aca165fc0184360972207bae8c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec727091282384bd8f9c91eb1d29b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b7bb277d16feead8d082fc004d51d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdccbdc819ab6cd813190d6db8dc9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e910e1b2954d8b793bb4671174d8d92f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03dcbf2b62aed8ffb26882713c89f9f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99dc37db5c39ba2f813bb638414b56f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f4df342459d4afd90a81b1a3f13d859</data>
