<node id="Insulin Glargine">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Glargine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin glargine is a long-acting basal insulin analog with a more prolonged effect than NPH insulin but greater variability than insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glargine is a long-acting insulin analog used as a comparator in clinical trials, with glycemic control comparable to insulin detemir but associated with higher weight gain.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glargine is a long-acting insulin analog used as a basal insulin in diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-590fb2f5c50ef31a5fd415bb01def92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
