<node id="Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 1 diabetes mellitus is a chronic condition characterized by insulin deficiency, often studied in pediatric and adult populations in relation to insulin therapy efficacy and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 1 diabetes mellitus is an autoimmune condition characterized by insulin deficiency, requiring exogenous insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 1 diabetes mellitus is a chronic condition requiring insulin therapy, which the MiniMed 780G system is designed to manage.</data>
