  <data key="d2">Sensor-Augmented Pump Therapy (SAP) combines insulin pump therapy with continuous glucose monitoring to improve glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor-augmented pump therapy combines insulin pump use with continuous glucose monitoring for improved diabetes management.</data>
