  <data key="d2">Pediatric patients, including children from 1 year of age and adolescents, can use Levemir, though safety and efficacy have not been established for children under 1 year.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatric patients aged 1 year and older can use Levemir, with dose reduction often needed during transition from other insulins to minimize hypoglycemia risk; safety is not established below 1 year.</data>
