</node>
<node id="Insulina Asparte">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Asparte</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Asparte is a rapid-acting insulin used in combination with either Levemir or NPH insulin in the treatment of pregnant women with type 1 diabetes.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina asparte is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in basal-bolus therapy in combination with insulina detemir to achieve better glycemic control with reduced hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Asparte is a fast-acting insulin analog compared to human insulin in clinical studies evaluating glycemic control in type 1 and type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina asparte is a fast-acting insulin analog used in clinical studies comparing its efficacy to Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina asparte, comercializada como NovoRapid®, é um análogo de insulina de ação rápida comparado à insulina humana em estudos clínicos para controle glicêmico.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Asparte is a fast-acting insulin analog (marketed as NovoRapid®) compared to human insulin in clinical studies evaluating glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc624fe52553cbd90a82f4181c5c0be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-581b6c5da621e9091266d2b0e1919308</data>
