  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Terapia basal-bolus is an insulin treatment regimen combining long-acting basal insulin like Levemir with rapid-acting insulin such as asparte, providing improved glycemic control and reduced hypoglycemia risk.</data>
