<node id="Insulin Sensitivity Factor">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Sensitivity Factor</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Sensitivity Factor is a personalized, user-configurable parameter used in insulin therapy to quantify how much one unit of insulin reduces blood glucose levels, typically measured in mg/dL. It is a critical component in the calculation of correction bolus doses, enabling individuals with diabetes to adjust insulin delivery for optimal glycemic control. This factor is determined by a healthcare provider based on individual metabolic responses and may be fine-tuned over time to improve blood glucose management.

The Insulin Sensitivity Factor is commonly integrated into insulin pump settings and diabetes management tools such as the Bolus Wizard, where it is referenced during device setup and daily use. It plays an essential role in automated bolus calculations, ensuring accurate insulin dosing by accounting for current blood glucose levels relative to target ranges. As a required setting for proper pump function, it must be correctly configured and periodically reviewed to reflect changes in insulin sensitivity due to factors like weight, activity level, or hormonal fluctuations.

Also known as Sensibilidad or simply Sensitivity, the Insulin Sensitivity Factor is consistently described as a measure of the blood glucose-lowering effect of one unit of insulin. It is used not only in manual insulin dose computations but also in advanced diabetes technologies to support precise and individualized therapy. Its application spans clinical guidance, device programming, and patient education, particularly highlighted in instructional materials on pages 97 and 260 of relevant medical or device manuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1250027f75a49e3288b12fc80a630d33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc5f5eb70e79d2ce44b3ba795b76b3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e6b312daef8e67f312c6c144bbaa835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-425759c12d133ef4832928e8f5d50896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de222ffe4b47c380bbe3bc69fd7c2632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402361ced0649a06619dcaf93b0eb651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe3d4956e4290b26b4d22092a403c4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b21bc8135e144a626f42f84747459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8080e2e312ed6994d0dc059a4aeca5f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14b0e9023a7c03c6a284d69e0930b8a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73b840edccb54a2c256450df95d80f4f</data>
