<node id="Time In Range">
  <data key="d0">Time In Range</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Time In Range is a metric that shows the percentage of time a user's glucose levels remain within a target range.&lt;SEP&gt;Time In Range refers to the percentage of time a person's glucose levels remain within a target glucose range.&lt;SEP&gt;Time in range is a metric showing the percentage of time a user's glucose levels remain within the target range.&lt;SEP&gt;Time in range refers to the percentage of time a person's glucose levels remain within the target range of 70 mg/dL to 180 mg/dL, a key goal of the SmartGuard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;Time In Range is a metric displayed on the pump showing the percentage of time glucose levels remain between 70 mg/dL and 180 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Time In Range refers to the percentage of time a person's glucose levels remain within a target range, a key metric in diabetes management.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-583197b9760861a9bb1ee261914759fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d8c5703a9383d7fd4b6f1d14f5d5424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39a29f6130bd8284c7277df75ae0e90d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
