  <data key="d0">Insulina Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Basal refers to the continuous, low-level secretion or delivery of insulin that maintains stable blood glucose levels throughout the day and night, particularly during fasting periods, between meals, and during sleep. It simulates the natural insulin secretion of a healthy pancreas, which releases small, steady amounts of insulin to regulate metabolic needs even in the absence of food intake. This basal insulin is essential for managing glucose homeostasis in individuals with diabetes, whether through endogenous production in non-diabetic individuals or via external administration in diabetic patients.

In clinical practice, Insulina Basal can be delivered through various methods, including insulin pumps or injections. When administered via an insulin pump, it is provided as a continuous background infusion to meet the body’s ongoing metabolic demands. This form of delivery aims to closely mimic the physiological insulin release of a healthy pancreas. Additionally, long-acting insulin analogs such as Levemir® are used as basal insulin products, with evidence indicating their use in approximately 33% of patients in certain studies. These formulations provide a prolonged, steady effect to control glucose levels over 24 hours.

Insulina Basal remains necessary even during periods of illness, unless specifically adjusted or discontinued under medical supervision. Its role is distinct from bolus insulin, as it focuses on background control rather than mealtime glucose spikes. Whether described in English or Spanish, the concept consistently emphasizes the round-the-clock requirement for low, continuous insulin to maintain metabolic stability, underscoring its fundamental importance in both type 1 and type 2 diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e2fd1844a95ab6fd4f7d89cdbddbc58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1cf60a28692e32a5ea7181943e41938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd7b4fa0ccd15d540a9299e77dbf1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d2aca165fc0184360972207bae8c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-357e07e3b068c4c6d31ac6913e35178f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6900fc7e5ef921c29efe412333f2e7ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778708803</data>
