<node id="Hba1c">
  <data key="d0">Hba1c</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Hba1c is a blood test that measures long-term glycemic control and is used complementarily with Amgc for evaluating diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Hba1c is a measure of average blood glucose levels over time and is used as a standard for glycemic control, though it has limitations such as not reflecting glycemic variability or hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7d99aa72407a6721b69e4da3cbbcba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9af645f149415b242f6b7443aeb536d9</data>
