  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Pediatric Diabetes is a scientific journal publishing research on diabetes in children, including clinical studies on insulin therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatric Diabetes is a journal focused on diabetes in children and adolescents, publishing research on insulin therapies such as insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatric Diabetes is a journal that published the ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 on glycemic control in youth with diabetes by DiMeglio LA et al.</data>
