<node id="Glucose Meter">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Meter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose meter is a device used in capillary blood glucose monitoring that reads test strips containing a blood sample to display blood glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;The Glucose Meter is a device used to measure blood glucose levels with test strips and a lancing device.&lt;SEP&gt;A glucose meter is a device used to measure blood glucose levels and serves as a communication device between the insulin pump and computer when transferring data to CareLink.&lt;SEP&gt;A Glucose Meter is a medical device used in capillary blood glucose monitoring that reads glucose levels from a biosensor strip via electrochemical reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;A glucose meter is a medical device used to measure blood glucose levels and confirm hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbdbcaae1740f3543ed8a673ff203b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dfb1fdb931a758d328534e48eca5ad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9af645f149415b242f6b7443aeb536d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d00bf995ac4c109277e3272b1236de</data>
