  <data key="d2">Elderly patients require intensified blood glucose monitoring and individualized insulin detemir dosing due to increased sensitivity and risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Elderly patients are at increased risk of hypoglycemia and require intensified blood glucose monitoring and individualized insulin detemir dosing due to age-related physiological changes.</data>
