  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Peripheral neuropathy, including painful neuropathy, is a rare adverse event associated with rapid improvement in glycemic control during Levemir therapy, generally reversible over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Peripheral neuropathy, including painful neuropathy, is an uncommon adverse effect associated with insulin treatment, often reversible.</data>
