  <data key="d0">Abbott</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Abbott is a company that owns the sensor design and related marks used in the MiniMed 780G system, with the sensor image copyrighted by Abbott.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbott is the manufacturer of the Instinct sensor and owns related trademarks and designs used under license.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbott is a company that produces the FreeStyle Libre, a factory-calibrated continuous glucose monitoring system.</data>
