<node id="American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists">
  <data key="d0">American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">La American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists es una organización que recomienda un objetivo de HbA1C &lt;6.5% para el control glucémico.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Association of Clinical Endocrinologists publishes medical guidelines for the clinical management of diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ed992bd0ad5b80f31b2135789dcaa1b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab57247c382bad8d5f1e5eb84a62e24</data>
