<node id="Blood Sugar Control">
  <data key="d0">Blood Sugar Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood sugar control is a critical aspect of diabetes management, helping to prevent serious complications and improve quality of life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de</data>
