</node>
<node id="AMGC">
  <data key="d0">AMGC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">AMGC, or Automonitorização da Glicemia Capilar, is the technical term for capillary blood glucose monitoring, which involves pricking the finger to measure blood sugar using a glucometer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709373</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">AMGC</data>
</node>
<node id="Sistema De Monitoramento Contínuo De Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Sistema De Monitoramento Contínuo De Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">O Sistema de Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG ou CGM) é uma tecnologia que mede a glicose 24 horas por dia por meio de sensores subcutâneos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709387</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Sistema De Monitoramento Contínuo De Glicose</data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Cego Ou Profissional">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Cego Ou Profissional</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">O sensor “cego” ou profissional (retro-SMCG) grava dados de glicose sem exibi-los ao paciente, para análise posterior pelo médico.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709373</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Sensor Cego Ou Profissional</data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Em Tempo Real">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Em Tempo Real</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">O sensor em tempo real (tR-SMCG) exibe continuamente os valores de glicose no celular ou bomba de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709391</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Sensor Em Tempo Real</data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Leve">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Leve</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia Leve refers to mild episodes of low blood sugar, measured per patient per year in clinical trials to assess treatment safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e2fd1844a95ab6fd4f7d89cdbddbc58</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709418</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Hipoglicemia Leve</data>
</node>
<node id="Glicemia De Jejum">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia De Jejum</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia de jejum refers to fasting blood glucose levels, which were significantly lower in the Levemir group compared to the NPH insulin group.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ced7d025f7f3232d1a0e28251b0fb63a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778710018</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Glicemia De Jejum</data>
</node>
<node id="Algodão">
  <data key="d0">Algodão</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Algodão é usado para comprimir o local de aplicação após a injeção, por cinco segundos, para evitar sangramento ou vazamento.&lt;SEP&gt;Algodão is used with alcohol to clean the injection site and rubber stopper of the insulin vial.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ebdb9452013f0e340884677832714553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Algodão</data>
</node>
<node id="Storage">
  <data key="d0">Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sealed insulin pens must be stored in the refrigerator, above the vegetable drawer, to maintain efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;In-use insulin pens can be stored at room temperature up to 30°C for ease of use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709563</data>
