  <data key="d0">Dropped Or Damaged Glucometer</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f2616cb245736f951a3dcbf261b3b9b</data>
  <data key="d2">After a glucometer is dropped or damaged, a control solution test is recommended to ensure proper function.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
