  <data key="d2">Glucose metabolism is a physiological process affected by insulin and various drug interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose metabolism can be influenced by various medications, affecting insulin requirements and increasing the risk of hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
