  <data key="d0">ANVISA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency overseeing pharmaceutical products and managing the Sistema VigiMed for adverse event reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency responsible for overseeing the approval and modification of pharmaceutical products and their labeling under regulations such as RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is the regulatory agency in Brazil responsible for registering medical devices such as the Accu-Chek Solo system.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency, under which the product is registered with number 81414021710.</data>
