</node>
<node id="Retinopatia Diabética">
  <data key="d0">Retinopatia Diabética</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retinopatia diabética pode piorar temporariamente com intensificação da terapia com insulina, embora o controle glicêmico a longo prazo reduza seu risco de progressão.&lt;SEP&gt;Retinopatia diabética is a very rare adverse reaction associated with insulin treatment, indicating potential worsening of diabetic eye disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Retinopatia diabética is a very rare ocular complication associated with insulin use, potentially related to metabolic fluctuations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61071ebd09f043bc8e0041fda9bdf64a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc</data>
