<node id="Tabela 2">
  <data key="d0">Tabela 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 2 presents clinical study data comparing changes in HbA1c, proportion of patients achieving HbA1c &lt; 7%, body weight change, and incidence of mild hypoglycemia episodes in patients treated with Levemir® + liraglutida + metformin versus liraglutida + metformin over 26 and 52 weeks.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 2 summarizes clinical trial data for Levemir in combination with liraglutida and metformina, including changes in HbA1c, weight, and hypoglycemia rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e2fd1844a95ab6fd4f7d89cdbddbc58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778710089</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Tabela 2</data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetic Retinopathy">
  <data key="d0">Diabetic Retinopathy</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetic retinopathy is a microvascular complication of diabetes that may transiently worsen with rapid improvement in glycemic control during intensified insulin therapy, though long-term control reduces progression risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic retinopathy may temporarily worsen with rapid improvement in glycemic control but decreases in long-term progression risk with sustained control.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic retinopathy may temporarily worsen with intensified insulin therapy but is reduced in long-term progression with improved glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic retinopathy is an eye complication of diabetes that may temporarily worsen with intensified insulin therapy but decreases in long-term progression risk with improved glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic retinopathy is a complication of diabetes that may worsen at the beginning of insulin pump therapy due to rapid improvement in glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a07d2f5e930a504dfb7c969e65903a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff021af578e58080f6a865c5f105e6d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2339435aa42eeb6f0cb8bffbf4d5184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbd230d2ccb1901e088f3bb5714424fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778710008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Diabetic Retinopathy</data>
</node>
