<node id="Glucagon">
  <data key="d0">Glucagon</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucagon is a hormone produced by the pancreas that plays a critical role in regulating blood glucose levels. It functions by signaling the liver to release stored glucose into the bloodstream, thereby increasing blood sugar levels. This physiological mechanism is essential during episodes of low blood sugar, particularly in individuals with diabetes who are at risk of severe hypoglycemia.

Glucagon is widely used as an emergency medication to treat severe hypoglycemic episodes, especially when oral intake of sugar is not feasible due to neurological impairment, seizures, or unconsciousness. It is administered either intramuscularly or subcutaneously in doses typically ranging from 0.5 to 1 mg. The treatment is intended for use by trained individuals or healthcare professionals who can recognize the signs of severe hypoglycemia and respond promptly. Its primary purpose in clinical settings is to rapidly elevate blood glucose levels and prevent complications associated with prolonged hypoglycemia, such as coma or neurological damage.

As both a naturally occurring hormone and a pharmaceutical agent, glucagon serves a dual role in both normal metabolic regulation and emergency medical intervention. Its use is particularly vital in situations where immediate action is required to restore consciousness and stabilize a patient experiencing severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef496454c12f85ff1f62de19e8a22be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de4016c46aba524b40e489fd60f018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-619da52df301ce6db70795213fac37be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd7b4fa0ccd15d540a9299e77dbf1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5cace75be2ca46efd8033523e47b6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b139e060742a21ffc13eee0fdbf0be4a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
