<node id="Fast-Acting Carbohydrates">
  <data key="d0">Fast-Acting Carbohydrates</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast-acting carbohydrates are foods such as glucose tablets, juice, or honey that quickly raise blood glucose levels during hypoglycemic episodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast-acting carbohydrates are foods or drinks such as glucose tablets, juice, candy, or regular soda that quickly raise blood glucose levels during hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast-acting carbohydrates are foods that quickly raise blood glucose levels, such as glucose tablets, juice, or sugar.</data>
