<node id="Glucose Control">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose control refers to the management of blood sugar levels, which insulin pump therapy aims to improve.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Control refers to the management of blood sugar levels within a target range to reduce the risk of diabetes complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose control refers to maintaining stable blood sugar levels, a primary goal for individuals managing diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Control is the objective of maintaining blood glucose levels within a target range to prevent complications in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose control refers to the management of blood sugar levels, which can improve rapidly with the use of the MiniMed 780G system.</data>
