<node id="Insulina Detemir">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Detemir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Detemir is a long-acting insulin that cannot be mixed with other insulins in the same syringe.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Detemir is a long-acting insulin analog used to control blood glucose levels in diabetic patients, including those who are pregnant.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina detemir is a long-acting insulin analog with strong auto-association and albumin binding properties, leading to slower distribution and more consistent pharmacokinetics.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina detemir is a long-acting insulin analog with dose-dependent glucose-lowering effects, lower day-to-day variability, and a more predictable metabolic profile than NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc624fe52553cbd90a82f4181c5c0be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
