<node id="Adverse Reactions">
  <data key="d0">Adverse Reactions</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e12d31a9053a73af9ed1cbd1d371d5c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbd230d2ccb1901e088f3bb5714424fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd001e1c01f7ba101b7beb19f131c79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a597a39961d2cb246ad385f39cfb886</data>
  <data key="d2">Adverse reactions are unintended and potentially harmful effects associated with the use of a medication, documented in the drug package insert.&lt;SEP&gt;Adverse reactions refer to negative physiological responses that may occur during use of the system or its components.</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
