<node id="Doping">
  <data key="d0">Doping</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">O medicamento Fiasp pode causar doping, o que pode ter implicações em contextos esportivos.&lt;SEP&gt;Doping refers to the potential of Levemir to cause a positive result in anti-doping tests, indicating its classification as a performance-affecting substance.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Doping refers to the use of prohibited substances in sports; Levemir may cause a positive doping test.&lt;SEP&gt;Doping refers to the potential of Novolin® R Penfill® to cause a positive result in anti-doping tests.&lt;SEP&gt;O uso de HUMULIN R pode causar resultados positivos em testes de doping.&lt;SEP&gt;Humulin R may cause a positive result in doping tests, indicating its potential misuse or detection in sports.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-667a5f6223d705a9ab66214dbd9b6268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc624fe52553cbd90a82f4181c5c0be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc07da1fd30cc15e0022830f701a9c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62a6c42a674563e36382f398efac64a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e097e2326548df575159ee000923b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
