<node id="Air Bubble">
  <data key="d0">Air Bubble</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Air bubbles in the insulin pen needle space can prevent full dose delivery, which is why priming is necessary before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubble refers to small pockets of air that may accumulate in the carpule and must be removed before injection to ensure proper insulin delivery.</data>
