<node id="Storage Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Storage Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage temperature, including 2–8°C (refrigerated), room temperature (average 29.7°C), and 37°C (incubator), was evaluated for its effect on insulin stability over 28 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage temperature for Novolin® R FlexPen® must be between 2°C and 8°C when unopened, and up to 30°C after opening, with no freezing allowed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9fa1ee045093083e543d672f1309db</data>
