  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Tecido Subcutâneo</data>
</node>
<node id="Room Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Room Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Room Temperature refers to the stable, cool environment where in-use insulin can be stored safely for up to 28–30 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Room temperature, up to 30°C, is an acceptable storage condition for insulin in use, particularly for disposable and reusable pens.&lt;SEP&gt;Room temperature, defined as up to 30°C, is the acceptable condition for storing insulin in use, including in insulin pens and syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Room temperature refers to the range of 15°C to 30°C, under which Novolin® R can be stored for up to 6 weeks after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1d7f92cdb7923807a9067d937837a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698986</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Room Temperature</data>
</node>
<node id="Thighs">
  <data key="d0">Thighs</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The thighs are a recommended insulin injection site, specifically the front and outer side between 4 finger widths above the knee and below the groin.&lt;SEP&gt;Thighs are a recommended injection site, specifically the front and outer lateral part between four fingers below the groin and above the knee.&lt;SEP&gt;Thighs are a common insulin injection site with slower absorption rates, particularly affected by physical activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The thighs, specifically the anterior and upper outer lateral face, four fingers below the groin and above the knee, are recommended insulin injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778697178</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Thighs</data>
</node>
<node id="Arms">
  <data key="d0">Arms</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The arms, specifically the back of the upper arm between 4 finger widths below the armpit and above the elbow, are a recommended insulin injection site.&lt;SEP&gt;Arms are a recommended injection site, specifically the back of the arm between four fingers below the armpit and above the elbow.&lt;SEP&gt;Arms are a secondary site for insulin injection, with slightly slower absorption than the abdomen.&lt;SEP&gt;The arms, specifically the posterior aspect three to four fingers below the armpit and above the elbow, are recommended insulin injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778697128</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Arms</data>
</node>
<node id="Air Bubbles">
  <data key="d0">Air Bubbles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Air bubbles in the syringe during insulin preparation should be eliminated to ensure accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubbles in an insulin syringe can reduce the accuracy of the administered dose and must be removed before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubbles in insulin devices such as vials, syringes, or pens can cause dosing errors and must be removed before administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubbles in insulin vials, syringes, or pens can lead to dosing inaccuracies and must be removed before administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubbles in the reservoir or tubing can lead to inaccurate insulin delivery and must be removed by tapping and pushing the plunger.&lt;SEP&gt;Air bubbles in the tubing may interfere with accurate insulin delivery and must be removed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edefb6aab17535eddb38eddb8b8fc7df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc61f77b003d0086bd985ddb94fc2a98</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Air Bubbles</data>
</node>
<node id="Geladeira">
  <data key="d0">Geladeira</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A geladeira é usada para armazenar insulinas não abertas, mantendo-as na temperatura adequada, preferencialmente na parte do meio.&lt;SEP&gt;Geladeira é o eletrodoméstico utilizado para armazenar insulina em temperatura controlada entre 2 °C e 8 °C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778697180</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Geladeira</data>
</node>
<node id="Lucidi P">
  <data key="d0">Lucidi P</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Paola Lucidi is a researcher who studied the pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics of NPH insulin in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
