</node>
<node id="Suco De Laranja Natural">
  <data key="d0">Suco De Laranja Natural</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Suco de laranja natural is a fast-acting carbohydrate recommended to treat low blood glucose (hypoglycemia).</data>
