  <data key="d0">Chatbot Personality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chatbot Personality refers to the empathetic, accessible, explanatory, reassuring, guiding, practical, and humanized communication style of the chatbot in patient interactions.</data>
