<node id="Capillary Blood Glucose Test">
  <data key="d0">Capillary Blood Glucose Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Capillary blood glucose test is a medical procedure to measure blood sugar levels, commonly referred to by patients as "pricking the finger", "doing the little prick", or "a little poke".&lt;SEP&gt;A capillary blood glucose test is used to confirm high sensor glucose values before making therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Capillary Blood Glucose Test is a self-monitoring procedure used to confirm low glucose values and guide therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Capillary Blood Glucose Test is a self-conducted blood test used to confirm current glucose levels and inform treatment decisions, especially during hypoglycemic events.&lt;SEP&gt;A Capillary Blood Glucose Test is a fingerstick test used to confirm high glucose readings from sensor data before making therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A capillary blood glucose test is a self-monitoring method used to confirm sensor glucose readings, especially during high glucose alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1be43b1b23852278983f60d0f150b0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc5f5eb70e79d2ce44b3ba795b76b3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96459b8c713f4d5788b5ab4023a5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf172904e354a6f4cca233304bf69b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdccbdc819ab6cd813190d6db8dc9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abe87298f323437aa2ceaea23d392930</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702516</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chatbot">
  <data key="d0">Chatbot</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The chatbot is an AI tool designed to interpret colloquial patient language related to diabetes, understand the real meaning behind expressions, and respond empathetically using accessible and supportive language while maintaining clinical accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1be43b1b23852278983f60d0f150b0f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolsa Térmica">
  <data key="d0">Bolsa Térmica</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A bolsa térmica é utilizada para transportar insulina com segurança, usando gelo reciclável sem contato direto com o frasco.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolsa térmica é usada para transportar insulina mantendo a temperatura adequada, especialmente durante viagens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696080</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Agulha da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A agulha da caneta é usada para aplicação de insulina e deve ser descartada corretamente após uso único.&lt;SEP&gt;The pen needle is a double-ended needle that allows air to enter and insulin to leak if not removed after use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Garrafa Plástica Dura">
  <data key="d0">Garrafa Plástica Dura</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A garrafa plástica dura, como de água sanitária ou amaciante, é usada para armazenar agulhas usadas até o descarte seguro.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unidade de Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Unidade de Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A unidade de saúde é o local indicado para descarte seguro de agulhas usadas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina de Ação Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Insulina de Ação Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A insulina de ação rápida é transparente e aplicada antes das refeições para controlar a glicemia pós-prandial.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina de Ação Lenta">
  <data key="d0">Insulina de Ação Lenta</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A insulina de ação lenta, como a NPH, pode ser transparente ou leitosa e é aplicada 1 ou 2 vezes ao dia para controle glicêmico contínuo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bomba de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Bomba de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A bomba de insulina é um dispositivo que libera insulina continuamente através de um cateter subcutâneo e pode dispensar injeções frequentes.&lt;SEP&gt;La bomba de insulina es un dispositivo que suministra insulina basal mediante la infusión continua de pequeñas cantidades a lo largo del día y la noche.&lt;SEP&gt;La bomba de insulina es un dispositivo médico utilizado para administrar insulina de manera continua y controlada, con funciones como suspender y reanudar la infusión, y administrar bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;La bomba de insulina es un dispositivo médico que administra insulina de forma continua y puede mejorar el control glucémico.&lt;SEP&gt;La bomba de insulina es un dispositivo médico utilizado para administrar insulina de forma continua y controlada en terapia para pacientes con diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The bomba de insulina is a medical device used to administer insulin continuously, with configurable settings such as basal rates and bolus doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1cf60a28692e32a5ea7181943e41938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f095f73e1ec982aa57fd66798ffaec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed992bd0ad5b80f31b2135789dcaa1b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac418ceabab52352571a8024e5602ec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69a34f389efb36d99ba8a4506a2a2e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778704141</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor de Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Sensor de Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">O sensor de glicose é um dispositivo usado na monitorização contínua da glicemia, com inserção subcutânea mínima e resistência à água.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descarte de Agulhas">
  <data key="d0">Descarte de Agulhas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">O descarte de agulhas envolve o armazenamento seguro em recipiente rígido e entrega em unidade de saúde para descarte adequado.&lt;SEP&gt;The safe disposal of used needles in a rigid container, followed by delivery to the nearest health unit for proper handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695413</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Car">
  <data key="d0">Car</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The car is mentioned as a location where insulin should never be left due to high temperatures that can alter its effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fogão">
  <data key="d0">Fogão</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The fogão (stove) is cited as a hot place where insulin should not be kept, as heat can compromise its efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sol">
  <data key="d0">Sol</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The sol (sun) represents direct sunlight, which can damage insulin if exposed, affecting its performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Água">
  <data key="d0">Água</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
  <data key="d2">O sensor de glicose é resistente à água, permitindo banho e natação.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778694986</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Infusion Rate">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Infusion Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin infusion rate refers to the rate at which glucose is infused, which was found to be 30% lower with refrigerated insulin mixture compared to non-refrigerated insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695154</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refrigerated Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Refrigerated Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigerated insulin is insulin stored at 2–8°C and was associated with a 30% lower glucose infusion rate compared to non-refrigerated insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerated insulin is stored at 2–8°C and shows faster absorption and earlier peak plasma levels compared to insulin stored at room temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695154</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Refrigerated Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Non-Refrigerated Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-refrigerated insulin is insulin stored at room temperature or higher and showed higher glucose infusion rates compared to refrigerated insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695154</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Stability">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin stability refers to the maintenance of insulin's chemical and biological integrity under various storage conditions, such as refrigeration, room temperature, or elevated heat.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin stability refers to the maintenance of insulin's potency and effectiveness when stored and handled according to manufacturer guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Administration Technique">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Administration Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin administration technique encompasses the proper methods of insulin injection, including site rotation, needle use, and training, which impact therapy safety and efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin administration technique includes the correct procedures for preparing and injecting insulin to ensure accurate dosing and prevent complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Structured Diabetes Education">
  <data key="d0">Structured Diabetes Education</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Structured diabetes education is a systematic training program for patients and caregivers on insulin use, shown to improve HbA1c levels and medication adherence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695155</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Morisky Medication Adherence Scale">
  <data key="d0">Morisky Medication Adherence Scale</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Morisky Medication Adherence Scale is a tool used to assess patient adherence to medication, showing improvement in patients who received structured education.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695155</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="4 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">4 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 4 mm needle is recommended for adults and children, typically used at a 90° angle without a skin fold, except in children under 6 years.&lt;SEP&gt;The 4 mm needle is the safest needle length for intramuscular injections in all children, especially when combined with a skin fold technique in those aged ≤6 years.&lt;SEP&gt;A 4 mm needle is a short insulin injection needle provided to patients in one study group, associated with improved injection technique and reduced complications.&lt;SEP&gt;4 mm needle is a short needle length recommended for insulin pens during pregnancy to ensure proper subcutaneous delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A 4 mm needle is a short insulin injection needle that can be inserted at a 90-degree angle.&lt;SEP&gt;A 4 mm needle is the shortest available for insulin pens, recommended for children and adults to minimize risk of intramuscular injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A 4 mm needle is recommended for insulin injection in pregnant individuals to accommodate changes in subcutaneous tissue thickness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695956</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Moscow">
  <data key="d0">Moscow</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Moscow is the city where a randomized clinical trial was conducted on insulin injection training for diabetic patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695156</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Randomized Clinical Trial">
  <data key="d0">Randomized Clinical Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A randomized clinical trial involving 116 diabetic patients was conducted in Moscow to evaluate the impact of structured insulin injection training.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7740b86f0b3f110bb2c3f3d05e4da41</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695156</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin preparation involves steps to correctly mix and draw insulin into a syringe, including handling single or multiple types of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin preparation involves the correct handling and readiness of insulin for administration, including allowing it to reach room temperature before use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695944</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ultrarapid Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Ultrarapid Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultrarapid insulin is a fast-acting insulin type used to control blood glucose levels and may be combined with NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695157</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Waste Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Waste Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sharps waste disposal involves the safe discard of used needles and syringes in puncture-proof containers to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695157</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Puncture-Proof Container">
  <data key="d0">Puncture-Proof Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A puncture-proof container is a rigid, secure receptacle used for the safe disposal of sharp medical waste such as used insulin needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695157</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Brazil Society">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Brazil Society</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Diabetes Brazil Society is a professional organization that issues clinical guidelines for insulin therapy and safe diabetes management practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695158</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin Inspection">
  <data key="d0">Skin Inspection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin inspection involves examining and palpating the injection site before insulin administration to detect skin or subcutaneous tissue abnormalities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695158</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hand Hygiene">
  <data key="d0">Hand Hygiene</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hand hygiene involves washing and drying hands before insulin preparation and application to prevent infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695159</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air Injection">
  <data key="d0">Air Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Air injection involves injecting air into an insulin vial before drawing the dose to equalize pressure and facilitate accurate insulin withdrawal.&lt;SEP&gt;Air injection involves injecting air into an insulin vial to equalize pressure and facilitate insulin aspiration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695961</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Accuracy">
  <data key="d0">Dose Accuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose accuracy is critical in insulin administration; excess insulin in the syringe must be discarded, and the process restarted with a new syringe.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose accuracy is improved with fixed-needle syringes and insulin pens, reducing the risk of dosing errors during insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
