<node id="5 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">5 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 5 mm needle is recommended for adults and children, used at a 90° angle without a skin fold, except in children under 6 years.&lt;SEP&gt;The 5 mm needle doubles the risk of intramuscular injection in young children compared to the 4 mm needle when no skin fold is used.&lt;SEP&gt;A 5 mm needle is a short insulin injection needle suitable for 90-degree insertion.&lt;SEP&gt;A 5 mm needle is a short insulin injection needle suitable for all age groups, providing safe and less painful subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">6 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 6 mm needle requires a skin fold for all users and is inserted at a 90° angle in adults and 45° in children and adolescents to avoid intramuscular injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The 6 mm needle triples the risk of intramuscular injection in young children when no skin fold is applied.&lt;SEP&gt;A 6 mm needle is the preferred needle length for insulin injection as it is safer, less painful, and reduces the risk of intramuscular delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A 6 mm needle requires an insertion angle between 45° and 90° in adults and 45° in children to ensure subcutaneous delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A 6 mm needle is used in both syringes and pens, considered safe for subcutaneous injection across different patient populations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="8 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">8 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An 8 mm needle requires a skin fold and is inserted at a 90° angle in adults and 45° in children and adolescents; a 45° angle is recommended for adults with low subcutaneous tissue to prevent intramuscular injection.&lt;SEP&gt;An 8 mm needle requires an angle between 45° and 90° in adults and 45° in children for proper subcutaneous injection.&lt;SEP&gt;An 8 mm needle is used in some insulin injections and is considered appropriate for adults, depending on subcutaneous tissue thickness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reuse of Syringes and Needles">
  <data key="d0">Reuse of Syringes and Needles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reuse of syringes and disposable needles is not recommended due to increased risk of lipodystrophy and infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695171</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sharps disposal involves safely discarding used insulin needles and syringes in puncture-proof containers or designated sharps collectors to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695171</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin Fold">
  <data key="d0">Skin Fold</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin fold technique involves pinching the skin and subcutaneous tissue to ensure proper needle placement and prevent intramuscular insulin injection, especially with longer needles.&lt;SEP&gt;Creating a skin fold, or subcutaneous pinch, helps ensure proper subcutaneous injection by lifting the fat layer away from muscle.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin fold technique involves pinching the subcutaneous tissue during insulin injection to reduce the risk of intramuscular delivery, especially important with longer needles or in individuals with limited subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Article on Insulin Application Techniques">
  <data key="d0">Article on Insulin Application Techniques</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The article provides guidelines on proper insulin injection methods, including equipment selection, technique, and disposal, authored by a group of medical professionals and edited by Marcello Bertoluci.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DOI">
  <data key="d0">DOI</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">DOI is a digital object identifier used to uniquely identify the article on insulin application techniques, with the value 10.29327/557753.2022-4.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Last Revision">
  <data key="d0">Last Revision</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The last revision of the article on insulin application techniques was conducted on 03/02/2022.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U100 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U100 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U100 insulin is a concentration of insulin available in Brazil, with 100 units per milliliter, requiring syringes calibrated in international units.&lt;SEP&gt;U100 insulin contains 100 units per milliliter and is commonly used in insulin pens and syringes calibrated for this concentration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="International Unit">
  <data key="d0">International Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin is prescribed in international units (IU), making it essential to use syringes marked in IU rather than milliliters to prevent dosing inaccuracies.&lt;SEP&gt;The international unit (UI) is the standard measurement for insulin dosage, and using syringes not calibrated in UI increases the risk of dosing errors.&lt;SEP&gt;The international unit (UI) is the standard measurement for prescribing insulin, ensuring accurate and consistent dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696361</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Biphasic Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Biphasic Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Biphasic insulin is a type of insulin suspension that requires homogenization through gentle mixing to maintain proper insulin concentration and action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Homogenization">
  <data key="d0">Homogenization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Homogenization of insulin suspensions like NPH and biphasic insulin involves 20 gentle roll movements to ensure uniform suspension of insulin crystals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695173</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rolling Motion">
  <data key="d0">Rolling Motion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The rolling motion between palms or in a pendulum motion is the recommended technique for homogenizing insulin suspensions before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695173</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Tip">
  <data key="d0">Needle Tip</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The needle tip must show at least one drop of insulin after priming to confirm unobstructed flow in the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695173</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pharmacokinetics">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacokinetics of insulin refers to how the body absorbs, distributes, and eliminates insulin, which is altered when NPH insulin is not properly resuspended.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics refers to the movement and processing of insulin in the body, including absorption, distribution, metabolism, and elimination, with significant intra- and inter-individual variability influenced by multiple factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics refers to the movement and processing of insulin in the body, including absorption, distribution, metabolism, and elimination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df59f6460ce09b02f1576e31831b6eb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pharmacodynamics">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacodynamics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacodynamics refers to the glucose-lowering effect of insulin, which shows high variability when insulin NPH is not adequately homogenized.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695174</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6 mm Syringe">
  <data key="d0">6 mm Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 6 mm syringe is a short-needle insulin injection device recommended for subcutaneous delivery to minimize pain and risk of intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695174</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Application Techniques">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Application Techniques</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin application techniques encompass methods and guidelines for proper insulin administration, including site rotation, device use, and preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695174</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reutilização Da Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Reutilização Da Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reutilização da agulha refers to the practice of reusing insulin injection needles, which is linked to increased risk of complications such as lipohypertrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grupo 1">
  <data key="d0">Grupo 1</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Grupo 1 refers to one of the study groups in which reductions in complications such as lipohypertrophy were observed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grupo 2">
  <data key="d0">Grupo 2</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Grupo 2 refers to a study group that showed a reduction in complications related to insulin injection practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grupo 3">
  <data key="d0">Grupo 3</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Grupo 3 refers to a study group in which no reduction in complications such as lipohypertrophy was observed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin And Subcutaneous Adipose Layer Thickness">
  <data key="d0">Skin And Subcutaneous Adipose Layer Thickness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin and subcutaneous adipose layer thickness affects insulin injection practices and determines appropriate needle length for effective delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pen Devices For Insulin Self-Administration">
  <data key="d0">Pen Devices For Insulin Self-Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pen devices for insulin self-administration are tools designed to improve accuracy and ease of insulin delivery compared to traditional vial and needle methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695175</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn Cartridges">
  <data key="d0">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn Cartridges</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Neutral protamine Hagedorn cartridges are insulin delivery systems whose mixing efficiency has been assessed for pharmacokinetic consistency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695176</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Temperature Of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Storage Temperature Of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage temperature of insulin affects the pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics of insulin mixtures when injected subcutaneously.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695176</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="In-Use Insulin Pens">
  <data key="d0">In-Use Insulin Pens</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">In-use insulin pens are portable insulin delivery devices whose stability and effectiveness can be influenced by environmental temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens currently being used, which can be stored at room temperature up to 30°C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chowdhury S">
  <data key="d0">Chowdhury S</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chowdhury S is a researcher who contributed to a study on errors in insulin therapy in developing countries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695176</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chakraborty Pp">
  <data key="d0">Chakraborty Pp</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chakraborty PP is a co-author of a study on real-life experiences with insulin therapy errors in the developing world.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695176</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Halimi S">
  <data key="d0">Halimi S</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Halimi S is a researcher who participated in developing new insulin delivery guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Halimi S is a co-author of the new insulin delivery recommendations for diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7da978df74ee7f686dcc3c260d75577</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hicks D">
  <data key="d0">Hicks D</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
