<node id="Skin Thickness">
  <data key="d0">Skin Thickness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin thickness varies by age and body region, influencing the choice of needle length and injection technique to ensure proper insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin thickness varies by age group and injection site, with measurements ranging from 1.58 mm in younger children's arms to 2.29 mm in adolescents' buttocks.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin thickness varies by age and body site, influencing the choice of needle length to ensure insulin is delivered into subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ea5432a4b376d5a48f31d6694c76d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin Fold Technique">
  <data key="d0">Skin Fold Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The skin fold technique involves lifting a fold of skin during injection and is recommended for children aged ≤6 years when using a 4 mm needle to ensure subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695185</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fixed-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Fixed-Needle Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fixed-Needle Syringe is a medical device designed for insulin administration, featuring a needle that is permanently attached to the syringe barrel. This design eliminates dead space or residual volume, significantly reducing the risk of dosing inaccuracies and ensuring precise delivery of insulin. The absence of dead space also enhances safety by minimizing insulin waste and preventing potential contamination, making it particularly suitable for subcutaneous injections.

These syringes are widely recommended for the safe preparation and accurate dosing of insulin, especially when mixing two types of insulin in a single injection. The fixed attachment of the needle prevents the need for needle changes during the mixing process, thereby maintaining sterility and reducing the chance of errors. This feature is critical in clinical settings where accurate insulin combinations are necessary for effective diabetes management.

Fixed-needle syringes are available in standard capacities of 30, 50, and 100 units, all of which are calibrated for precise dose measurement. They typically come equipped with fine-gauge needles, commonly 6 mm, 8 mm, or 12.7 mm in length, to improve patient comfort during injection. Due to their consistent accuracy, ease of use, and safety advantages, fixed-needle syringes are the preferred choice for both healthcare providers and patients in insulin therapy regimens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696365</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Removable-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Removable-Needle Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The removable-needle syringe is discouraged due to higher dead space and lower dose accuracy compared to fixed-needle syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Removable-needle syringes are not recommended for insulin due to dead space, 13 mm long needles increasing hypoglycemia risk, and inaccuracy with odd doses.&lt;SEP&gt;A removable-needle syringe has a detachable needle, typically graduated in 2-unit increments, and may lead to dosing inaccuracies due to residual space.&lt;SEP&gt;A removable-needle syringe has a detachable needle, a 13 mm needle length, and a significant dead space that can waste insulin and increase the risk of intramuscular injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A removable-needle syringe has a capacity of 100 insulin units and is typically graduated, but carries a higher risk of dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696361</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dead Space">
  <data key="d0">Dead Space</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dead space refers to the volume in a syringe that does not deliver medication; fixed-needle syringes have less dead space than removable-needle syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Dead space refers to the volume in the syringe tip or needle hub that retains insulin during injection, leading to product waste and potential dosing inaccuracies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Patient Preference">
  <data key="d0">Patient Preference</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Patient preference studies indicate a tendency to favor insulin pens over syringes, although some tools used were not validated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695187</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence Summary">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Summary</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The evidence summary supports clinical benefits of insulin pens over syringes but advises cautious interpretation due to study limitations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695187</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Injection Site Rotation">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Site Rotation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection site rotation is a recommended practice to prevent complications such as lipodystrophy by varying the locations of insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695187</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Room Temperature Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Room Temperature Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Room temperature insulin is stored up to 30°C during use and results in slower absorption and delayed peak plasma insulin levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must reach room temperature before use to prevent air bubbles that could affect delivery accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc61f77b003d0086bd985ddb94fc2a98</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707424</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daily Insulin Dose">
  <data key="d0">Daily Insulin Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The average daily insulin dose was 56 UI/day for patients with lipohipertrophy and 41 UI/day for those without, indicating higher usage and healthcare costs in affected individuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695188</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unexplained Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Unexplained Hypoglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Unexplained hypoglycemia occurred in 39.1% of patients with lipohipertrophy compared to 5.9% in those without, indicating poor glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695189</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multicenter Study">
  <data key="d0">Multicenter Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A multicenter study in Spain involving 430 diabetic patients evaluated insulin injection techniques and prevalence of lipodystrophy in primary and specialty care settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695189</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Spain">
  <data key="d0">Spain</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Spain is the country where a multicenter study involving 430 diabetic patients was conducted to assess insulin injection techniques and lipodystrophy prevalence.&lt;SEP&gt;Spain is a country where Accu-Chek Solo customer support is available via a toll-free number and website.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5fdff66ffcd1f4d4e10a8825e7905c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/IFU Accu-Chek Guide Solo Diabetes Manager.PDF</data>
  <data key="d5">1778704616</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Cartridges">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Cartridges</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin cartridges are sealed insulin containers used in insulin pens, recommended to be stored refrigerated (2–8°C) until use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695191</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Application Technique">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Application Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin application technique encompasses proper injection site rotation, needle disposal, and storage practices to prevent complications and ensure effective insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of instructions for applying insulin using pen devices, including preparation, injection, and disposal steps.&lt;SEP&gt;A procedure detailing the correct steps for administering insulin, including preparation, injection, and disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin application technique refers to the proper method of administering insulin, which should be reviewed during consultations and demonstrated by the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696137</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treatment Adherence">
  <data key="d0">Treatment Adherence</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d2">Meta-analyses show improved adherence and persistence with insulin pens compared to vial and syringe methods.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695243</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plasma Insulin Peak">
  <data key="d0">Plasma Insulin Peak</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a2bb9a343108d712fe87613f1b48d18</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigerated insulin results in an earlier and higher peak of free insulin in plasma (2.5 vs 6 hours) compared to room temperature insulin.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695248</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U100 Syringe">
  <data key="d0">U100 Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U100 syringes are calibrated for use with U100 insulin, marked in insulin units (UI), and available in 100, 50, and 30-unit capacities for precise dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695399</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Health Center">
  <data key="d0">Health Center</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A health center is the designated facility where patients should deliver their filled sharps containers for proper disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695400</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Step-by-Step Insulin Administration">
  <data key="d0">Step-by-Step Insulin Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A standardized procedure for safe insulin injection involving preparation, mixing, dosing, injection at 45° or 90°, and proper disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695401</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U40 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U40 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U40 insulin is a type of insulin with a different concentration, requiring specific syringes calibrated for U40 to ensure accurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;U40 insulin contains 40 units per milliliter and requires specific syringes calibrated for this concentration to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U200 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U200 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U200 insulin is a higher-concentration insulin formulation that requires special syringes or pens designed for U200 to prevent dosing errors.&lt;SEP&gt;U200 insulin contains 200 units per milliliter and requires specialized syringes or pens designed for high-concentration insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U500 Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U500 Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">U500 insulin is a highly concentrated insulin used in specific cases, necessitating specialized syringes or delivery devices calibrated for U500.&lt;SEP&gt;U500 insulin contains 500 units per milliliter and is used for patients with high insulin resistance, requiring precise administration tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intravenous Injection">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intravenous injection refers to administering insulin directly into a vein, used in emergency medical situations for immediate effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695401</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intradermal Injection">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intradermal injection involves delivering insulin into the very superficial layer of the skin, which delays insulin action and may reduce effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695402</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Buttock">
  <data key="d0">Buttock</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The buttock is an insulin injection site with one of the slowest insulin absorption rates, often used for longer-acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695403</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Longer Than 8 mm">
  <data key="d0">Needle Longer Than 8 mm</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Needles longer than 8 mm must be injected at a 45-degree angle and are not recommended for children due to risk of intramuscular delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695404</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Used Needle Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Used Needle Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Used needle disposal involves placing used needles in a proper sharps container to prevent injury and contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695406</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cold">
  <data key="d0">Cold</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cold from cold compresses or cold baths slows insulin absorption, potentially increasing blood sugar levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Massage">
  <data key="d0">Massage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Massaging the injection site after insulin administration speeds up absorption and increases hypoglycemia risk; it should be avoided.&lt;SEP&gt;Massage of the injection site accelerates insulin absorption and should be avoided, especially in children, to prevent hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695950</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Skin Fold">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Skin Fold</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous skin fold is a technique used during insulin injection to ensure the needle reaches the fatty tissue beneath the skin and not the muscle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adolescents And Adults With Low Body Fat">
  <data key="d0">Adolescents And Adults With Low Body Fat</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Adolescents and adults with low body fat at the injection site are advised to use the subcutaneous skin fold technique to prevent intramuscular insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695409</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Short Needles">
  <data key="d0">Short Needles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Short needles, typically 4 mm or 5 mm in length, are used for insulin injection and often require a 90-degree insertion angle, especially in adults with sufficient subcutaneous fat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695410</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Longer Needles">
  <data key="d0">Longer Needles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Longer needles, such as 6 mm or 8 mm, may require an insertion angle of 45° to 90° depending on patient age and body composition to ensure proper subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695410</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alta Fluência">
  <data key="d0">Alta Fluência</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A feature of certain insulin pen needles with thinner walls that allow faster insulin flow, reducing injection force and time, improving comfort and confidence in dose delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695413</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fabricante">
  <data key="d0">Fabricante</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The manufacturer of the insulin pen, whose cartridges must be used with the corresponding reusable pen to ensure proper dosing and functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Fabricante é a empresa responsável pela produção da insulina e que fornece orientações sobre armazenamento e transporte.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696081</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cold Bath">
  <data key="d0">Cold Bath</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Taking a cold bath may delay insulin action and lead to higher blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A cold bath slows insulin absorption due to vasoconstriction, increasing the risk of hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695951</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Short Needle">
  <data key="d0">Short Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Short needles (4, 5, or 6 mm) are recommended for insulin injection to reduce pain and improve comfort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695415</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Vessel">
  <data key="d0">Blood Vessel</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">If an insulin needle touches a blood vessel during injection, it may cause sharp pain but does not result in serious harm.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Vessels are bodily structures that carry blood, from which glucose moves into interstitial fluid for measurement by sensors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5904918561a819f1c95321943d91162</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707468</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cuidador">
  <data key="d0">Cuidador</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cuidador é responsável por auxiliar no tratamento e deve repetir os procedimentos de aplicação de insulina após orientação profissional.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protocolos Bem Definidos">
  <data key="d0">Protocolos Bem Definidos</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Protocolos bem definidos são necessários nos hospitais para garantir a segurança no uso de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prescrição Eletrônica">
  <data key="d0">Prescrição Eletrônica</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Prescrição eletrônica é utilizada para evitar erros de escrita em receitas médicas, especialmente com insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treinamento Contínuo">
  <data key="d0">Treinamento Contínuo</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Treinamento contínuo dos profissionais de saúde é essencial para a segurança na administração de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dupla Checagem">
  <data key="d0">Dupla Checagem</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dupla checagem é um procedimento obrigatório na preparação e aplicação de insulina nos hospitais para prevenir erros.&lt;SEP&gt;Double-checking is a safety practice recommended for high-risk medications like insulin to prevent errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Educação Do Paciente">
  <data key="d0">Educação Do Paciente</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Educação do paciente deve começar na internação e é fundamental para o entendimento correto sobre o uso de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abreviações Em Receitas Médicas">
  <data key="d0">Abreviações Em Receitas Médicas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abreviações em receitas médicas são comuns, mas podem causar confusão e aumentar o risco de erros medicamentosos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695418</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Botão Da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Botão Da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Botão da caneta is a component of an insulin pen that facilitates easier and more secure dose application.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695418</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin Care">
  <data key="d0">Skin Care</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin care involves keeping the injection area clean and dry, inspecting for abnormalities, and using alcohol only when necessary.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695419</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="45° Injection Angle">
  <data key="d0">45° Injection Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">45° injection angle is a recommended technique during pregnancy to safely deliver insulin into subcutaneous tissue without reaching muscle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695419</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Canetas Reutilizáveis De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Canetas Reutilizáveis De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Canetas reutilizáveis de insulina são dispositivos aplicadores duráveis fornecidos pelo SUS para uso contínuo com tubetes de insulina, oferecendo maior praticidade, segurança e redução de desperdício em comparação ao uso de seringas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SUS">
  <data key="d0">SUS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">O Sistema Único de Saúde (SUS) é a organização responsável por fornecer gratuitamente as canetas reutilizáveis de insulina, tubetes, agulhas e outros insumos para pessoas com diabetes no Brasil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tubete De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Tubete De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tubete de insulina é um recipiente de 3 mL que contém insulina NPH ou Regular e é inserido na caneta reutilizável para administração da dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Descartável">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Descartável</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha descartável é um componente usado na caneta reutilizável para aplicação da insulina, fornecido pelo SUS e que não deve ser reutilizado nem armazenado acoplado à caneta.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pessoa Com Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Pessoa Com Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pessoa com diabetes é o usuário do sistema SUS que recebe a caneta reutilizável de insulina e é responsável por assinar o termo de recebimento e utilizar o dispositivo conforme as orientações.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Termo De Recebimento">
  <data key="d0">Termo De Recebimento</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">Termo de Recebimento é um documento assinado pela pessoa com diabetes ou seu responsável que comprova o recebimento da caneta reutilizável pelo SUS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Período De Utilização">
  <data key="d0">Período De Utilização</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">O período de utilização da caneta reutilizável é de até 3 anos, podendo ser substituída em caso de quebra ou perda mediante apresentação de Boletim de Ocorrência.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Boletim De Ocorrência">
  <data key="d0">Boletim De Ocorrência</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">Boletim de Ocorrência é um documento necessário para justificar a reposição da caneta reutilizável em caso de perda ou quebra antes do período de 3 anos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descarte Consciente">
  <data key="d0">Descarte Consciente</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Descarte consciente é o procedimento recomendado para o descarte seguro de insumos, especialmente agulhas, em recipientes apropriados como caixas descartáveis ou frascos de plástico grosso.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes.org.br">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes.org.br</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes.org.br is a website associated with an organization providing information and resources related to diabetes in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes.org.br is a resource providing information and recommendations for people with diabetes regarding insulin management.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes.org.br é uma organização que fornece informações e recomendações sobre o uso de canetas reutilizáveis de insulina e cuidados com o diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da856b53f3f79b4175182f3d6a359f9a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695512</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="3 mL Tubete">
  <data key="d0">3 mL Tubete</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 3 mL tubete is a standardized insulin cartridge designed for use with reusable insulin pens, containing either NPH or Regular insulin and allowing precise dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Reutilizável De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Reutilizável De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Caneta Reutilizável de Insulina is a durable insulin delivery device provided by the SUS, composed of a body and cap, featuring a dose selector, injection button, and screw mechanism for attaching needles and loading insulin tubetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60fe44346c0b02882f7625cbf43d8ca0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Regular">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Regular</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Regular is a clear insulin type, often used in combination with Insulin NPH, requiring separate insulin pens to avoid confusion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Of Insulin Cartridges">
  <data key="d0">Storage Of Insulin Cartridges</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Unopened insulin cartridges must be refrigerated between 2 and 8°C, not frozen, and kept away from the freezer or fridge door.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Of In Use Pen">
  <data key="d0">Storage Of In Use Pen</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin pen in use must be kept dry and at a maximum temperature of 30°C, and should not be stored in a refrigerator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Technical Note 84/2021">
  <data key="d0">Technical Note 84/2021</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Technical Note 84/2021 CGAFB/DAF/SCTIE/MS outlines the distribution policy for insulin needles, specifying quantities per user type.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Three Year Validity">
  <data key="d0">Three Year Validity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin pen has a three-year validity from first use, after which it must be replaced through the Municipal Health Secretariat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Municipal Health Secretariat">
  <data key="d0">Municipal Health Secretariat</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Municipal Health Secretariat is responsible for the replacement of insulin pens when they reach the end of their three-year lifespan or are damaged.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695514</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Health Unit">
  <data key="d0">Health Unit</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Health Unit is a medical facility where individuals with diabetes can seek guidance from pharmacists and obtain insulin supplies.&lt;SEP&gt;The nearest health facility where used insulin needles and lancets should be delivered for proper disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695605</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Term Of Commitment And Responsibility">
  <data key="d0">Term Of Commitment And Responsibility</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Term Of Commitment And Responsibility is a document signed by the person with diabetes or their guardian, acknowledging receipt of insulin pens and understanding of proper use, storage, and disposal procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b3b45cb29102851f76174e378f8e0cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695514</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Reutilizável">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Reutilizável</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta reutilizável é um dispositivo médico utilizado para administração de insulina, com vida útil de até 3 anos após o primeiro uso.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de80027ca96b7501497bcb85811b669d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695514</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secretaria Municipal De Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Secretaria Municipal De Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Secretaria Municipal de Saúde é responsável pela reposição de canetas de insulina em casos específicos como perda, avaria ou vencimento.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de80027ca96b7501497bcb85811b669d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695514</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="e-SUS">
  <data key="d0">e-SUS</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">O e-SUS é o sistema utilizado pelos profissionais de saúde para registrar a entrega de canetas, orientações e evolução do atendimento.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de80027ca96b7501497bcb85811b669d</data>
