  <data key="d0">Universidade Federal do Ceará - UFC</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A federal university associated with the Hospital Universitário Walter Cantídio and involved in diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;A federal university in Ceará, Brazil, associated with HUWC and involved in diabetes care and training.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
