</node>
<node id="Rapid Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Rapid Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of insulin including Regular (Humulin R, Novolin R), with an open-pen shelf life of 30 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Slow Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Slow Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of insulin including NPH, with an open-pen shelf life of 30 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ultra-Slow Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Ultra-Slow Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of insulin including Lantus®, Levemir®, and Tresiba®, with varying shelf lives after opening: 30, 45, and 56 days respectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ultra-Rapid Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Ultra-Rapid Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of insulin including Humalog®, Novorapid®, and Apidra®, each with a 30-day shelf life after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sealed Insulin Pens">
  <data key="d0">Sealed Insulin Pens</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin pens that are unopened and should be stored in a designated place in the refrigerator, above the vegetable drawer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Sizes">
  <data key="d0">Needle Sizes</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Available needle lengths include 4mm, 5mm, 6mm, 8mm, and 12mm, influencing the injection angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="45 Degree Angle">
  <data key="d0">45 Degree Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An injection angle used for insulin administration, typically for children or with longer needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="90 Degree Angle">
  <data key="d0">90 Degree Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An injection angle used for insulin administration in adults, especially with shorter needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e68da6d45eb01c249e854b711007d805</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hands Washing">
  <data key="d0">Hands Washing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The act of washing hands with soap and water before insulin administration to maintain hygiene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695665</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Site Prega">
  <data key="d0">Injection Site Prega</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The technique of pinching the skin at the injection site to ensure proper subcutaneous delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695666</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air Bubble Removal">
  <data key="d0">Air Bubble Removal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The step of expelling air from the syringe before insulin injection to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695666</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Dose Aspiration">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Dose Aspiration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of drawing the correct insulin dose into the syringe, with Regular insulin drawn before NPH when mixing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Collection Point">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Collection Point</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A designated facility, such as the nearest health post, where used sharps containers are delivered for safe disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serviço de Endocrinologia e Diabetes - SED">
  <data key="d0">Serviço de Endocrinologia e Diabetes - SED</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Endocrinology and Diabetes Service responsible for developing insulin use guidelines and patient education.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Nurses and Nursing Residents">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Nurses and Nursing Residents</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare professionals from SED who developed the insulin administration guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Vial Shelf Life">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Vial Shelf Life</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The opened insulin vial has a shelf life of 30 to 45 days, with rapid and slow types both valid for 30 days after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Centro Integrado de Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Centro Integrado de Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Centro Integrado de Diabetes (CID) is an organization responsible for diabetes care and provides guidelines on insulin handling and administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Empresa Brasileira de Serviços Hospitalares Hospital Universitário Dr. Miguel Riet Corrêa Jr. Hu-Furg/Ebserh">
  <data key="d0">Empresa Brasileira de Serviços Hospitalares Hospital Universitário Dr. Miguel Riet Corrêa Jr. Hu-Furg/Ebserh</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Empresa Brasileira de Serviços Hospitalares Hospital Universitário Dr. Miguel Riet Corrêa Jr. Hu-Furg/Ebserh is a Brazilian hospital organization that hosts the Centro Integrado de Diabetes and provides contact and location information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unidade de Comunicação Social">
  <data key="d0">Unidade de Comunicação Social</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unidade de Comunicação Social (UCS) is responsible for the revision and layout of the insulin handling document.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rua Visconde de Paranaguá">
  <data key="d0">Rua Visconde de Paranaguá</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Rua Visconde de Paranaguá is the street address of the hospital, located in the city center of Rio Grande, RS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rio Grande">
  <data key="d0">Rio Grande</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Rio Grande is the city in the state of Rio Grande do Sul (RS), Brazil, where the hospital is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Frasco de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Frasco de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco de Insulina is a sealed container used to store insulin before use, requiring refrigeration between 2°C and 8°C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Descartável de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Descartável de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta Descartável de Insulina is a pre-filled insulin delivery device used for subcutaneous injection, stored under specific temperature conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Recarregável de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Recarregável de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta Recarregável de Insulina is a reusable insulin delivery device that requires refilling and is stored at room temperature after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695741</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parede Abdominal">
  <data key="d0">Parede Abdominal</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Parede Abdominal is a recommended site for insulin injection, specifically the lateral regions, at least three fingers away from the navel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695741</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Coxas">
  <data key="d0">Coxas</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Coxas are a recommended site for insulin injection, specifically the front and outer lateral region, between three fingers below the groin and above the knee.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695741</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CID">
  <data key="d0">CID</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CID is an acronym for Centro Integrado de Diabetes, an organization providing diabetes care and insulin administration guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695742</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="UCS">
  <data key="d0">UCS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">UCS is an acronym for Unidade de Comunicação Social, responsible for the revision and layout of the insulin handling document.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695742</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Preparation Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Preparation Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Preparation Procedure involves handwashing, gathering materials, rolling cloudy insulin vials, disinfecting the vial stopper, injecting air into the vial, drawing the correct dose, removing air bubbles, and capping the syringe.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695742</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Administration Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Administration Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Administration Protocol includes selecting an appropriate injection site, rotating sites to prevent lipohipertrophy, cleaning the skin with alcohol, allowing it to dry, and creating a skin fold before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51960dcc8f6bd8e9d62d3512fa1e35af</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695742</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Luciane M.H. Fernandes">
  <data key="d0">Luciane M.H. Fernandes</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible person mentioned in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible for the Novolin N Flexpen product information.&lt;SEP&gt;Luciane M.H. Fernandes is the technical responsible for the Novolin N Flexpen product information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68f15567df531c98c7bb5ae57a2836b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diretrizes Da Em">
  <data key="d0">Diretrizes Da Em</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diretrizes da em is a set of guidelines related to diabetes management, available online and accessed on June 17, 2021.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68f15567df531c98c7bb5ae57a2836b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bula De Remédio">
  <data key="d0">Bula De Remédio</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Bula de remédio refers to a medication leaflet containing information about a pharmaceutical product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68f15567df531c98c7bb5ae57a2836b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Algodão Embebido Em Álcool 70%">
  <data key="d0">Algodão Embebido Em Álcool 70%</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Algodão embebido em álcool 70% is used to clean the skin before insulin injection to prevent infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695743</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abdômen">
  <data key="d0">Abdômen</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Abdômen is a recommended site for insulin injection in pregnant women during the first and second trimesters when using a 4mm needle and forming a skin fold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695744</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Músculo">
  <data key="d0">Músculo</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Músculo refers to muscle tissue; accidental insulin injection into the muscle can lead to hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Músculo é um tecido onde a insulina facilita o transporte intracelular de glicose e aminoácidos e promove o anabolismo proteico.&lt;SEP&gt;Músculo é um tecido onde a insulina promove o transporte intracelular de glicose e aminoácidos, além de estimular o anabolismo e inibir o catabolismo proteico.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b24ac2a9beff09325af7272be567cf82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e5674b4a4db2a056560132addcc354</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699610</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Fixa">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Fixa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha fixa refers to syringes with permanently attached needles, required for safe insulin mixing to prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695745</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descarte De Serings E Agulhas">
  <data key="d0">Descarte De Serings E Agulhas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Descarte de seringas e agulhas involves disposing of used medical sharps in rigid containers and through healthcare services to prevent injury and environmental harm.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695745</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transporte Da Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Transporte Da Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transporte da insulina requires carrying insulin in hand luggage, avoiding direct sunlight and extreme temperatures, and using thermal bags with gel packs when necessary.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695745</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manual Prático Preparo E Aplicação De Insulina Sem Mistério">
  <data key="d0">Manual Prático Preparo E Aplicação De Insulina Sem Mistério</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Manual Prático Preparo e Aplicação de Insulina Sem Mistério is a 2015 guide on insulin preparation and administration.&lt;SEP&gt;A practical guide published in 2015 providing instructions on insulin preparation and application, available online.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Novolin N Flexpen">
  <data key="d0">Novolin N Flexpen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin N Flexpen is an injectable suspension of human insulin produced by Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda.&lt;SEP&gt;An injectable suspension of human insulin produced by Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda, Montes Claros, in 2019.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diretrizes Da Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Diretrizes Da Sociedade Brasileira De Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diretrizes da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes is a 2019–2020 publication providing comprehensive clinical guidelines for diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical guidelines published in 2019–2020 by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes, providing updated standards for diabetes care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696409</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="1cm">
  <data key="d0">1cm</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">1cm is the recommended average distance between insulin injection sites to prevent tissue damage and ensure proper absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695746</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="14 Dias">
  <data key="d0">14 Dias</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">14 dias is the recommended interval before repeating an insulin injection at the same site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c897fc79a7dde2715e95be7ca23f57f5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695746</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protetor Externo">
  <data key="d0">Protetor Externo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Protetor externo é utilizado para remover a agulha com segurança após a aplicação.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recipiente Próprio">
  <data key="d0">Recipiente Próprio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Recipiente próprio é destinado ao descarte seguro de agulhas usadas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Tampa da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa da caneta é recolocada após o uso para proteger a agulha e manter a higiene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Canetas Descartáveis">
  <data key="d0">Canetas Descartáveis</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Canetas descartáveis são dispositivos médicos preenchidos com agonistas do GLP-1 ou insulinas associadas a agonistas do GLP-1, usados no tratamento do diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agonistas do GLP-1">
  <data key="d0">Agonistas do GLP-1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agonistas do GLP-1 são medicamentos usados no tratamento do diabetes que mimetizam o efeito do hormônio GLP-1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulinas">
  <data key="d0">Insulinas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulinas são hormônios ou análogos usados no controle glicêmico, incluindo em terapias com bomba ou canetas.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulinas são medicamentos usados no tratamento do diabetes, incluindo durante a gravidez, e podem interagir com outros fármacos e afetar o metabolismo da glicose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Terapia com Bomba de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Terapia com Bomba de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Terapia com bomba de insulina é uma forma de tratamento que utiliza um dispositivo eletrônico para infusão programada de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dispositivo Eletrônico">
  <data key="d0">Dispositivo Eletrônico</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dispositivo eletrônico é o componente central do SICI, responsável pela infusão programada de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Análogo de Insulina Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Análogo de Insulina Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Análogo de insulina rápida, como lispro, asparte e glulisina, é usado no SICI para fornecer insulina basal e bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liberação Basal">
  <data key="d0">Liberação Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Liberação basal é a infusão contínua de insulina fornecida pelo SICI para manter níveis glicêmicos entre refeições.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liberação Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Liberação Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Liberação bolus é a dose adicional de insulina fornecida pelo SICI antes das refeições ou para correção de hiperglicemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservatório de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Reservatório de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reservatório de insulina é o compartimento da bomba que armazena o análogo de insulina para infusão.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conjunto de Infusão">
  <data key="d0">Conjunto de Infusão</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Conjunto de infusão é composto por cateter e cânula, conectando o reservatório ao tecido subcutâneo para a infusão de insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha-Guia">
  <data key="d0">Agulha-Guia</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha-guia é usada para inserir a cânula no tecido subcutâneo e removida após a colocação.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bateria">
  <data key="d0">Bateria</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bateria, geralmente do tipo AAA alcalina, alimenta o funcionamento do dispositivo eletrônico do SICI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lispro">
  <data key="d0">Lispro</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lispro is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asparte">
  <data key="d0">Asparte</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Asparte is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glulisina">
  <data key="d0">Glulisina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glulisina is a rapid-acting insulin analog used in continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8792cad0fa7c0226f159b670b4e743a1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Institute for Safe Medication Practices">
  <data key="d0">Institute for Safe Medication Practices</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Institute for Safe Medication Practices (ISMP) is an organization that evaluates and classifies medications, identifying insulin as a high-alert medication due to its potential risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Institute for Safe Medication Practices is an organization that provides guidelines for the safe use of medications, including insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695943</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Insulin Delivery Recommendations">
  <data key="d0">New Insulin Delivery Recommendations</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Insulin Delivery Recommendations is a study published in May 2016 that provides updated guidelines for the safe preparation and administration of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of updated guidelines for insulin delivery published in Mayo Clinic Proceedings in 2016.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7da978df74ee7f686dcc3c260d75577</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Injection Pain">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Pain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection pain refers to discomfort experienced during insulin administration, which can be reduced through proper techniques and equipment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695944</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shorter Needles">
  <data key="d0">Shorter Needles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Shorter needles, such as those measuring 4, 5, or 6 mm in length, are recommended to reduce pain and improve comfort during insulin injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695944</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="70% Alcohol">
  <data key="d0">70% Alcohol</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">70% alcohol is used to disinfect the skin before insulin injection and must be allowed to dry completely to prevent irritation.&lt;SEP&gt;70% alcohol is used as a disinfectant to clean the rubber stopper of an insulin vial before use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695945</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Heparin">
  <data key="d0">Heparin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Heparin is an injectable anticoagulant that, like insulin, requires proper storage and differentiation in handling to avoid medication errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695946</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vaccines">
  <data key="d0">Vaccines</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vaccines are biological products that require specific refrigeration and storage conditions, and should be separated from insulin and heparin to prevent mix-ups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Route">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intramuscular route is occasionally used in emergencies for insulin delivery, leading to faster absorption and increased risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intravenous Route">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intravenous route is used in intensive care settings under strict monitoring, allowing immediate insulin effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intradermal Route">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The intradermal route results in slower insulin absorption and risk of dose loss, potentially leading to hyperglycemia if used incorrectly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695947</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Ambient Temperature">
  <data key="d0">High Ambient Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High ambient temperature accelerates insulin absorption and increases the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695950</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Bath">
  <data key="d0">Hot Bath</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A hot bath increases local blood flow and speeds up insulin absorption, potentially causing hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695950</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Compress">
  <data key="d0">Hot Compress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A hot compress applied to an injection site increases insulin absorption rate by enhancing local circulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695950</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Human Insulin Analog">
  <data key="d0">Human Insulin Analog</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Human insulin analogs have consistent absorption rates across all recommended injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695952</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Homogenization">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Homogenization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin homogenization is the process of mixing suspension-type insulins like NPH and premixed formulations to ensure uniform concentration before use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin homogenization is the process of mixing insulin suspensions to suspend insulin crystals, ensuring accurate dosing and predictable clinical response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Premixed Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Premixed Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Premixed insulin contains a combination of short- and intermediate-acting insulins and must be homogenized before use.&lt;SEP&gt;Premixed insulin refers to formulations combining different types of insulin, which require correct homogenization prior to administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Expiration">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Expiration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin expiration refers to the date after which insulin should not be used, requiring proper tracking from the date of first use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin expiration refers to the limited shelf life of insulin after opening, typically 4 to 8 weeks, and depends on storage conditions and manufacturer guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Appearance">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Appearance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin appearance must be checked before use to detect any physical changes indicating degradation or improper storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin appearance refers to its visual state, such as clarity, presence of particles, or color change, which must be checked before use to ensure safety and efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696081</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safe Insulin Practices">
  <data key="d0">Safe Insulin Practices</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Safe insulin practices include proper storage, labeling, homogenization, administration technique, and patient education to prevent errors and complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Labeling">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Labeling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin labeling involves clear identification and differentiation of insulin from other injectables like heparin and vaccines to prevent mix-ups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Visual Alerts">
  <data key="d0">Visual Alerts</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Visual alerts are safety mechanisms used in healthcare settings to highlight insulin and prevent administration errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Professional Inexperience">
  <data key="d0">Professional Inexperience</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Professional inexperience contributes to insulin-related errors due to lack of training or familiarity with protocols.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Packaging Similarity">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Packaging Similarity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin packaging similarity increases the risk of medication errors due to confusion with other injectables like heparin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distraction">
  <data key="d0">Distraction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distraction during insulin preparation or administration can lead to errors in dosing or route of delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lack of Alert Systems">
  <data key="d0">Lack of Alert Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The absence of alert systems in healthcare settings increases the likelihood of insulin administration errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695954</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Team Training">
  <data key="d0">Team Training</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Team training refers to ongoing education for healthcare professionals on insulin safety protocols and best practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695955</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use">
  <data key="d0">Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use is a regional organization that identifies insulin as a high-risk medication prone to errors in prescribing, preparation, and administration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Latin American Network for Safe Medication Use provides recommendations for the safe use of insulin and other medications in the region.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695955</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Individuals">
  <data key="d0">Individuals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals are the recipients of insulin injections and must follow proper injection techniques, including site rotation and skin inspection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695955</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Educator">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Educator</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes educators are specialists who teach individuals about insulin therapy, emphasizing the importance of proper injection techniques and site rotation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695955</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="45° Angle">
  <data key="d0">45° Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A 45° angle is recommended for insulin injection in certain cases, such as during pregnancy, to ensure proper delivery into subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695956</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IM">
  <data key="d0">IM</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IM refers to intramuscular injection, which carries a high risk for insulin administration in all individuals and should be avoided.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695956</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uterine Expansion">
  <data key="d0">Uterine Expansion</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Uterine expansion during pregnancy leads to thinning of subcutaneous tissue, affecting insulin injection technique and site selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-48b0f8a5b356409be05a1e866ce0ed8d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Pinch">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Pinch</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The subcutaneous pinch is a technique used during insulin injection to lift the skin and underlying fat to prevent intramuscular injection and reduce discomfort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Reflux">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Reflux</data>
  <data key="d1">phenomenon</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin reflux is the unintended backflow of insulin from the injection site, which can occur if the needle is removed too quickly after injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HbA1c Levels">
  <data key="d0">HbA1c Levels</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">HbA1c levels are a measure of long-term blood glucose control, which can be reduced through proper insulin injection techniques such as using a subcutaneous pinch.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695957</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Injection Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A medical procedure involving the preparation and administration of insulin using a syringe or pen device.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin injection procedure includes steps such as creating a subcutaneous pinch, inserting the needle at the correct angle, injecting the dose, maintaining needle position for several seconds, and releasing the pinch after needle removal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180dc3d244f7d832cf505b09cfc34746</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Dwell Time">
  <data key="d0">Needle Dwell Time</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle dwell time refers to the period the needle remains in the subcutaneous tissue after insulin injection, recommended to be at least 5 seconds for syringes and 10 seconds for insulin pens to prevent reflux.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe Plunger">
  <data key="d0">Syringe Plunger</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The syringe plunger must be kept pressed for at least 5 seconds after insulin injection to ensure complete delivery and prevent insulin reflux.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Third Trimester Of Pregnancy">
  <data key="d0">Third Trimester Of Pregnancy</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The third trimester of pregnancy is a critical period during which abdominal insulin injections should be avoided to ensure maternal and fetal safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Needle">
  <data key="d0">Injection Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The injection needle is a medical device used to deliver insulin into the subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Refill">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Refill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin refill is a replaceable cartridge containing insulin used in injection devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695959</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Reflux">
  <data key="d0">Blood Reflux</data>
  <data key="d1">phenomenon</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood reflux refers to the backward flow of blood into the needle or insulin reservoir after injection, which should be prevented.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Extra-Thin Wall Needle Technology">
  <data key="d0">Extra-Thin Wall Needle Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Extra-thin wall needle technology refers to needles with a larger internal diameter that reduce resistance and improve insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Insulin Dose">
  <data key="d0">High Insulin Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">High insulin dose refers to larger volumes of insulin that may require special administration techniques to ensure effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin vial rubber stopper is the seal on an insulin vial that must be disinfected before needle insertion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695960</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vacuum Formation">
  <data key="d0">Vacuum Formation</data>
  <data key="d1">phenomenon</data>
  <data key="d2">Vacuum formation in an insulin vial can hinder insulin aspiration and may cause cross-contamination when mixing insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695961</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina R">
  <data key="d0">Insulina R</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina R is a type of regular insulin administered in a dose of 8 units, leading to hypoglycemia in the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695962</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Enfermeira">
  <data key="d0">Enfermeira</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A nurse aspirated 0.68 mL of regular insulin using a 1 mL syringe not intended for insulin preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695962</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seringa de 1 mL">
  <data key="d0">Seringa de 1 mL</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A 1 mL syringe graduated in mL, not designed for insulin preparation, was used incorrectly to measure insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695962</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Técnico de Enfermagem">
  <data key="d0">Técnico de Enfermagem</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A nursing technician administered 4 units of NPH insulin without shaking the vial, resulting in improper dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695963</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Responsável">
  <data key="d0">Responsável</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The caregiver kept the needle attached to the insulin pen after use, causing air entry and insulin leakage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695963</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Práticas Seguras para Preparo e Aplicação de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Práticas Seguras para Preparo e Aplicação de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of safe practices for insulin preparation and administration aimed at preventing medication errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protocolos Técnicos">
  <data key="d0">Protocolos Técnicos</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Technical protocols should be established to standardize high-risk medication procedures, including insulin handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Educação Continuada">
  <data key="d0">Educação Continuada</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuing education is necessary for healthcare professionals and patients to understand insulin types, devices, and risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Curta">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Curta</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A short needle is recommended for insulin injection to ensure subcutaneous delivery and reduce the risk of intramuscular administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha com 13 mm de Comprimento">
  <data key="d0">Agulha com 13 mm de Comprimento</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A 13 mm needle is considered long for insulin injection and increases the risk of intramuscular administration, leading to faster absorption and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Frascos-Ampola de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Frascos-Ampola de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">container</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin vials are containers that hold insulin medication and must be properly agitated before use when containing suspensions like NPH.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin pen is a device used for administering insulin, which requires removal of the needle after each use to prevent leakage and air entry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tempo de Ação das Insulinas">
  <data key="d0">Tempo de Ação das Insulinas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The duration and onset of insulin activity vary by type, and misunderstanding this can lead to hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695967</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Risco de Aplicação IM">
  <data key="d0">Risco de Aplicação IM</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intramuscular injection of insulin increases absorption speed and the risk of hypoglycemia, especially with long needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695967</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Desconhecimento das Diferenças entre Escalas de Seringas">
  <data key="d0">Desconhecimento das Diferenças entre Escalas de Seringas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lack of knowledge about syringe graduations can lead to dosing errors when using mL syringes instead of insulin-specific syringes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695967</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Desperdício de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Desperdício de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin waste occurs due to leakage from pens with attached needles or improper handling, leading to inadequate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695967</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descontrole Glicêmico">
  <data key="d0">Descontrole Glicêmico</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic instability results from incorrect insulin preparation or administration, manifesting as hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695968</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="5 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">5 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 5 mm needle is suitable for all individuals and generally does not require a skin fold, except in children under six years old, inserted at a 90-degree angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695968</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">6 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 6 mm needle requires a skin fold for all users and is inserted at a 90-degree angle for adults and 45-degree for children and adolescents to prevent intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695968</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="12 To 13 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">12 To 13 Mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 12 to 13 mm needle carries a high risk of intramuscular injection in all individuals, requires a skin fold, and must be inserted at a 45-degree angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695968</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High-Flow Needle">
  <data key="d0">High-Flow Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">High-flow needles have extra-thin walls that improve insulin flow, reduce injection force and time, and increase user confidence in complete insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Tissue Scarcity">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Tissue Scarcity</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous tissue scarcity refers to insufficient fatty tissue at injection sites, requiring adjustments such as skin folds or shorter needles to avoid intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Injection Risk">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Injection Risk</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intramuscular injection risk is the danger of delivering insulin into muscle tissue instead of subcutaneous tissue, which can alter absorption and is associated with longer needles or improper technique.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sistema Único De Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Sistema Único De Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sistema Único de Saúde is the public healthcare system in Brazil that began dispensing disposable insulin pens in 2019 to improve insulin treatment access.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695969</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2019">
  <data key="d0">2019</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">In 2019, the Sistema Único de Saúde initiated the distribution of disposable insulin pens, marking a significant advancement in diabetes care in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695970</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hirsch Et Al">
  <data key="d0">Hirsch Et Al</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hirsch et al. conducted a study on insulin injection using 4 mm, 5 mm, and 8 mm needles, finding the 4 mm needle to be safe and well-tolerated with minimal insulin leakage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695970</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tremor">
  <data key="d0">Tremor</data>
  <data key="d1">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">Tremor or similar conditions may impair a person's ability to hold an insulin pen and 4 mm needle, necessitating assistance or the use of longer needles for self-administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb18b1ccdbe7c3a6bbce149470c1ca1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695970</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin Pinch">
  <data key="d0">Skin Pinch</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin pinch is a technique used during insulin injection to lift the subcutaneous tissue and prevent intramuscular injection, typically performed with the thumb and index finger.&lt;SEP&gt;Skin pinch is a technique where the patient lifts a fold of skin before injection to ensure insulin is delivered into the subcutaneous tissue, especially recommended for children using 4 mm needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b2243846b349d5b78af57a8e77b6ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695971</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="50-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">50-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 50-unit insulin syringe is graduated to allow precise measurement of odd-numbered insulin doses, suitable for pediatric and adolescent patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695971</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="30-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">30-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 30-unit insulin syringe is graduated to allow precise measurement of odd-numbered insulin doses, suitable for pediatric and adolescent patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695971</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="100-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">100-Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 100-unit insulin syringe has a capacity for 100 units of insulin and is typically graduated in 2-unit increments, making it unsuitable for odd-numbered doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695971</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Pen Needle">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pen Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin pen needle is a short, disposable needle attached to an insulin pen, available in lengths such as 4 mm, 5 mm, and 6 mm for safe subcutaneous injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lo Presti et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Lo Presti et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Lo Presti et al. study examined skin thickness in children and adolescents aged 2–17 years, supporting the use of short needles (4–6 mm) for safe insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695973</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gibney et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Gibney et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Gibney et al. study found that adult epidermal and dermal thickness rarely exceeds 3 mm, supporting the universal use of short needles (4–8 mm) for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695974</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hirsch et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Hirsch et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hirsch et al. study evaluated insulin injection using 4, 5, and 8 mm needles to assess safety and efficacy across different needle lengths.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695974</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Injection Technique">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Injection Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous injection technique refers to the proper method of administering insulin into the subcutaneous tissue to ensure effective absorption and minimize complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695974</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forearm">
  <data key="d0">Forearm</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The forearm is a body location where insulin should not be administered, as it is not recommended for subcutaneous injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695974</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ISMP (Brasil)">
  <data key="d0">ISMP (Brasil)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ISMP (Brasil) is an organization that issues safety bulletins on medication use, including recommendations for safe insulin prescription and administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695974</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Double-Check Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Double-Check Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The double-check procedure is a safety practice in healthcare, particularly in nursing, to verify insulin preparation and administration accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electronic Health Record">
  <data key="d0">Electronic Health Record</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">An electronic health record system supports safe insulin use by enabling digital and standardized medical and nursing prescriptions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuing Education">
  <data key="d0">Continuing Education</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuing education is a practice recommended for healthcare professionals to reduce medication errors and improve insulin safety protocols.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Administration Through Clothing">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Administration Through Clothing</data>
  <data key="d1">unsafepractice</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin administration through clothing is unsafe because it prevents proper site inspection, skin fold formation, and correct injection angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6.8 Units Of Insulin R">
  <data key="d0">6.8 Units Of Insulin R</data>
  <data key="d1">dosage</data>
  <data key="d2">6.8 units of Insulin R is a specific insulin dose that was incorrectly prepared using a 1 mL syringe, leading to hypoglycemia due to measurement error.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hospital Discharge Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Hospital Discharge Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">Hospital discharge preparation for insulin therapy should begin at the time of admission to ensure patient safety and continuity of care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc6a188926df383900f31928c8726a8f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695975</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin in Use">
  <data key="d0">Insulin in Use</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin in use refers to insulin that has been opened and is being actively administered, with a shelf life of 4 to 8 weeks after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695976</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sealed Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Sealed Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sealed insulin is unopened insulin that remains in its original packaging and has a longer shelf life of 2 to 3 years when refrigerated.&lt;SEP&gt;Sealed insulin must be stored under refrigeration between 2 and 8°C and is valid for 2 to 3 years from the manufacturing date.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696137</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dosing Error">
  <data key="d0">Dosing Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dosing error refers to incorrect insulin dosage delivery, which can result from air bubbles, improper syringe use, or incorrect device handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695976</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thermal Packaging">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Packaging</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermal packaging or Styrofoam containers are used for insulin transport but require precautions to prevent direct contact between insulin and ice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695976</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Site Pain">
  <data key="d0">Injection Site Pain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection site pain and irritation can occur if cold insulin is injected directly; insulin should be removed from the refrigerator 15 to 30 minutes before use to minimize discomfort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778695976</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manufacturer Guidelines">
  <data key="d0">Manufacturer Guidelines</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Manufacturer guidelines provide specific instructions for the storage, handling, and use of insulin and related devices to ensure safety and efficacy.</data>
