<node id="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn">
  <data key="d0">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Neutral Protamine Hagedorn (NPH) is a type of insulin suspension that must be homogenized before use to ensure proper concentration and clinical effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thermal Insulated Container">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Insulated Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A thermal insulated container or cooler may be used for insulin transport, provided precautions are taken to prevent freezing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696360</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Packaging">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Packaging</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin packaging refers to the original container in which insulin is supplied, which should be retained during storage to protect from light and physical damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696360</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metal Or Plastic Container With Lid">
  <data key="d0">Metal Or Plastic Container With Lid</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A metal or plastic container with a lid is recommended for storing insulin in the refrigerator to protect it from light and temperature fluctuations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696361</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
