  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clinical Practice">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Practice</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical practice involves the administration of insulin using appropriate syringes and techniques, including mixing insulin types and precise dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="100 Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">100 Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 100 unit syringe is a type of insulin syringe with a capacity for 100 international units of insulin, commonly used in clinical settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="50 Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">50 Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 50 unit syringe is designed for precise measurement of small and odd insulin doses, allowing accurate administration for patients requiring lower dosages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="30 Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d0">30 Unit Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A 30 unit syringe enables accurate registration of small and odd insulin doses, particularly suitable for children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Residual Space">
  <data key="d0">Residual Space</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Residual space refers to the dead volume in some syringes where medication can remain; fixed-needle syringes do not have this space, improving dosing accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c66bff09b476d15a54c71ff3efac594d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Milliliter Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Milliliter Syringe</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d2">Syringes graduated in milliliters should not be used for insulin due to the high risk of dosing errors, as insulin is prescribed in international units.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696369</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hand Baggage">
  <data key="d0">Hand Baggage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Hand baggage includes items like bags or fanny packs used to carry insulin during travel to ensure proper temperature control and safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778696408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Healthcare Team">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The healthcare team provides guidance on insulin management, including safe application and adjustments for physical activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The healthcare team provides medical guidance and emergency support for diabetes management, especially during high ketone levels or illness.&lt;SEP&gt;The healthcare team consists of medical professionals involved in the management and interpretation of diabetes data for patient care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca576cb8eccfdd91ed235c273f829e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec727091282384bd8f9c91eb1d29b78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aeabf750656ceb7619502d5fd50ebe6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778709307</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IDeg">
  <data key="d0">IDeg</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">IDeg (insulin degludec) is a long-acting basal insulin analog compared with insulin detemir in clinical trials for use in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;IDeg is the abbreviated form of insulin degludec, used as a basal insulin in combination with bolus insulin aspart in the treatment of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-590fb2f5c50ef31a5fd415bb01def92d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698042</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IAsp">
  <data key="d0">IAsp</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">IAsp (insulin aspart) is used as bolus insulin in combination with basal insulin analogs like IDet or IDeg in the treatment of type 1 diabetes in pediatric patients.&lt;SEP&gt;IAsp is the abbreviated form of insulin aspart, used as a bolus insulin in combination with basal insulin analogs in diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-590fb2f5c50ef31a5fd415bb01def92d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698042</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort">
  <data key="d0">Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort is a clinical study group collecting real-world data on insulin detemir use in type 1 diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort is a clinical study group in Belgium that followed type 1 diabetic patients using insulin detemir in routine clinical practice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acta Clinica Belgica">
  <data key="d0">Acta Clinica Belgica</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Acta Clinica Belgica is a medical journal that published the 26-week follow-up study on insulin detemir in type 1 diabetic patients from the Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort.&lt;SEP&gt;Acta Clinica Belgica is a medical journal that published research on insulin detemir in routine clinical practice from the Belgian PREDICTIVE Cohort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Experimental and Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Experimental and Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental and Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes is a journal publishing research on endocrine and metabolic disorders, including studies on insulin variability.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental and Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes is a journal publishing research on endocrine therapies, including studies comparing insulin detemir and NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetic Medicine">
  <data key="d0">Diabetic Medicine</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetic Medicine is a journal publishing clinical research on diabetes, including studies comparing insulin detemir with NPH insulin in type 1 diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic Medicine is a journal publishing clinical research on diabetes treatments, including long-term efficacy and safety studies of insulin detemir versus NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic Medicine is a journal that published a meta-analysis by Pickup J et al. on severe hypoglycemia and glycemic control in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab57247c382bad8d5f1e5eb84a62e24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702617</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Study NN 2211-1842">
  <data key="d0">Study NN 2211-1842</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study NN 2211-1842 is a 26-week randomized, open-label, parallel-group, multicentre, multinational trial investigating the effect of insulin detemir in combination with liraglutide and metformin in subjects with type 2 diabetes, with a 26-week extension.&lt;SEP&gt;Study NN 2211-1842 is a 26-week randomized, open-label, parallel-group, multicentre, multinational trial investigating the effect of insulin detemir combined with liraglutide and metformin versus liraglutide and metformin alone in subjects with type 2 diabetes, with a 26-week extension.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Study NN 304-1687">
  <data key="d0">Study NN 304-1687</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study NN 304-1687 is a randomized, parallel-group, open-labelled, multinational trial comparing the efficacy and safety of insulin detemir (Levemir®) versus human insulin (NPH insulin) in pregnant women with type 1 diabetes, using insulin aspart as bolus insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Study NN 304-1687 is a randomized, parallel-group, open-label, multinational trial comparing the efficacy and safety of insulin detemir (Levemir®) versus NPH insulin, both used with insulin aspart as bolus insulin, in pregnant women with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Study NN 1250-3561">
  <data key="d0">Study NN 1250-3561</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study NN 1250-3561 is a randomized, multi-national, multi-centre, two-arm parallel group, treat-to-target trial comparing insulin degludec (IDeg) and insulin detemir (IDet) as basal insulin, with insulin aspart (IAsp) as bolus insulin, in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Study NN 1250-3561 is a randomized, multi-national, multi-centre, two-arm, parallel-group, treat-to-target trial comparing insulin degludec (IDeg) and insulin detemir (IDet) as basal insulins with insulin aspart (IAsp) as bolus insulin in pediatric subjects with type 1 diabetes aged 1 to less than 18 years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698045</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Robertson Kj">
  <data key="d0">Robertson Kj</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Robertson Kj is an author of a comparative study on insulin detemir versus NPH insulin in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Robertson KJ is a researcher who compared insulin detemir with NPH insulin in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ced7d025f7f3232d1a0e28251b0fb63a</data>
