</node>
<node id="NovoFine">
  <data key="d0">NovoFine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NovoFine are disposable needles designed for use with Novo Nordisk insulin delivery systems and must not be shared between patients.&lt;SEP&gt;NovoFine refers to disposable needles designed for use with Novo Nordisk insulin delivery systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdd292edf157383567920d27a920c13f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc07da1fd30cc15e0022830f701a9c38</data>
