  <data key="d1">regulation</data>
  <data key="d2">RDC 60/12 is a regulatory guideline governing changes to drug labeling and package insert texts in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;RDC 60/12 is a regulatory resolution issued by ANVISA that governs changes to drug labeling in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;RDC 60/12 is a regulatory framework governing drug labeling and leaflet publication in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;RDC 60/12 refers to a regulatory framework or resolution governing the publication of drug labeling information in Brazil.</data>
