  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Posologia e Modo de Usar refers to the dosage instructions and method of administration for a medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Posologia e Modo de Usar is a section in the leaflet detailing dosage and administration instructions for HUMULIN R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c04e4797bbd8720e9c40ccd6a195cf12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68</data>
