  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Reações Adversas are the potential side effects or adverse events associated with the use of a medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Reações Adversas is a section in the leaflet listing potential adverse effects associated with HUMULIN R.</data>
