  <data key="d2">Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento refers to the recommended conditions for storing the medication to maintain its efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento refers to storage instructions for HUMULIN R as specified in the leaflet.</data>
