<node id="Ganho de Peso">
  <data key="d0">Ganho de Peso</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ganho de peso is a side effect associated with insulin therapy, with Levemir linked to less weight gain compared to NPH and glargine insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
