<node id="Estudo NN304-1689">
  <data key="d0">Estudo NN304-1689</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo NN304-1689 is a randomized controlled trial evaluating the efficacy and safety of Levemir in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo NN304-1689 is a randomized controlled trial evaluating the efficacy and safety of Levemir in pediatric and adolescent patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo NN304-1689 is a clinical trial comparing Levemir and NPH insulin, involving 347 patients, assessing glycemic control, hypoglycemia, and weight change.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173</data>
