</node>
<node id="Estudo NN304-1379">
  <data key="d0">Estudo NN304-1379</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo NN304-1379 is a randomized controlled trial assessing Levemir compared to NPH insulin in pediatric patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo NN304-1379 is a clinical trial assessing Levemir in children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes over a period exceeding 12 months.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo NN304-1379 is a clinical trial comparing Levemir and NPH insulin in 347 patients, evaluating long-term outcomes including HbA1c, hypoglycemia, and BMI change.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698083</data>
