  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudo NN1250-3561 is a clinical study evaluating Levemir in pediatric patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudo NN1250-3561 is a randomized controlled study investigating Levemir in young patients with type 1 diabetes, contributing to the safety and efficacy data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133</data>
