<node id="Ácido Clorídrico">
  <data key="d0">Ácido Clorídrico</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ácido clorídrico is used in the formulation of Levemir to adjust pH.&lt;SEP&gt;Ácido clorídrico é um excipiente presente na formulação do Novolin® R, utilizado para ajuste de pH.&lt;SEP&gt;Ácido clorídrico is an excipient used to adjust the pH of the insulin solution in Novolin® R Penfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Ácido clorídrico is an excipient used to adjust the pH of the Novolin® R FlexPen® solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-581b6c5da621e9091266d2b0e1919308</data>
