  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fosfato de sódio dibásico di-hidratado is a buffer component in the Levemir formulation to maintain pH stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee</data>
