<node id="Novo Nordisk Farm. Do Brasil Ltda.">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk Farm. Do Brasil Ltda.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk Farm. Do Brasil Ltda. is the pharmaceutical company responsible for manufacturing and distributing Levemir® FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Saccharomyces Cerevisiae">
  <data key="d0">Saccharomyces Cerevisiae</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Saccharomyces cerevisiae is a yeast used in recombinant DNA technology to produce insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae is a yeast used in recombinant DNA technology to produce insulin detemir for Levemir® Penfill®.&lt;SEP&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae é o organismo utilizado na produção de insulina humana por meio da tecnologia de DNA recombinante.&lt;SEP&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae is a yeast used in recombinant DNA technology to produce human insulin for Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae is a yeast used in recombinant DNA technology to produce human insulin for Novolin® R Penfill.&lt;SEP&gt;Saccharomyces cerevisiae is a yeast used in recombinant DNA technology to produce human insulin for Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-581b6c5da621e9091266d2b0e1919308</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698972</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recombinant DNA Technology">
  <data key="d0">Recombinant DNA Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Recombinant DNA technology is the method used to produce insulin detemir by inserting genetic material into Saccharomyces cerevisiae for protein expression.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycerol">
  <data key="d0">Glycerol</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycerol is an excipient in Levemir® FlexPen® solution, used to maintain isotonicity.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycerol is an excipient in Levemir® Penfill® solution, used to maintain isotonicity and stability of the insulin formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycerol is an excipient in Novolin® R used to maintain isotonicity and stability of the insulin solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698995</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Phenol">
  <data key="d0">Phenol</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Phenol is an excipient in Levemir® FlexPen® solution, serving as a preservative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metacresol">
  <data key="d0">Metacresol</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Metacresol is an excipient used as a preservative in various pharmaceutical formulations, particularly in insulin products, to maintain sterility and prevent microbial contamination. It is a key component in multiple insulin delivery systems, including pre-filled pens and penfill cartridges, ensuring the safety and stability of the injectable solutions over time.

Specifically, metacresol is present in Levemir® FlexPen® and Levemir® Penfill® solutions, where it functions to preserve the sterility of the insulin formulation. In addition, it is included in several formulations of Novolin® R, including Novolin® R Penfill and Novolin® R FlexPen®, serving the same preservative role in these injectable insulin products. The compound is also used in Humulin R, where it acts as a preservative in the injectable solution, and is recognized as part of the formulation in various insulin preparations under the Humulin brand.

Across these products, metacresol consistently performs as an antimicrobial agent, safeguarding the integrity of the insulin solution during multi-dose use. Its inclusion in a range of insulin delivery systems from different manufacturers highlights its established role and regulatory acceptance in diabetes treatment regimens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-581b6c5da621e9091266d2b0e1919308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67bb351395e7176e28675caef7c9b6f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91d6c1005cdb303d60e909b05fe5abb4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699580</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zinc Acetate">
  <data key="d0">Zinc Acetate</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Zinc acetate is an excipient in Levemir® FlexPen® solution, contributing to the stabilization and prolonged action of insulin detemir.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
