<node id="Thyroid Hormones">
  <data key="d0">Thyroid Hormones</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Thyroid hormones can increase insulin needs by accelerating metabolic rate and glucose turnover.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid hormones can increase metabolic rate and insulin needs in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid hormones can increase insulin needs by accelerating metabolic rate and glucose turnover.</data>
