<node id="Growth Hormone">
  <data key="d0">Growth Hormone</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Growth hormone has anti-insulin effects and can increase insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Growth hormone has anti-insulin effects and may increase insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Growth hormone can increase insulin needs by inducing insulin resistance.</data>
