  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Octreotide is a somatostatin analog that can either increase or decrease insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Octreotide is a medication that can either reduce or increase insulin requirements depending on individual response.&lt;SEP&gt;Octreotide is a somatostatin analog that can either reduce or increase insulin requirements depending on the patient's metabolic response.&lt;SEP&gt;Octreotide is a medication that can either reduce or increase insulin requirements in patients.</data>
