  <data key="d2">Lanreotide is a somatostatin analog that can either increase or decrease insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanreotide is a drug similar to octreotide that may affect insulin needs in either direction.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanreotide is a somatostatin analog that may either reduce or increase insulin needs in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Lanreotide is a medication that can either reduce or increase insulin requirements in patients.</data>
