<node id="Novo Nordisk A/S">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk A/S</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk A/S is a Danish pharmaceutical company headquartered in Bagsværd, Denmark, specializing in the research, development, and production of pharmaceutical products, particularly insulin therapies. The company is a leading manufacturer of diabetes care products and is globally recognized for its contributions to insulin treatment solutions, including the production of Levemir insulin and various delivery devices.

The company owns several registered trademarks critical to its product portfolio, including Levemir®, Novolin®, FlexPen®, NovoFine®, and Penfill®. These trademarks cover a range of insulin formulations and delivery systems designed to improve patient convenience and treatment efficacy. Levemir® is a long-acting insulin analog, while Novolin® refers to a series of human insulin products used in diabetes management. The FlexPen® and NovoFine® trademarks are associated with innovative injection devices and needles, respectively, enhancing the usability of insulin therapy.

In addition to manufacturing and trademark ownership, Novo Nordisk A/S holds the copyright for product documentation related to its pharmaceutical offerings, underscoring its role in maintaining regulatory compliance and providing accurate medical information. As a Denmark-based pharmaceutical leader, the company plays a significant role in global diabetes care, combining product innovation with comprehensive intellectual property protection across its key brands and technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef496454c12f85ff1f62de19e8a22be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad7b7e8e5212b6d7ea0f4b0505f82c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
