  <data key="d2">MedDRA is a standardized medical terminology system used to classify adverse reactions according to organ systems and frequency categories.&lt;SEP&gt;MedDRA is the Medical Dictionary for Regulatory Activities, used to classify adverse reactions by organ system in pharmaceutical reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;MedDRA is a medical classification system used to categorize adverse reactions by organ system and frequency in clinical and post-marketing data.</data>
