<node id="Chartres">
  <data key="d0">Chartres</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Chartres is a city in France where Novo Nordisk Production SAS operates a production facility for Levemir® FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;Chartres is a city in France where one of the Novo Nordisk production facilities is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="São José dos Pinhais">
  <data key="d0">São José dos Pinhais</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São José dos Pinhais is a city in Paraná, Brazil, where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. imports the product.&lt;SEP&gt;São José dos Pinhais is a city in Paraná, Brazil, where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. imports and registers the medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698995</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anvisa">
  <data key="d0">Anvisa</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Anvisa is the Brazilian health regulatory agency responsible for regulating, monitoring, and ensuring the safety of health products and services in Brazil, with a particular focus on medications. It plays a central role in approving drug-related documentation, including product leaflets, labeling, and bulletins, ensuring that accurate and up-to-date information is provided to healthcare professionals and the public. Specific approvals attributed to Anvisa include the leaflet for a medication approved on September 12, 2021, and the product insert for Novolin® R FlexPen® on April 17, 2026, highlighting its ongoing involvement in pharmaceutical oversight.

A key component of Anvisa’s pharmacovigilance efforts is its management and operation of the VigiMed system, a national platform designed for the reporting and monitoring of adverse events related to health products. This system is accessible through a dedicated portal, reinforcing Anvisa’s role in facilitating transparent and efficient surveillance. The agency is consistently described as overseeing pharmacovigilance activities through VigiMed, underscoring its institutional responsibility in post-market safety monitoring. By integrating regulatory approval functions with active safety surveillance, Anvisa ensures a comprehensive approach to public health protection in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bad7b7e8e5212b6d7ea0f4b0505f82c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699586</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
