</node>
<node id="Bula do Profissional Levemir® FlexPen®">
  <data key="d0">Bula do Profissional Levemir® FlexPen®</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Bula do Profissional Levemir® FlexPen® is the professional package insert containing detailed medical and pharmaceutical information about the Levemir® FlexPen® product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698103</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Data de Aprovação pela Anvisa">
  <data key="d0">Data de Aprovação pela Anvisa</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Data de Aprovação pela Anvisa refers to the date when the product’s leaflet was approved by Anvisa, which is 09/12/2021.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ca90008a805c9c66eac7ba65db90fdb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698104</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carpule">
  <data key="d0">Carpule</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A carpule is a small cartridge containing 3 mL (300 units) of Levemir® Penfill® insulin solution for use in insulin pens.&lt;SEP&gt;Carpule is the insulin reservoir within the Levemir® FlexPen® that holds the insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Carpule is a small glass container holding 3 mL of insulin solution, used in insulin pens and featuring a plunger and cap.&lt;SEP&gt;The carpule is a container holding 3 mL of insulin solution (300 UI), equipped with a plunger and cap, used in the Novolin® R Penfill delivery system.&lt;SEP&gt;The carpule is the container for Novolin® R Penfill® insulin, designed to be loaded into an insulin pen and stored protected from light within its outer packaging.&lt;SEP&gt;The carpule is a small container holding the Novolin® R Penfill® insulin solution, which must remain in its outer packaging to protect it from light.&lt;SEP&gt;Carpule is the insulin reservoir within the Novolin® R FlexPen® that may accumulate air bubbles during normal use, requiring priming before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62a6c42a674563e36382f398efac64a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a0b8b861ae9af417a572907fe16408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698948</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Selector">
  <data key="d0">Dose Selector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The dose selector is a component of the Levemir® FlexPen® used to set the required insulin dose before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose selector is a component of the Novolin® R FlexPen® used to set the required number of insulin units for injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Button">
  <data key="d0">Injection Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The injection button on the Levemir® FlexPen® must be pressed fully to deliver the insulin dose and should only be activated during injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection button is part of the Novolin® R FlexPen® that, when fully pressed, delivers the selected insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Indicator">
  <data key="d0">Dose Indicator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The dose indicator on the Levemir® FlexPen® shows the selected insulin dose and must align with zero after injection to confirm full delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698104</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Residual Scale">
  <data key="d0">Residual Scale</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The residual scale on the Levemir® FlexPen® provides an approximate indication of remaining insulin in the cartridge but should not be used for precise dose measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;The residual scale is a feature on the Novolin® R FlexPen® that provides an approximate indication of remaining insulin in the cartridge but should not be used for precise dose selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Countdown">
  <data key="d0">Countdown</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Countdown refers to the 6-second period during which the injection button must remain pressed after insulin delivery to ensure complete dose administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698104</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Contamination">
  <data key="d0">Contamination</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Contamination is a risk if the needle is left attached to the Levemir® FlexPen® after injection, potentially leading to infection or inaccurate dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Contamination is a risk when reusing needles or improper handling, potentially leading to infection or insulin degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cross-Infection">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Infection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cross-infection may occur if needles or insulin pens are shared between individuals, emphasizing the need for personal use only.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-infection is a risk associated with sharing needles or insulin pens, which can transmit diseases between individuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NOVO NORDISK FARM. DO BRASIL LTDA.">
  <data key="d0">NOVO NORDISK FARM. DO BRASIL LTDA.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">NOVO NORDISK FARM. DO BRASIL LTDA. is the manufacturer of Levemir® Penfill® and Levemir® FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fenol">
  <data key="d0">Fenol</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fenol is an excipient in Levemir® Penfill® solution, serving as a preservative to prevent microbial growth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acetate Of Zinc">
  <data key="d0">Acetate Of Zinc</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Acetate of zinc is an excipient in Levemir® Penfill® solution, used to stabilize insulin detemir and prolong its action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dibasic Sodium Phosphate Dihydrate">
  <data key="d0">Dibasic Sodium Phosphate Dihydrate</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dibasic sodium phosphate dihydrate is an excipient in Levemir® Penfill® solution, used as a buffer to maintain pH stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Delivery Device">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Delivery Device</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin delivery device is a medical tool, such as the Levemir® FlexPen®, designed to administer precise doses of insulin subcutaneously.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Farmacocinética de Levemir®">
  <data key="d0">Farmacocinética de Levemir®</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Farmacocinética de Levemir® refers to the absorption, distribution, metabolism, and elimination characteristics of insulin detemir, including a 5-7 hour half-life and low intrapatient variability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Farmacodinâmica de Levemir®">
  <data key="d0">Farmacodinâmica de Levemir®</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Farmacodinâmica de Levemir® includes dose-proportional pharmacodynamic responses, with over 50% of maximum effect occurring between 3-14 hours post-administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AUCGIR 0-24h">
  <data key="d0">AUCGIR 0-24h</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">AUCGIR 0-24h is a pharmacodynamic outcome measure representing the area under the curve of glucose infusion rate over 24 hours.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipersensibilidade">
  <data key="d0">Hipersensibilidade</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipersensibilidade refers to allergic reactions or contraindications related to insulin detemir or its excipients, making Levemir® unsuitable for certain patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crianças 1-5 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Crianças 1-5 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Crianças 1-5 anos are young pediatric patients in whom the pharmacokinetics of Levemir® were studied and found to be similar to those in adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crianças 6-12 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Crianças 6-12 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Crianças 6-12 anos are pediatric patients in whom the pharmacokinetics of Levemir® were evaluated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adolescentes 13-17 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Adolescentes 13-17 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Adolescentes 13-17 anos are adolescent patients studied for Levemir® pharmacokinetics, showing no significant differences compared to adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698106</data>
