</node>
<node id="Pessoas Idosas">
  <data key="d0">Pessoas Idosas</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pessoas idosas are elderly individuals in whom no clinically relevant differences in Levemir® pharmacokinetics were observed compared to healthy subjects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insuficiência Renal">
  <data key="d0">Insuficiência Renal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insuficiência renal refers to impaired kidney function, in which patients showed no clinically relevant differences in Levemir® pharmacokinetics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insuficiência Hepática">
  <data key="d0">Insuficiência Hepática</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insuficiência hepática refers to impaired liver function, with no clinically relevant changes in Levemir® pharmacokinetics observed in affected patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anticorpos Contra Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Anticorpos Contra Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anticorpos Contra Insulina are immune system responses observed during insulin therapy, including with Levemir, but do not negatively impact glycemic control or insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Anticorpos Contra Insulina are immune responses observed during long-term Levemir treatment, which increased initially and then decreased over time without negatively affecting glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tabela 29">
  <data key="d0">Tabela 29</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 29 presents clinical study data showing the sustained weight benefit when Levemir is added to liraglutide in type 2 diabetes treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 29 presents clinical study data on the combination of Levemir, liraglutida, and metformina, including changes in HbA1c, weight, and hypoglycemia rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa Da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Tampa Da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa da Caneta is the pen cap that protects the needle and device when not in use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Escala Residual">
  <data key="d0">Escala Residual</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Escala Residual is the remaining dose indicator on the Levemir® FlexPen® that shows how much insulin is left in the cartridge.&lt;SEP&gt;Escala Residual is a feature on the Novolin® R FlexPen® that indicates the remaining insulin volume in the cartridge.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seletor De Dose">
  <data key="d0">Seletor De Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Seletor de Dose is the dose selector knob on the Levemir® FlexPen® used to set the required insulin units.&lt;SEP&gt;Seletor de Dose is a component of the Novolin® R FlexPen® used to select the insulin dose, ranging from 1 to 60 units.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Botão Injetor">
  <data key="d0">Botão Injetor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Botão Injetor is the injection button on the Levemir® FlexPen® that delivers the insulin dose when pressed.&lt;SEP&gt;Botão Injetor is the mechanism on the Novolin® R FlexPen® that delivers the insulin dose when pressed, resetting the dose selector to zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa Externa">
  <data key="d0">Tampa Externa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa Externa is the outer needle cap that protects the needle before and after use.&lt;SEP&gt;Tampa Externa is the outer cap of the needle that is removed before injection and should be saved for later use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa Interna">
  <data key="d0">Tampa Interna</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa Interna is the inner needle cap that is discarded after first use to prevent needlestick injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;Tampa Interna is the inner needle cap that must be discarded after removal and should never be reattached to avoid needlestick injury.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Selo Protetor">
  <data key="d0">Selo Protetor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Selo Protetor is the protective seal on a new needle that must be removed before attaching it to the Levemir® FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;Selo Protetor is a protective seal on the disposable needle that must be removed before attaching the needle to the Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Inaccuracy">
  <data key="d0">Dose Inaccuracy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose inaccuracy occurs when the intended insulin dose is not delivered, potentially due to air bubbles, blocked needles, or device damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Needle Blockage">
  <data key="d0">Needle Blockage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Needle blockage is a condition where the needle becomes obstructed, preventing insulin from being delivered even if the dose counter moves.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Device Malfunction">
  <data key="d0">Device Malfunction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Device malfunction describes a failure in the Levemir® FlexPen® system that prevents proper insulin delivery, requiring replacement with a new device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698109</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Penfill®">
  <data key="d0">Penfill®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Penfill® is a registered cartridge system used with a reusable pen for administering Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Penfill® is a registered trademark and a type of insulin cartridge system used with injection devices, produced by Novo Nordisk.&lt;SEP&gt;Penfill® is an insulin cartridge system compatible with certain insulin delivery devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bad7b7e8e5212b6d7ea0f4b0505f82c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f59efd4d9af0314b057127c7fefd45c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698980</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
