<node id="Instruções de Uso">
  <data key="d0">Instruções de Uso</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Instruções de Uso are the usage instructions provided with a medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c8be7635129e99145e2508cbd7f95a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698978</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Advertências e Precauções">
  <data key="d0">Advertências e Precauções</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Advertências e Precauções are sections in a drug’s labeling that detail safety information and risk mitigation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c8be7635129e99145e2508cbd7f95a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698978</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento">
  <data key="d0">Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento provides guidelines on how and where to store the medication properly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c8be7635129e99145e2508cbd7f95a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698978</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Posologia e Modo de Usar">
  <data key="d0">Posologia e Modo de Usar</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Posologia e Modo de Usar details the dosage recommendations and administration instructions for the medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c8be7635129e99145e2508cbd7f95a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698979</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Superdose">
  <data key="d0">Superdose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Superdose refers to the administration of insulin in doses higher than required, which can lead to progressive hypoglycemia requiring immediate medical intervention.&lt;SEP&gt;Superdose refers to the condition or scenario of administering an excessive amount of medication, including associated risks and management.&lt;SEP&gt;Superdose refers to an excessive intake of medication, in this case leading to hypoglycemia with associated symptoms and requiring medical intervention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c8be7635129e99145e2508cbd7f95a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699604</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neuropatia Periférica">
  <data key="d0">Neuropatia Periférica</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neuropatia periférica, also described as painful neuropathy, is an uncommon adverse reaction associated with the medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuropatia periférica, specifically painful neuropathy, is an uncommon neurological adverse reaction linked to insulin treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698979</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distúrbios De Refração">
  <data key="d0">Distúrbios De Refração</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distúrbios de refração are uncommon adverse reactions affecting vision, possibly linked to metabolic changes from insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Distúrbios de refração are uncommon visual disturbances that may occur during insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698979</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Novo Nordisk Produção Farmacêutica Do Brasil Ltda.">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk Produção Farmacêutica Do Brasil Ltda.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk Produção Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is the Brazilian manufacturing entity responsible for producing the medication in Montes Claros, MG.&lt;SEP&gt;Novo Nordisk Produção Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is the manufacturer of Novolin® R FlexPen®, located in Montes Claros, MG, Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698980</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica Do Brasil Ltda.">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica Do Brasil Ltda.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is the pharmaceutical company responsible for manufacturing and commercializing Novolin® R in Brazil.&lt;SEP&gt;Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is the Brazilian entity responsible for registering and distributing the medication, located in São Paulo, SP.&lt;SEP&gt;Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is the registrant of Novolin® R FlexPen®, based in São Paulo, SP, Brazil, with CNPJ 82.277.955/0001-55.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1229dbbfb74d991d522a8d53f9383cdc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698980</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Superdose De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Superdose De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Superdose De Insulina refers to the administration of insulin in amounts significantly higher than required, leading to progressive hypoglycemia and potential loss of consciousness.&lt;SEP&gt;Superdose de insulina refers to the administration of insulin in amounts excessively high relative to the patient’s needs, which can lead to progressive hypoglycemia requiring immediate treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698981</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tratamento Da Hipoglicemia">
  <data key="d0">Tratamento Da Hipoglicemia</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Tratamento da hipoglicemia envolve a administração oral de glicose ou produtos açucarados em casos leves, ou uso de glucagon (0,5 a 1 mg) por pessoa treinada ou glicose intravenosa por profissional de saúde em casos graves, seguido de carboidratos orais após recuperação para prevenir recorrência.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1954b944b779698ff7d67b256199d202</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698981</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insuficiência Cardíaca Congestiva">
  <data key="d0">Insuficiência Cardíaca Congestiva</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insuficiência Cardíaca Congestiva é uma condição médica que pode ser agravada pelo uso combinado de tiazolidinedionas e insulinas, exigindo observação clínica.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698981</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tiazolidinedionas">
  <data key="d0">Tiazolidinedionas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tiazolidinedionas são medicamentos que podem causar ou agravar insuficiência cardíaca congestiva e devem ser descontinuados se houver piora dos sintomas cardíacos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Armazenamento Do Medicamento">
  <data key="d0">Armazenamento Do Medicamento</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Armazenamento Do Medicamento envolve manter o Novolin® R refrigerado entre 2°C e 8°C, protegido da luz e do congelamento, com uso válido por 6 semanas após abertura.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transporte Do Medicamento">
  <data key="d0">Transporte Do Medicamento</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transporte Do Medicamento requer proteção térmica, evitando temperaturas extremas, luz direta e vibração, especialmente durante viagens aéreas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Descarte">
  <data key="d0">Descarte</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Descarte refere-se ao processo seguro de eliminação de seringas e medicamentos usados ou vencidos, utilizando embalagens coletoras resistentes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778698982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
