</node>
<node id="São José Dos Pinhais Pr">
  <data key="d0">São José Dos Pinhais Pr</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São José dos Pinhais PR is a city in Paraná, Brazil, where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda imports and distributes pharmaceutical products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clayton">
  <data key="d0">Clayton</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Clayton is a city in the United States where a Novo Nordisk pharmaceutical manufacturing plant is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bula Do Profissional">
  <data key="d0">Bula Do Profissional</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Bula Do Profissional is the professional package insert for Novolin R, containing detailed medical and safety information intended for healthcare providers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Novolin R Penfill">
  <data key="d0">Novolin R Penfill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin R Penfill is a specific formulation and delivery system of human insulin, provided in a cartridge (Penfill) for use with insulin pens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="3 mL Carpule">
  <data key="d0">3 mL Carpule</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 3 mL Carpule is a glass container holding 3 milliliters of insulin solution, used in the Penfill system for insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8646d585dd04c9e67fc11499ede9ae10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electronic Submission">
  <data key="d0">Electronic Submission</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Electronic Submission refers to the digital process of submitting regulatory documents, including updates to drug labeling, to health authorities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bula Do Profissional Da Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Bula Do Profissional Da Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Bula do Profissional da Saúde is the healthcare professional's package insert containing detailed medical and safety information about Novolin® R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Frasco-Ampola Com 10 Ml">
  <data key="d0">Frasco-Ampola Com 10 Ml</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco-ampola com 10 mL is a 10-milliliter vial presentation of Novolin® R insulin for multiple-dose use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application System">
  <data key="d0">Application System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Application System refers to the insulin delivery devices, such as pens or injectors, into which carpules or cartridges are loaded for insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Submission Date">
  <data key="d0">Submission Date</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Submission Date refers to the date when regulatory documentation for bula updates was electronically submitted, such as 15/04/2013 or 28/11/2018.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Expedient Number">
  <data key="d0">Expedient Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Expedient Number is a unique identifier assigned to each regulatory submission, such as 0284579/13-2 or 1167762/18-7.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Initial Inclusion Of Package Insert Text">
  <data key="d0">Initial Inclusion Of Package Insert Text</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Initial Inclusion of Package Insert Text refers to the first-time submission of the bula content for regulatory approval under RDC 60/12.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Notification Of Package Insert Text Change">
  <data key="d0">Notification Of Package Insert Text Change</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Notification of Package Insert Text Change refers to the formal submission to update the bula, as seen on multiple dates from 2018 to 2019.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27ae5fe50adf25db0be3b8cdde6282e9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Infusion System">
  <data key="d0">Infusion System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The infusion system used with Novolin® R FlexPen® includes polypropylene infusion bags containing sodium chloride 0.9%, 5% dextrose, 10% dextrose, and 40 mmol/L potassium chloride, and is stable for 24 hours at room temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2e44a4ca961f1a97305607fa263ed91</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Solution">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Solution</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin solution must be clear and colorless; frozen preparations or cloudy solutions should not be used.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2e44a4ca961f1a97305607fa263ed91</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medication Instructions">
  <data key="d0">Medication Instructions</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin® R FlexPen® comes with a detailed patient information leaflet containing usage instructions that must be followed, including proper handling, dosing, and disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2e44a4ca961f1a97305607fa263ed91</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medication Label Verification">
  <data key="d0">Medication Label Verification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Medication label verification is a recommended practice to prevent accidental mix-ups between Novolin® R and other insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc71d03de36b3a734f3f7eff9922da5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699008</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Selective Beta Blockers">
  <data key="d0">Non-Selective Beta Blockers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-selective beta blockers can mask hypoglycemia symptoms and delay recovery, posing risks for diabetic patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc71d03de36b3a734f3f7eff9922da5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Storage Of Novolin® R">
  <data key="d0">Storage Of Novolin® R</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin® R must be stored refrigerated between 2°C and 8°C before opening, protected from light and heat; after opening, it can be kept at room temperature up to 30°C for 6 weeks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc71d03de36b3a734f3f7eff9922da5d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699009</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Site Rotation">
  <data key="d0">Site Rotation</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df59f6460ce09b02f1576e31831b6eb7</data>
  <data key="d2">Rotating injection sites helps reduce or prevent local reactions such as redness, swelling, and itching.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capacidade De Dirigir">
  <data key="d0">Capacidade De Dirigir</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54b65b433ba47e8bbf2d607b89776246</data>
  <data key="d2">A hipoglicemia pode prejudicar a habilidade do paciente de dirigir ou operar máquinas.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plasma">
  <data key="d0">Plasma</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-001d95b4722fb6304af5e929d80557ac</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin in the bloodstream has a terminal half-life of only a few minutes, indicating rapid elimination from plasma.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699170</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Beta Blockers">
  <data key="d0">Beta Blockers</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc71d03de36b3a734f3f7eff9922da5d</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-selective beta blockers can mask the symptoms of hypoglycemia and delay recovery, increasing danger.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699237</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HUMULIN R">
  <data key="d0">HUMULIN R</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HUMULIN R é uma solução de insulina humana de ação rápida e duração curta, utilizada no controle da glicemia.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R é uma forma de insulina humana em solução injetável, clara e incolor, que deve ser armazenada corretamente e usada dentro de 28 dias após abertura.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R is an injectable solution containing 100 units of human insulin per mL, used for adult and pediatric patients above 3 years.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R is a type of insulin whose dosage requirements may increase during illness or emotional stress.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R is an insulin medication that can be administered subcutaneously, intramuscularly, or intravenously and must not be used if cloudy, viscous, discolored, or containing visible particles.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R é uma preparação de insulina humana de ação rápida, utilizada no tratamento do diabetes, com tempo de início de ação de aproximadamente 6,6 minutos após administração subcutânea.&lt;SEP&gt;HUMULIN R is a medication that, when in excess relative to food intake or energy expenditure, can cause hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19de4016c46aba524b40e489fd60f018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b24ac2a9beff09325af7272be567cf82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e5674b4a4db2a056560132addcc354</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Eli Lilly Do Brasil Ltda">
  <data key="d0">Eli Lilly Do Brasil Ltda</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda is the pharmaceutical company manufacturing and distributing Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda is the pharmaceutical company manufacturing HUMULIN R.&lt;SEP&gt;Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda is the importer and registrant of the insulin product in Brazil, located in São Paulo, SP, with CNPJ 43.940.618/0001-44.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67bb351395e7176e28675caef7c9b6f0</data>
