<node id="Refil 3 Ml">
  <data key="d0">Refil 3 Ml</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Refil 3 mL refers to the 3 mL glass cartridge type I used in compatible insulin pens for administering Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Refil 3 mL is a presentation format of HUMULIN R, containing 3 mL of injectable solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67bb351395e7176e28675caef7c9b6f0</data>
