  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Características Farmacológicas is a section in the drug's leaflet describing the pharmacological properties of HUMULIN R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a402290353e4c1eaad827dec818b0f68</data>
