<node id="HUMULIN N">
  <data key="d0">HUMULIN N</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HUMULIN N is an insulin product whose contents can be mixed with HUMULIN R according to patient-specific metabolic needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis">
  <data key="d0">Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Localized cutaneous amyloidosis is a condition at the injection site caused by repeated insulin injections, potentially resulting in hyperglycemia when injections are administered in affected areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Localized cutaneous amyloidosis is a skin condition that can occur at insulin injection sites and may affect insulin absorption if injections are repeated in affected areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Localized cutaneous amyloidosis is a potential complication of repeated insulin injections in the same site, and insulin should not be injected into affected areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e097e2326548df575159ee000923b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699579</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VigiMed System">
  <data key="d0">VigiMed System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">The VigiMed System is a reporting platform used to notify adverse events related to medications, managed through the Anvisa portal.&lt;SEP&gt;The VigiMed System is a reporting platform available on the Anvisa portal for notifying adverse events related to medications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699579</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lilly">
  <data key="d0">Lilly</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lilly is the pharmaceutical company that produces Humulin R and designs its refils for compatibility with their reusable insulin pens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699580</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta Aplicadora">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Aplicadora</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The caneta aplicadora is a reusable insulin pen device required to administer Humulin R from the refil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699581</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alergia Local">
  <data key="d0">Alergia Local</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alergia local is a common reaction to insulin injection, characterized by redness, swelling, and itching at the injection site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699582</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alergia Sistêmica">
  <data key="d0">Alergia Sistêmica</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alergia sistêmica is a very rare but serious generalized allergic reaction to insulin, potentially causing systemic symptoms like rash, breathing difficulties, and hypotension.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699582</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bombas de Infusão Subcutânea Contínua">
  <data key="d0">Bombas de Infusão Subcutânea Contínua</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bombas de infusão subcutânea contínua are medical devices that can deliver continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion, compatible with Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699582</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Doenças">
  <data key="d0">Doenças</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Doenças such as those with nausea and vomiting can alter insulin requirements, requiring patients to follow a daily plan with their doctor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699583</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exercícios">
  <data key="d0">Exercícios</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Exercícios can reduce the body's need for insulin and accelerate insulin action, especially if involving the injection site area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699583</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Viagem">
  <data key="d0">Viagem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Viagem across time zones of more than two hours requires adjustment of insulin administration regimen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699583</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipoatrofia">
  <data key="d0">Lipoatrofia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipoatrofia is a rare adverse effect of subcutaneous insulin injection, characterized by skin depression at the injection site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae828242172f4312fe9a98e8d49f3311</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699583</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
