  <data key="d0">Exames Não Laboratoriais</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Exames Não Laboratoriais são avaliações clínicas cujas interações com HUMULIN R não foram estudadas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699601</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Controle da Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Controle da Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">O controle cuidadoso dos níveis de glicose é necessário em pacientes com insuficiência hepática que usam insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699601</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ajuste de Dose">
  <data key="d0">Ajuste de Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">O ajuste de dose de insulina pode ser necessário em resposta a mudanças na dieta, atividade física, gravidez ou uso de outros medicamentos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6398afdc8e1faa94220df6d070a1ade7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699601</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Systemic Allergy">
  <data key="d0">Systemic Allergy</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Systemic allergy is a rare but serious adverse reaction to insulin, potentially causing whole-body rash, breathing difficulties, wheezing, low blood pressure, rapid pulse, or sweating, and may be life-threatening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699601</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Concentrated Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Concentrated Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Concentrated glucose administered intravenously is a treatment for severe hypoglycemia, particularly when neurological symptoms are present.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699602</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lilly France S.A.S.">
  <data key="d0">Lilly France S.A.S.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lilly France S.A.S. is the manufacturer of the insulin product, located in Fegersheim, France.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699602</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lilly Sac">
  <data key="d0">Lilly Sac</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lilly SAC is the customer service division of Eli Lilly, providing support via phone number 0800 701 0444, email sac_brasil@lilly.com, and website www.lilly.com.br.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699602</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prescription Requirement">
  <data key="d0">Prescription Requirement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin product is available only under medical prescription, as indicated by the statement "Venda sob prescrição."</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778699602</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bula Update History">
  <data key="d0">Bula Update History</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The bula update history documents electronic submissions, petition numbers, dates of approval, and changes to the product's leaflet, including initial inclusion and subsequent modifications published in the RDC 60/12 registry.</data>
