<node id="Frasco-ampola 10 mL">
  <data key="d0">Frasco-ampola 10 mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco-ampola 10 mL is a pharmaceutical presentation of HUMULIN R, containing 10 milliliters in a vial form.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d717433722cc9ac8e746440493df9010</data>
