  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Menu Principal is the main interface of the device, providing access to various functions such as bolus, automatic mode, and audio settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu Principal is the main interface of the device, providing access to various settings and functions such as audio options, screen settings, and basal patterns.</data>
