  <data key="d0">Modo Automatico</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Modo Automatico is a function that enables the device to automatically regulate insulin delivery based on sensor input.&lt;SEP&gt;Modo Automatico is an operational mode of the insulin pump that automatically adjusts insulin delivery based on sensor data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
