  <data key="d0">Alertas Alta Y Baja</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Alertas Alta Y Baja is a method that enables both high and low glucose level alerts on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;Alertas Alta Y Baja are user-configurable alerts for high and low blood glucose levels, set to trigger when values fall below 70 or exceed a defined threshold.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61911be532419242af177a0b5feeb72</data>
