<node id="Duracion">
  <data key="d0">Duracion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Duracion is a method used to set the time period for which alert silencing or temporary modes remain active.&lt;SEP&gt;Duracion refers to the duration of active insulin, which is the time period during which insulin continues to lower blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4f908910b79b1f9ccf095fd5fb4035</data>
