  <data key="d0">Vibracion</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Vibracion is a method that enables vibration alerts as a notification mechanism on the device.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibracion is a notification setting that can be enabled or disabled to provide haptic feedback on the device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
