<node id="Estado">
  <data key="d0">Estado</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Estado is a menu option that displays the current operational status of the insulin pump, including infusion and connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Estado refers to the status information of the insulin pump, including remaining insulin and system alerts.</data>
