<node id="Estado Basico">
  <data key="d0">Estado Basico</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Estado Basico is a display mode showing fundamental device information such as battery level, insulin reservoir, and connection status.&lt;SEP&gt;Estado Basico is a display feature on the MiniMed™ 640G insulin pump that shows current basal insulin delivery status and can be checked to verify recent bolus administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a</data>
