  <data key="d0">Suspender Infusion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspender Infusion is a method that allows the user to temporarily stop insulin delivery from the pump for safety or maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspender Infusion is a function that allows the user to temporarily stop insulin delivery from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspender Infusion is a function on the insulin pump that stops all insulin delivery, used for activities like swimming or showering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6366eda06d68d222b47729f7ca841b</data>
