</node>
<node id="Opciones Pantalla">
  <data key="d0">Opciones Pantalla</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Opciones Pantalla is a method that allows users to adjust screen brightness and backlight duration for optimal visibility and battery conservation.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones Pantalla enables users to adjust screen brightness and backlight duration to manage power consumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
