</node>
<node id="Brillo">
  <data key="d0">Brillo</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Brillo is a method that controls the screen brightness level of the device display.&lt;SEP&gt;Brillo is a screen setting that controls the intensity of the display, with an available Auto mode for automatic adjustment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63644bff2af5cc96a50e636bff8e339b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
