</node>
<node id="Basal Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Basal Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Pattern refers to a programmed insulin delivery schedule used in insulin pump therapy to manage blood glucose levels over a 24-hour period. It consists of one to 48 programmable basal rates, allowing for precise control of insulin delivery tailored to an individual's metabolic needs throughout the day and night. These rates are predefined and can be manually entered, reviewed, copied, modified, and activated within the insulin pump, enabling personalized diabetes management.

The Basal Pattern is designed to mimic the body's natural basal insulin secretion, with configurable delivery rates that adapt to varying insulin requirements at different times of the day. It operates in Manual mode, where the schedule is set in advance and determines the amount and rate of insulin delivered continuously. Each pattern covers a full 24-hour cycle and can be customized in the device settings to reflect changes in lifestyle, activity, or physiological demands.

Safety features are integrated into some systems, with certain Basal Patterns triggering warnings if they deliver significantly more insulin than typically required, helping to prevent potential overdose. Multiple patterns can be stored and selected based on specific situations, such as exercise, illness, or travel, offering flexibility in long-term diabetes care. Overall, the Basal Pattern serves as a foundational component of insulin pump therapy, providing a structured yet adaptable approach to maintaining stable glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cae8b84f90a8e9c929a19f036d8f1e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feedb8da72881894bf4c6529f7baca60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b299154da4c58d8322b7ac4e3af2f5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7220b25a27de0c76dc2804cda82d46a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09ad4286657624fbe3f4e7b422fa4717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7534f3bc09ac6e2eece38e12eb89cf1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b103916c0aae66fd1ad9496d81e3dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-583197b9760861a9bb1ee261914759fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-559587c4971d344102a5ceb58d84260d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f608f07eae4ddd5409aed9d4ecef75ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03dcbf2b62aed8ffb26882713c89f9f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8080e2e312ed6994d0dc059a4aeca5f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d37ccd138ed8a095eb197006a33b8a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-555df1669205bcfa737c81d6936e696e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707216</data>
