  <data key="d0">Suspension Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspension Alert is a feature of the insulin pump that emits beeps or vibrations every 15 minutes when infusion is suspended, reminding the user to resume delivery.</data>
