<node id="Ufh">
  <data key="d0">Ufh</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Ufh represents the insulin infusion rate in units per hour, a key parameter in basal pattern settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Ufh represents the unit rate of insulin delivery per hour in the basal pattern configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Ufh stands for units per hour, the rate at which insulin is delivered during a specific time segment in the basal pattern.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cae8b84f90a8e9c929a19f036d8f1e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1134674d4e1ab07998567f3fa77e251d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6366eda06d68d222b47729f7ca841b</data>
