<node id="TSA">
  <data key="d0">TSA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Transportation Security Administration (TSA) regulates travel security in the United States and provides guidelines for traveling with diabetes supplies and insulin pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;TSA is the Transportation Security Administration that provides guidelines for traveling with diabetes supplies in the United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26f5ebaa0341f051ad33cfb9895a3851</data>
