  <data key="d0">Lithium Batteries</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lithium batteries must be carried in original packaging and kept in carry-on luggage according to TSA regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Lithium batteries power medical devices and must be kept in original packaging and carried in carry-on luggage according to TSA regulations.</data>
