<node id="MiniMed 770G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed 770G Insulin Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed 770G Insulin Pump is a medical device that delivers insulin and provides status updates through various on-screen menus.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 770G insulin pump is approved for use during air travel and requires frequent blood glucose monitoring while in transit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b0270c70980e605771c5d1e6b4de949</data>
