<node id="Travel Loan Program">
  <data key="d0">Travel Loan Program</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic's travel loan program allows users to carry a backup insulin pump during travel.&lt;SEP&gt;The travel loan program by Medtronic allows users to borrow a backup insulin pump when traveling outside the continental United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40aae9750bff384ac9028ae500bc1fb4</data>
