</node>
<node id="24-Hour Technical Support Line">
  <data key="d0">24-Hour Technical Support Line</data>
  <data key="d1">service</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic provides a 24-hour technical support line for troubleshooting insulin pump issues, including alarms and operational questions.&lt;SEP&gt;The 24-hour technical support line is a service provided by Medtronic Diabetes for users to contact in case of device malfunction or accidental exposure to magnetic fields.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1faf2db5ce0667a0d479a8832c2bc8d</data>
