  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medical Team">
  <data key="d0">Medical Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Medical Team refers to a group of healthcare professionals responsible for guiding, supporting, and managing individuals with diabetes, particularly those using insulin pump therapy. This team plays a central role in the initiation and ongoing adjustment of diabetes treatment plans, offering personalized guidance on insulin delivery methods, therapy settings, and glucose management strategies. They work closely with patients to determine optimal insulin dosing, bolus types, and adjustments based on meals, physical activity, illness, and individual health conditions.

The Medical Team provides comprehensive support in managing diabetes through technologies such as the MiniMed™ 640G insulin pump system, advising on sensor data interpretation, glucose targets, and potential causes of therapy-related issues. They are instrumental in setting up therapy, including prescribing insulin, supplying insulin vials, and recommending the use of emergency glucagon kits. Their responsibilities extend to educating patients on hypoglycemia management, diabetic ketoacidosis, and traffic regulations relevant to individuals with diabetes.

In addition to routine care, the Medical Team offers critical guidance during emergencies, such as dangerously high glucose and ketone levels, nausea, difficulty breathing, or other acute symptoms. They develop personalized diabetes management plans that include emergency protocols and adjust treatment in response to health concerns, lifestyle changes, or complications. Through continuous support, prescriptions, and therapy adjustments, the Medical Team ensures safe and effective diabetes control for patients using advanced insulin delivery systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f89cc6358f0fe2b490d63a60ae0581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfad6c7b0e936c6a9c113798a2d963e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0760c4e75f4ab51e1f860c2ae998ef46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f63b580c3efbe7e9a671badd7807ad11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96459b8c713f4d5788b5ab4023a5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-632920359f020e0873ff5b7621b1a7a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b69a8e50a0a4230b6963fe643d8cd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8595240fe716dd024092310ce068d824&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf172904e354a6f4cca233304bf69b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5cace75be2ca46efd8033523e47b6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3000f8880af4ef448483b353db654f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fdccbdc819ab6cd813190d6db8dc9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc5c57277d034fb00908385613bf5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbdbcaae1740f3543ed8a673ff203b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4082de8021392199c251dff122fdc80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4704ed3f5177349243c84d500af612b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de222ffe4b47c380bbe3bc69fd7c2632</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702524</data>
