</node>
<node id="Glucose Tablets">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Tablets</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose tablets are carried to treat low blood glucose levels during travel, especially in cases of flight delays or cancellations.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose tablets are fast-acting carbohydrates used to treat hypoglycemia in individuals with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose tablets are used to treat low blood sugar levels and should be carried during travel.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose tablets are chewable tablets containing 4-5 grams of carbohydrates each, used to treat low blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6367cc87b3326e358622e179b72cbfc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40aae9750bff384ac9028ae500bc1fb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d4d239ddcb372531967a654526e4970</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/hipoglicemia.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778710327</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Extra Food Supplies">
  <data key="d0">Extra Food Supplies</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Extra food supplies such as energy bars are recommended for travel to manage blood glucose during unexpected delays.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778700890</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reserve Syringes">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Syringes</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reserve syringes, insulin vials, or insulin pens are recommended to have on hand in case the insulin pump fails.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778700890</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time Zone Changes">
  <data key="d0">Time Zone Changes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time zone changes during travel can affect diabetes control by altering activity levels, meal schedules, and insulin needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9bc8ba4b622225a9f3f1bb8a9d4fb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40aae9750bff384ac9028ae500bc1fb4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
