<node id="Karen">
  <data key="d0">Karen</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Karen es una persona que administra un bolus para el almuerzo pero lo interrumpe debido a una llamada telefónica.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a person who eats at her desk and takes time to finish meals, potentially requiring a square bolus for insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a person who eats at her desk and administers a square bolus for her meal due to distractions and delayed digestion of carbohydrates.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a person who administers a bolus for lunch but interrupts it due to a phone call from her cousin.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a person who uses a square bolus during lunch over 45 minutes due to slow and distracted eating at work.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39f2ee843ae28cc44b37c7f51f7722a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69f89cc6358f0fe2b490d63a60ae0581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1064c42775365801d8ca4df533dcda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b8d4c3fde5ebf7bc3593f47b765f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d74e338f7a37de66d4b2268a49021c4e</data>
