<node id="Ajustes De Infusion">
  <data key="d0">Ajustes De Infusion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajustes de infusion refers to the configuration settings on the insulin pump that control insulin delivery rates and bolus types.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes De Infusion refers to the configuration settings related to insulin delivery and bolus estimation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes de Infusion refers to the infusion settings menu on the insulin pump where users can modify basal rates and other delivery parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes De Infusion are user-defined settings related to insulin delivery patterns, including bolus estimation and basal rate configuration.</data>
