<node id="Opciones">
  <data key="d0">Opciones</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Opciones is a menu function on the insulin pump interface that allows users to select and modify advanced features.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones is a menu option within the insulin pump interface that allows users to edit or modify basal patterns.</data>
