<node id="Basal Temporal">
  <data key="d0">Basal Temporal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Temporal refers to a predefined temporary basal insulin delivery pattern used in insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Temporal refers to a temporary insulin basal rate that can be programmed and activated on an insulin pump for a specific duration.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Temporal refers to a temporary basal insulin rate that overrides the normal programmed rate for a specified duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b28f926a642d5f692433ed41fafafa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09ad4286657624fbe3f4e7b422fa4717</data>
