<node id="Menu">
  <data key="d0">Menu</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The menu is the main interface of the insulin pump, containing seven sections that provide access to various functions and settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu is the navigation system on the insulin pump used to access settings such as canceling a temporary basal rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu is the navigation interface on the pump that allows access to various functions and settings.</data>
