</node>
<node id="Patron Basal">
  <data key="d0">Patron Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Patron Basal refers to a predefined insulin basal rate schedule that can be customized for different times or events, such as weekdays or holidays.&lt;SEP&gt;Patron Basal is a programmed insulin delivery pattern that regulates basal insulin infusion over a 24-hour cycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778704128</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Configuracion Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Configuracion Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Configuracion Bolus refers to the process of setting up the Bolus Wizard parameters on the insulin pump using clinical data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778700897</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CareLink Personal">
  <data key="d0">CareLink Personal</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink Personal is a secure web-based software program that organizes diabetes management data into readable reports for patients and medical teams.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software system used to generate configuration reports for insulin pump settings.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a system used for analyzing diabetes therapy data, including glucose levels and insulin delivery patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software program used to download and review data from the MiniMed 670G insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a program used by patients like Julia to store and manage data transferred from their insulin pump and glucose meter for review by healthcare professionals.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software system used to generate configuration reports for insulin pump settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0760c4e75f4ab51e1f860c2ae998ef46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bf188253bd9d2142b4fcf627eacc2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b299154da4c58d8322b7ac4e3af2f5bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dfb1fdb931a758d328534e48eca5ad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a8417d6099b09e6129d10f9827b5a35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778704104</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CareLink™ Personal">
  <data key="d0">CareLink™ Personal</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink™ Personal is a software system used to generate configuration reports for insulin pump settings, including Bolus Wizard™ parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is software used to upload and analyze glucose trend data from medical devices for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is a software platform used to review insulin pump and continuous glucose monitoring (MCG) data systematically for therapy optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is a data management software used to analyze glucose sensor data and adjust diabetes therapy over time.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is a data management system used to analyze therapy data for insulin pump users, including glucose trends and insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5b6ed50dde321317a11d8dcc6ef2a579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bf188253bd9d2142b4fcf627eacc2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4704ed3f5177349243c84d500af612b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2cf8a591a83e4436ab6a76c2d30e2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de222ffe4b47c380bbe3bc69fd7c2632</data>
