<node id="Editar Basal 1">
  <data key="d0">Editar Basal 1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Editar Basal 1 is a function or mode allowing users to modify the parameters of Basal 1, including start, end times, and infusion rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Editar Basal 1 is a function that allows the user to modify the time segments and basal indices within the Basal 1 pattern.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1134674d4e1ab07998567f3fa77e251d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feedb8da72881894bf4c6529f7baca60</data>
