</node>
<node id="Guardar">
  <data key="d0">Guardar</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Guardar is an action to save the configured basal pattern settings, ensuring they are stored and applied.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardar is a command used to save changes made to a basal pattern configuration on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardar is a command used to save selected settings within the device's configuration menus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1134674d4e1ab07998567f3fa77e251d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feedb8da72881894bf4c6529f7baca60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9a22fae9e4c986d3a8e2a8dcdad44fd</data>
