<node id="Accu-Chek Guide Link">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Guide Link</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Guide Link is a glucose meter that pairs with the MiniMed 770G insulin pump to transmit remote glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Guide Link is a glucose meter designed to measure blood glucose levels and pair with an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-641adeabab10205d29d07a0c3e82f2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0760c4e75f4ab51e1f860c2ae998ef46</data>
