</node>
<node id="Glucose Measurement">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Measurement</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose measurement refers to the process of checking blood sugar levels at specific times such as before meals, during sleep, and under special conditions like stress or illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose measurement refers to the process of determining blood sugar levels using a glucose meter such as the Accu-Chek Guide Link.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-641adeabab10205d29d07a0c3e82f2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfad6c7b0e936c6a9c113798a2d963e</data>
