  <data key="d2">Further, Together is a trademarked slogan or branding phrase used by Medtronic to represent their corporate mission or values.&lt;SEP&gt;Further, Together is a trademarked slogan used by Medtronic to represent its brand philosophy and collaborative healthcare approach.</data>
