<node id="Ajuste Ins. Activa">
  <data key="d0">Ajuste Ins. Activa</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajuste Ins. Activa is the adjustment made by subtracting active insulin from the corrective insulin dose to avoid overdosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajuste Ins. Activa refers to the adjustment made for active insulin from previous boluses, which is subtracted from the corrective insulin dose calculation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-edf22db77193377cf626b08881757226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4f908910b79b1f9ccf095fd5fb4035</data>
