<node id="Reservorio">
  <data key="d0">Reservorio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reservorio is the container in the insulin pump that holds the insulin supply.&lt;SEP&gt;Reservorio is the container in an insulin pump that holds the insulin supply and must be monitored and replaced as needed.&lt;SEP&gt;The reservorio is a component of the insulin pump that stores insulin before delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;El reservorio es un componente de la bomba de insulina que almacena la insulina antes de ser administrada al cuerpo.</data>
