  <data key="d0">Medidor Compatible</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medidor compatible is a blood glucose meter that integrates with the insulin pump to transfer glucose readings automatically.&lt;SEP&gt;Medidor Compatible is a device that integrates with the insulin delivery system to display blood glucose values automatically.</data>
