<node id="Insulin Infusion Set">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Infusion Set</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin infusion set connects to the user and includes a small insertion needle and a flexible tube called a cannula that delivers insulin into the body. It must be replaced every 2 to 3 days.|&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin infusion set is a component of the insulin delivery system that includes tubing and either a cannula or needle for delivering insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin infusion set is part of the insulin pump system, delivering insulin to the body and requiring regular checks for proper function.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin infusion set delivers insulin from the pump to the body and may be a source of delivery issues if compromised.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin infusion set is a medical device component used to deliver insulin, which may become blocked or kinked, leading to delivery issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin infusion set is part of an insulin pump system and should be changed if ketones are present or if hyperglycemia persists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-682b7d7aa57e01aca00a1d4393db7bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1faf2db5ce0667a0d479a8832c2bc8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc46b3924459ec23a123df1dad4bdcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e910e1b2954d8b793bb4671174d8d92f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778704154</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cannula">
  <data key="d0">Cannula</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cannula is a small, flexible tube used in insulin delivery systems, typically as a component of an infusion set connected to an insulin pump. It is inserted under the skin, usually through the use of an insertion needle, which is removed after placement, leaving the soft, thin cannula in the subcutaneous tissue to remain in place for several days. The primary function of the cannula is to deliver insulin from the pump’s reservoir into the body in a controlled and continuous manner, either as basal rates or during bolus doses.

The cannula serves as a critical conduit in insulin therapy, allowing for consistent and precise insulin administration. It must be properly filled with insulin during pump setup or prior to bolus delivery to ensure effective operation, and some infusion sets include mechanisms and alarms to monitor the filling process and detect issues such as blockages. While most cannulas are made of flexible, biocompatible materials to enhance comfort and reduce tissue irritation, certain infusion sets may use a small rigid needle instead of a traditional soft tube. Regardless of material, the cannula is an essential part of the infusion system, enabling long-term access for insulin delivery while minimizing the need for repeated skin punctures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-682b7d7aa57e01aca00a1d4393db7bd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca77ae5b015fee5d1a21879c1a2b444&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91eefcd3f117b070db0c6aae336adcf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b25811fc82ec9cac7c1bcd18dac0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edefb6aab17535eddb38eddb8b8fc7df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7908c9940fceb874990f2aa93b53b668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8080e2e312ed6994d0dc059a4aeca5f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-851fca8611c248b7f7b991f6dd4abbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b837d1e7373efe5b2f10e88f8f3ae4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adhesive Patch">
  <data key="d0">Adhesive Patch</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The adhesive patch is a small piece that holds the infusion set in place on the body.|</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-682b7d7aa57e01aca00a1d4393db7bd9</data>
