<node id="Medtronic Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Diabetes is a company that provides insulin pumps and related accessories, offering products to protect and conceal the pump for easier transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is a division of Medtronic focused on diabetes management solutions, providing support and information through localized websites and services.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is a division of Medtronic MiniMed that provides medical devices and support services for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is a company that provides insulin pumps, accessories, and support resources, including a website and customer assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is a company that provides insulin pump devices and offers 24-hour technical support for users.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is the manufacturer and distributor of compatible reservoirs and infusion sets and is not responsible for malfunctions caused by third-party components.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Diabetes is the division responsible for manufacturing and distributing reservoirs and infusion sets compatible with the MiniMed pump.</data>
