<node id="Quick-Set">
  <data key="d0">Quick-Set</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Quick-Set is an infusion set used with the MiniMed 770G insulin pump, consisting of a tube, reservoir connector, insertion site section, cannula, and adhesive.&lt;SEP&gt;Quick-Set is an infusion set used with the MiniMed 770G insulin pump for subcutaneous insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Quick-Set is an insulin infusion set with a cannula that can remain in place during radiological procedures such as X-rays, CT scans, or MRIs.&lt;SEP&gt;Quick-Set is an infusion set used with the MiniMed 670G insulin pump to deliver insulin into the body through a subcutaneous cannula.</data>
