  <data key="d2">ACCU-CHEK is a brand of Roche that produces blood glucose monitoring systems used in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;ACCU-CHEK is a trademark owned by Roche, used for blood glucose monitoring systems.&lt;SEP&gt;ACCU-CHEK is a trademark brand owned by Roche for diabetes care products, including blood glucose monitoring and insulin delivery systems.</data>
