  <data key="d0">Objetivo GS</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Objetivo GS es un valor de ajuste que representa el nivel deseado de glucosa en sangre.&lt;SEP&gt;Objetivo GS is the target blood glucose level that the user aims to achieve, used as a parameter in the Bolus Wizard.&lt;SEP&gt;Objetivo GS is the target blood glucose level that the user aims to achieve through insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Objetivo GS is the target blood glucose level that the user aims to achieve through insulin dosing.</data>
