  <data key="d0">Historial Diario</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Historial Diario is a record of daily insulin delivery events, including bolus doses administered.&lt;SEP&gt;Historial Diario contains records of recent bolus insulin doses administered, including time and dosage amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Historial Diario is a log of past bolus doses and glucose readings accessible for review on the device.</data>
