<node id="Corrective Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Corrective Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Corrective bolus is an insulin dose given to correct high blood glucose levels, added to the immediate portion of a dual bolus.</data>
