</node>
<node id="Insulin Level Indicator">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Level Indicator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Insulin Level Indicator is a status icon on the home screen that shows whether the insulin in the reservoir is running low.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b0270c70980e605771c5d1e6b4de949</data>
