  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Status Screen">
  <data key="d0">Status Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Status Screen is a critical interface component of the insulin pump that displays comprehensive, real-time information about the device's operational and therapeutic status. It provides users with detailed data including the remaining insulin units in the reservoir, current basal rate settings, active bolus delivery, and recent bolus history. This screen serves as a central hub for monitoring both pump functionality and therapy progress, ensuring users can verify key parameters during routine inspection.

In addition to insulin delivery metrics, the Status Screen integrates data from glucose sensors, displaying current glucose levels and sensor status to support informed diabetes management decisions. It reflects the pump’s system status, including any active alerts or warnings, and indicates whether insulin delivery is currently suspended or active. Users can access the Status Screen directly from the Home screen via a dedicated shortcut button, facilitating quick and efficient navigation.

Beyond passive monitoring, the Status Screen offers interactive functionality, allowing users to suspend or resume insulin delivery as needed. It consolidates information on both pump operations and connected system features, ensuring a holistic view of therapy and device performance. By presenting real-time updates on delivery status, system integrity, and sensor integration, the Status Screen plays an essential role in the safe and effective use of the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b0270c70980e605771c5d1e6b4de949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd001e1c01f7ba101b7beb19f131c79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a6d7d1adf71e2872a4ddf28d3170247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-555df1669205bcfa737c81d6936e696e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b837d1e7373efe5b2f10e88f8f3ae4</data>
