<node id="Basic Status">
  <data key="d0">Basic Status</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Basic Status is a menu option that provides a summary of current pump information, including the last bolus delivered, the last glucose value entered, and the current basal rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Basic Status is a menu option that shows a summary including the last bolus administered, last glucose value entered, and current basal rate.</data>
