  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor Information includes details such as the next calibration time, sensor lifespan, and transmitter battery status, available only when the sensor function is activated.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Information refers to the status and data provided by the CGM sensor, which may become unavailable and require user action to restore.</data>
