<node id="Notifications">
  <data key="d0">Notifications</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Notifications display the names and times of alarms, alerts, messages, and warnings received within the last 24 hours on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifications are system-generated alerts, alarms, or messages displayed by the pump to communicate operational or safety-related information.&lt;SEP&gt;All notifications are designed to get attention and convey different types of information, including alarms, alerts, reminders, and messages.</data>
