<node id="Daily History">
  <data key="d0">Daily History</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily History is a feature that allows users to review previously administered boluses and other events, useful for tracking insulin delivery over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History is a feature that records and displays recent bolus administrations, allowing users or caregivers to review past insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History is a screen on the pump that displays recent bolus amounts and delivery times.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History is a log within the pump that records insulin delivery activities such as bolus doses or cannula filling.&lt;SEP&gt;A record of daily events, insulin delivery, glucose readings, and other relevant data stored by the insulin pump system.&lt;SEP&gt;Details of the events entered or actions performed using the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily history tracks daily insulin delivery, glucose values, and other metrics over time.</data>
