  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The pump status screen displays key information including insulin delivery status, reservoir volume, battery level, and sensor data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pump status screen shows detailed information about the pump, including reservoir, battery, and device details.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pump Status Screen displays current insulin levels in the reservoir and other operational information for the insulin pump.</data>
