<node id="Glucose Level High Alert">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Level High Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose level high alert is a notification system that warns the user when blood glucose levels are approaching or exceeding a predefined upper limit.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Level High Alert is a notification feature that warns the user when glucose levels approach or exceed a high threshold, with options to configure duration and response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-779002dab61d888870696234d1dbdf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e93fcffd71ed0c035f0b03374608e5</data>
