<node id="Low Reservoir Alert">
  <data key="d0">Low Reservoir Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low reservoir alert warns the user when the insulin reservoir is running low and needs replacement.&lt;SEP&gt;The low reservoir alert warns that the insulin level in the reservoir is low and nearing depletion.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Reservoir Alert is a warning indicating that the insulin reservoir is running low, referenced on pages 239 and 309.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Reservoir Alert is a notification that the insulin reservoir level is below a threshold.</data>
