<node id="Backlight">
  <data key="d0">Backlight</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The backlight illuminates the pump's screen and turns off after a period of inactivity to conserve battery power.&lt;SEP&gt;Backlight is a display feature that illuminates the pump screen in low-light conditions, configurable by the user.&lt;SEP&gt;The backlight illuminates the screen and turns off after a period of inactivity to conserve battery power.&lt;SEP&gt;Backlight is a feature that illuminates the pump screen in low-light conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The backlight is a feature of the pump's screen that can turn off and be reactivated by pressing a button.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-779002dab61d888870696234d1dbdf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9e2bc905a98db798f2f20c77f1f950e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e93fcffd71ed0c035f0b03374608e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aabf7352e5784edc898ebb03d127f44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edefb6aab17535eddb38eddb8b8fc7df</data>
