  <data key="d2">Time and date settings allow the user to set and adjust the current time and date on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Time and Date settings on the MiniMed 780G insulin pump must be accurate to ensure proper basal insulin delivery and correct pump history records.</data>
