<node id="Self Test">
  <data key="d0">Self Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Self test is a diagnostic function that checks the insulin pump’s internal systems for proper operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Self Test is a diagnostic function that checks the insulin pump’s operational status and integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Self Test option verifies the proper operation of the insulin pump and temporarily suspends insulin delivery for up to two minutes during testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Self Test option verifies the proper operation of the pump by running a series of diagnostic checks on its components.&lt;SEP&gt;The Self Test is a diagnostic procedure to check pump functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Self Test is a diagnostic function available on the pump, referenced on page 214.&lt;SEP&gt;Self Test is a diagnostic function to verify the pump’s operational status.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-779002dab61d888870696234d1dbdf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9155c2d6ee74c467d00906235fe430b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cf249079ffd8aa0f06700895b8b7e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
