</node>
<node id="Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fundamentos de la terapia con bomba de insulina es un manual educativo que proporciona información sobre el uso y manejo de bombas de insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is an educational guide providing information on the use and management of insulin pump therapy with sensors.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is a document or guide providing foundational information on insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is an educational resource providing information on insulin pump therapy and carbohydrate counting.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos de la terapia con bomba de insulina es un contenido educativo que explica los principios básicos del uso de bombas de insulina en el manejo de la diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is a guide or educational material providing information on insulin pump therapy management, including adjustments for physical activity and alcohol consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is a section providing foundational knowledge on insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84d2aca165fc0184360972207bae8c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc5f5eb70e79d2ce44b3ba795b76b3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d266340be3ade6b2a58718fd568af4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7fe03750967000c5e6da4698616f3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c10f0a011d51190fa761b5c0aff4ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0fdf7fe6f512616144e110952e56f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc23f53afc0fcecdd9527e9dab84cb8b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702487</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capitulo 2">
  <data key="d0">Capitulo 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Capitulo 2 focuses on the management of sensor-augmented pump therapy, including safety practices and glucose monitoring routines.&lt;SEP&gt;Capitulo 2 refers to a section of the guide focused on managing insulin pump therapy with a sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;Capitulo 2 covers the management of insulin pump therapy with sensor integration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84d2aca165fc0184360972207bae8c6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d266340be3ade6b2a58718fd568af4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc23f53afc0fcecdd9527e9dab84cb8b</data>
