<node id="MiniMed™ 640G System">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed™ 640G System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed™ 640G system is a medical device used for insulin pump therapy with sensor integration, enabling continuous glucose monitoring and automated insulin delivery features.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System is an insulin pump therapy device that includes continuous glucose monitoring and alerts for high and low glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System is an insulin pump system used in insulin therapy, featuring sensor alerts and calibration requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System is an insulin pump system with SmartGuard™ technology for managing glucose levels and preventing hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System is an insulin pump system with features for managing insulin delivery, including bolus types and alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System is an insulin pump system with sensor-augmented pump (SAP) technology for diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46727635453cfb706e038b6920cb2d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96459b8c713f4d5788b5ab4023a5d992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b69a8e50a0a4230b6963fe643d8cd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf172904e354a6f4cca233304bf69b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f2cf8a591a83e4436ab6a76c2d30e2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702498</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="User Guide">
  <data key="d0">User Guide</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The User Guide is a comprehensive document provided with Medtronic insulin pump systems, primarily the MiniMed™ 640G and MiniMed™ 780G, offering detailed instructions and reference information for the safe and effective operation of the devices. It serves as an essential resource for users undergoing therapy training, delivering guidance on daily routines, device setup, and the proper use of system features. The guide includes step-by-step procedures for operating the pump, such as calibration, managing alerts, setting up the reservoir, and configuring travel settings, ensuring users can maintain consistent therapy management.

In addition to operational instructions, the User Guide covers critical aspects of device maintenance and safety, including the insertion, use, and proper disposal of the reservoir and infusion set, as well as changing the infusion set. It provides detailed troubleshooting protocols for resolving pump alarms, sensor signal issues, and other device alerts, along with instructions for restoring settings after errors or system restarts. Safety information and warnings are integrated throughout the document to promote the secure use of the device and its features.

The User Guide also addresses lifestyle considerations such as sports, intimacy, and travel, helping users adapt therapy to various daily activities. While most descriptions reference the MiniMed™ 640G system, one description specifically mentions the MiniMed™ 780G insulin pump, indicating that similar user guides are tailored to different models within the MiniMed™ product line. Overall, the User Guide functions as a central reference document, combining operational details, alarm resolution strategies, and safety protocols to support effective insulin pump management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46727635453cfb706e038b6920cb2d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dc5c57277d034fb00908385613bf5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fbdbcaae1740f3543ed8a673ff203b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26f5ebaa0341f051ad33cfb9895a3851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-941b9969735807fbf7d05695bb5723ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b25811fc82ec9cac7c1bcd18dac0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb01d55e6a22a76ca93e60f11c9b4cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-583197b9760861a9bb1ee261914759fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7908c9940fceb874990f2aa93b53b668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bcf8f1ff0075b1e2f1edaa4bc946a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03820ea21d982bc029e8a55fe1be600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30fd82ff17ab8577d82477ed97f94075&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79aff2bfb4c32e8089ffd4b1e5eb5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f0986d34b7b73e98fe14c73abfb6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e8ebad9c2de6a1aeba1645920f2e35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
