  <data key="d0">Personalized Rise Limit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The personalized rise limit is a user-adjustable setting on the MiniMed™ 640G that allows setting a custom glucose rise rate threshold between 1 and 5 mg/dL per minute.</data>
