</node>
<node id="Basal Insulin Rate">
  <data key="d0">Basal Insulin Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal insulin rate refers to the continuous, low-rate delivery of insulin to manage glucose levels between meals and during sleep, which can contribute to hypoglycemia if set too high.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal insulin rate refers to the continuous background insulin delivery in insulin pump therapy, which must be adjusted appropriately to match metabolic needs and prevent hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal insulin rate is the continuous background insulin delivery via pump, critical for maintaining stable glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa5dc0d158b3af5c0f7883f98cce6d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3000f8880af4ef448483b353db654f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702585</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Saturday Night">
  <data key="d0">Saturday Night</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Saturday night is the time context during which Dennis is at a bar with friends after dinner and alcohol consumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
