  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">EASD Diabetologia is a journal that published a user evaluation study by Conget I et al. on the predictive low glucose management feature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eab57247c382bad8d5f1e5eb84a62e24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778702618</data>
