  <data key="d0">Guardian™ 2 Link</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Guardian™ 2 Link is a glucose transmitter that stores and wirelessly sends glucose data to the insulin pump within a maximum distance of 1.2 meters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian™ 2 Link is a transmitter that sends glucose data from the sensor to the MiniMed™ 640G insulin pump system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1dc5c57277d034fb00908385613bf5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01ce95c3ebe034549347b078008daa3c</data>
