  <data key="d3">chunk-20fd2bf061c46e98e4d7791fe6728699</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapid-acting insulin reaches its maximum glucose-lowering effect 1 to 2 hours after administration and reduces glucose levels within 5 to 6 hours.</data>
