</node>
<node id="Busqueda Dispositivo">
  <data key="d0">Busqueda Dispositivo</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Busqueda Dispositivo is the process of scanning for and pairing a new medical device, such as a glucose meter or insulin pump.&gt;</data>
