  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Conexion de la Bomba y el Medidor describes the process of linking the insulin pump with a glucose meter for integrated data management and therapy adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ac418ceabab52352571a8024e5602ec4</data>
