<node id="Manual Insulin Injection">
  <data key="d0">Manual Insulin Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Manual insulin injection refers to insulin delivery via syringe or pen, which is not factored into the Bolus Wizard's active insulin calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual insulin injection refers to insulin delivery via syringe or pen, which is not accounted for by the SmartGuard feature and can lead to over-delivery if used concurrently.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a99dc37db5c39ba2f813bb638414b56f</data>
