  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Normal Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Normal Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A normal bolus is a type of insulin bolus delivery where the full dose is administered immediately, indicated by (N) in the pump display.&lt;SEP&gt;A standard type of bolus delivery that administers insulin immediately in a single dose.&lt;SEP&gt;A Normal Bolus is a single, immediate dose of insulin delivered to cover food intake or correct high blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Normal Bolus is a type of insulin bolus delivered using the Manual bolus feature, either with or without the Bolus Wizard enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;Normal bolus provides a single immediate dose of insulin to cover food intake or correct high blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A normal bolus is a standard insulin dose delivered immediately by an insulin pump.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A type of bolus that provides an entire dose of insulin immediately.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d536bf636b4a29c1f9f46de648b2b306&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02b21bc8135e144a626f42f84747459d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d350656ba1a2a747792507170f7346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73b840edccb54a2c256450df95d80f4f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">Infusión refers to the delivery of insulin through the pump into the body over time.</data>
