</node>
<node id="Insulin Duration">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Duration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Duration is the time it takes for an insulin bolus to reduce blood glucose levels, set at 4 hours in the configuration.</data>
