  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed 670G is an insulin pump device designed to help manage diabetes through automated insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 670G is an insulin pump system designed for diabetes management, providing automated insulin delivery based on glucose monitoring.</data>
