<node id="Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used to configure and control the micropump system, including providing bolus advice and blood glucose measurement for home use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used for configuring and controlling a micropump, featuring a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used to configure and control the micro-pump, provides bolus advice, and includes a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used to configure and control the micropump, provides bolus advice, and includes a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is used to configure and control the micro-pump and provides bolus suggestions for correction or meals; it includes a blood glucose monitoring system for self-monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is used for configuring and controlling the Accu-Chek Solo micro pump and includes a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing. It provides bolus advice for correction or meal boluses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used for setting and controlling Roche micro pumps, providing bolus dose recommendations and including a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8430c8897032c30391e131ac6fd24f47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab46e0b33a717acc64053721e7ed405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395e34987ebd21d82a5ef4f460731296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f779e765cd1ec33782872b317bf8af11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69194d820de3abba786fc6924e36dd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd22ca03a61055434dc1e128fb57ee3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4f0d15ae81e49555dae7c149b2250be</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/IFU Accu-Chek Guide Solo Diabetes Manager.PDF</data>
