<node id="Blood Glucose Monitoring System">
  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Monitoring System</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The blood glucose monitoring system is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager and is intended for self-testing of blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Monitoring System is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager for self-testing blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Monitoring System is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager and is intended for self-monitoring of blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Monitoring System is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Health Management Device and is intended for self-monitoring of blood glucose levels.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The blood glucose monitoring system is part of the Diabetes Manager Accu-Chek Solo and is intended for self-monitoring of blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Monitoring System is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager and enables users to perform self-tests for blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Monitoring System is integrated into the Accu-Chek Solo device and is designed for self-monitoring of blood glucose levels.</data>
