  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bolus Recommendation is a feature of the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager that provides suggested insulin doses for correction or meals.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Recommendation is a function of the Accu-Chek Solo that provides advice for correction bolus or mealtime bolus doses.</data>
