  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">User Instructions contain essential information, warnings, and guidelines for the safe and correct use of the micropump system.&lt;SEP&gt;User Instructions provide guidance on the safe and proper use of the Accu-Chek Solo Micro-Pump System, including warnings, maintenance, cleaning, and disposal.</data>
