  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cleaning and disinfection procedures for the micropump system are detailed in the user manual under maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning and disinfection are maintenance procedures for the micropump system, detailed in the user manual under care and maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning and disinfection procedures for the micro-pump system are detailed in the user manual under maintenance and care.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning And Disinfection refers to the maintenance procedures for the micro pump system, with detailed instructions provided in the user manual.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaning and disinfection are maintenance procedures for the micropump system, with detailed instructions provided in the user manual.&gt;</data>
