  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Disposal refers to the environmentally responsible handling of used products and batteries according to local regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Disposal of used devices and batteries must follow local regulations, with batteries to be recycled at designated collection points.&lt;SEP&gt;Disposal refers to the proper method of discarding used reservoirs and infusion sets according to the instructions in the user guide.</data>
