<node id="Accu-Chek Solo">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes treatment system that includes a micro-SICI or microbomba and a diabetes manager for configuring, controlling, and monitoring insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes manager device used for setting and controlling a micro pump, providing bolus dose recommendations and including a blood glucose monitoring system for self-monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a medical device used for diabetes management, requiring proper handling and reporting of adverse events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ed5fdff66ffcd1f4d4e10a8825e7905c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69194d820de3abba786fc6924e36dd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a66c98111c91022bbcbc621e0fea07fe</data>
