<node id="Waste Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Waste Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Waste disposal guidelines require used products and batteries to be discarded according to local regulations and environmental standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste disposal refers to the proper ecological disposal of used products and batteries according to local regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Waste Disposal involves environmentally responsible disposal of used products in accordance with local regulations, with guidance available from local authorities or municipalities.</data>
