<node id="Accu-Chek Solo Micropump System">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo Micropump System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Solo Micropump System is a medical device intended for insulin delivery, requiring proper handling, cleaning, and disposal as per instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Micropump System is a medical device intended for diabetes management, requiring proper use, maintenance, and adherence to safety instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Accu-Chek Solo Micropump System is a medical device designed for insulin delivery in diabetes management and is intended for repeated use by a single patient.&gt;</data>
