  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Health Management Device is used to configure and control the Accu-Chek Solo insulin micro-pump system and includes a blood glucose monitoring system for self-testing. It provides bolus recommendations for correction or meals.&gt;</data>
