<node id="Active Insulin Time 4/4 Screen">
  <data key="d0">Active Insulin Time 4/4 Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">interface</data>
  <data key="d2">The Active Insulin Time 4/4 screen displays the duration for which bolus insulin remains active in lowering glucose levels.</data>
