  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Ed Note refers to editorial notes in the document that provide additional instructions or warnings about insulin pump settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Ed Note refers to editorial notes that direct users to other sections for detailed instructions on configuring multiple settings over a 24-hour period.</data>
