  <data key="d0">Replace Battery Now Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Replace Battery Now Alarm is a critical alert requiring immediate battery replacement in the insulin pump, referenced on page 313.&lt;SEP&gt;Replace Battery Now Alarm is a critical alert prompting immediate battery replacement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
