<node id="SmartGuard Exit Alert">
  <data key="d0">SmartGuard Exit Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SmartGuard Exit Alert is a non-silenceable alert indicating that the pump has exited the SmartGuard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard Exit Alert is a critical notification that cannot be silenced even when All Sensor Alerts are silenced.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard Exit Alert indicates that the SmartGuard system has been deactivated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc4a95eb5f47fc9afc3b30fb1364490&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b</data>
