<node id="Storage Mode">
  <data key="d0">Storage Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Storage Mode is a state for the MiniMed 780G insulin pump when not in use, requiring periodic battery replacement to maintain internal battery health.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage Mode is a state for preserving the pump during periods of non-use.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage Mode is a state in which the insulin pump is deactivated for long-term storage, preserving battery and system integrity.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e0b546270469b67078fda39a4e47d4</data>
