<node id="Transfer Guard">
  <data key="d0">Transfer Guard</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The transfer guard is a tool used to securely connect the reservoir to an insulin vial during filling.&lt;SEP&gt;The plastic piece attached to the reservoir used to connect the reservoir to the insulin vial during filling.&lt;SEP&gt;Transfer Guard is a feature related to secure data transfer between the insulin pump and external devices or systems.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Transfer Guard is a device or accessory used during the reservoir filling or transfer process to prevent contamination or leakage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f2667d6936a8a9a26e886ba90b060796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a76c99cd46001ae6a2373d3413db020f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc61f77b003d0086bd985ddb94fc2a98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
