  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Ufhr is a unit of measurement representing insulin delivery rate in units per hour, used in programming basal patterns on the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f608f07eae4ddd5409aed9d4ecef75ad</data>
