  <data key="d0">SN</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The acronym for serial number, used to identify the insulin pump or related components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a76c99cd46001ae6a2373d3413db020f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
