  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspend">
  <data key="d0">Suspend</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend is a function that stops all insulin delivery from the pump, used in both SmartGuard and manual modes, typically in response to low glucose alerts or user action.&lt;SEP&gt;A feature that stops all insulin delivery until resumed, with only basal insulin restarting upon resumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a76c99cd46001ae6a2373d3413db020f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
