  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serter">
  <data key="d0">Serter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The serter is a device used to insert the infusion set and may carry general risks including skin infection at the insertion site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707453</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Occlusion">
  <data key="d0">Occlusion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Occlusion refers to a blockage in the insulin delivery pathway, such as in the infusion set, which can interrupt insulin flow and lead to hyperglycemia or diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;A blockage or crimp of the cannula or tubing that prevents proper insulin flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707453</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Backlight Setting">
  <data key="d0">Backlight Setting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Backlight setting determines how long the pump screen remains lit before going dark, after which the pump may enter Sleep mode.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707453</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="24-Hour Technical Support Number">
  <data key="d0">24-Hour Technical Support Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The 24-Hour Technical Support number is a contact number printed on the bottom of the pump for user assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707454</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basal Pattern and Basal Rates">
  <data key="d0">Basal Pattern and Basal Rates</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal pattern and basal rates are user-configured settings that define the background insulin delivery schedule over 24 hours.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707454</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Max Basal">
  <data key="d0">Max Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Max basal is a delivery setting that limits the maximum basal insulin rate the pump can deliver.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707454</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dual/Square Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Dual/Square Wave Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual/Square Wave bolus is a bolus delivery method that splits the dose into immediate and extended components, useful for meals with high fat content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707455</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carb Entries">
  <data key="d0">Carb Entries</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Carb entries are user-input values indicating the amount of carbohydrates consumed, used by the SmartGuard feature to calculate bolus insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707455</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
