  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus Wizard™ Feature">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Wizard™ Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bolus Wizard™ feature calculates insulin bolus doses based on user-entered data but should not be used shortly after a manual insulin injection due to risk of insulin over-delivery and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707469</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="User Safety">
  <data key="d0">User Safety</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">User safety encompasses proper training, adherence to warnings, and correct use of device features to prevent injury or adverse reactions when using the MiniMed 780G system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707469</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Indications For Use">
  <data key="d0">Indications For Use</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indications for use define the approved conditions and populations for which the MiniMed 780G insulin pump and associated technologies are intended, including age requirements and prescription necessity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707469</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caution">
  <data key="d0">Caution</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Caution indicates a potential hazard that might result in minor or moderate injury or equipment damage if not avoided.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778707469</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
