</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Lipodistrofia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A sudden change from an affected injection site (e.g., with lipodystrophy) to an unaffected area can result in improved absorption and unexpected hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d10">absorption shift,sudden site change</data>
