</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Oral Hypoglycemic Agents">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The use of oral hypoglycemic agents with insulin can increase the risk of hypoglycemia due to combined glucose-lowering effects.</data>
  <data key="d10">blood glucose reduction,drug interaction</data>
