<edge source="Insulin" target="Insulin Storage">
  <data key="d8">7.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Proper insulin storage is necessary to maintain its effectiveness, with specific requirements for opened and unopened vials.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must be stored correctly between 2 °C and 8 °C when unopened and protected from freezing to maintain its effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper insulin storage between 2°C and 8°C preserves its effectiveness and prevents degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must be stored between 2°C and 8°C in the refrigerator, away from freezer walls, to maintain efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper insulin storage is essential to maintain its stability, potency, and safety for use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must be stored properly to prevent degradation, avoiding freezing and extreme temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Proper storage of insulin between 2°C and 8°C or at room temperature up to 30°C is essential to preserve its potency and action.</data>
  <data key="d10">temperature control, stability maintenance, temperature control, preservation, preservation, temperature sensitivity, temperature control, stability, medication handling, environmental sensitivity, storage requirements, stability, proper handling, temperature control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11ac81b4dee4dbb3636b8dc2403e0661&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Cuidados com a Insulinoterapia conservar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696366</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
  <data key="d15">Insulin</data>
  <data key="d16">Insulin Storage</data>
</edge>
