<edge source="Insulin" target="Blood Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Changes in insulin administration may lead to glycemic variability, requiring intensified blood glucose monitoring to maintain safe and effective diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive blood glucose monitoring is recommended during pregnancy and after changes in insulin therapy to maintain control.</data>
  <data key="d10">treatment adjustment, metabolic control, glycemic control, treatment adjustment</data>
