<edge source="Insulin" target="Extreme Temperatures">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Exposure to extreme heat or cold, such as in checked luggage, can reduce insulin effectiveness and lead to hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Exposure of insulin to extreme cold or heat can cause it to lose efficacy, potentially leading to hyperglycemia.</data>
