</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard calculates the appropriate insulin dose based on user-specific medical data.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard helps calculate the correct amount of insulin to deliver based on user input.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard calculates the correct insulin dose needed to correct high glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard calculates and guides the administration of insulin boluses for meal and correction purposes.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery method,dosage calculation,dose calculation,dose delivery,therapeutic use,therapy method,treatment planning</data>
