<edge source="Insulin" target="Glucose">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin enables glucose to pass from the bloodstream and interstitial fluid into cells for energy use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is required for glucose to enter cells and be used for energy production.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin enables glucose to pass from the blood and interstitial fluid into cells for energy use.</data>
