</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin pump therapy delivers insulin continuously to maintain glucose balance in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump therapy delivers insulin continuously to mimic natural pancreatic function in people with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is the primary medication administered through insulin pump therapy to manage blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">continuous infusion,glucose control,medical delivery,treatment agent,treatment delivery,treatment method</data>
