</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Glucose Levels">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin regulates glucose levels in the blood, and its absence leads to a rapid increase in glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is used to maintain normal glucose levels between meals.</data>
