<edge source="Insulin" target="Diabetes">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In diabetes, insufficient insulin leads to elevated blood glucose and cellular energy deprivation.&lt;SEP&gt;In diabetes, insufficient insulin prevents glucose from entering cells, leading to high blood glucose and cellular energy deficit.&lt;SEP&gt;In diabetes, insulin must be administered externally to regulate blood glucose levels due to insufficient natural production.</data>
  <data key="d10">hormonal deficiency,hormonal regulation,medical treatment,metabolic disorder</data>
