<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Glucose Sensor">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Continuous Glucose Monitoring uses a glucose sensor attached to the skin to measure glucose levels in real time at regular intervals.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring relies on a glucose sensor to collect real-time glucose readings throughout the day.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor is the key component that enables continuous glucose monitoring by providing real-time glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor is a key component of the continuous glucose monitoring system, responsible for measuring glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitoring relies on the Glucose Sensor to measure glucose levels in interstitial fluid.</data>
  <data key="d10">sensor integration, data collection, data source, real-time monitoring, device component, data collection, measurement method, data source, monitoring method, real-time tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b69a8e50a0a4230b6963fe643d8cd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c03aab2b6261ddc73d474d0c866e7b37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e910e1b2954d8b793bb4671174d8d92f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5904918561a819f1c95321943d91162</data>
