<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Sensor Glucose">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Continuous Glucose Monitoring provides real-time Sensor Glucose readings used for alerts and automated insulin delivery decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring provides the sensor glucose values used to trigger alerts and suspend insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Glucose is the data output generated by the Continuous Glucose Monitoring system, reflecting current glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring provides real-time sensor glucose values used for insulin delivery and trend analysis.</data>
  <data key="d10">data source,measurement method,real-time measurement,real-time tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ab4ddf6540d88f22cdfe4b96db42b88f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef0e6e09cd17187cd967e6d49a3e718&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d8c5703a9383d7fd4b6f1d14f5d5424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b</data>
