  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump integrates with CGM to provide real-time glucose monitoring and automated insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">real-time monitoring,system integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
