  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Hydroxyurea">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hydroxyurea use causes falsely high sensor glucose readings, making CGM unsafe and potentially leading to incorrect insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Taking hydroxyurea while using continuous glucose monitoring can cause hypoglycemia due to insulin over-delivery and inaccurate alerts.</data>
  <data key="d10">medication interference,monitoring inaccuracy,risk,system risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5904918561a819f1c95321943d91162</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707698</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Simplera Sync sensor is used in CGM and does not require user calibration, though the system uses blood glucose readings to adjust sensor data.&lt;SEP&gt;Simplera Sync sensor supports continuous glucose monitoring through integration with the pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">calibration,glucose tracking,real-time data,sensor compatibility</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707699</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 sensor is used in CGM and does not require user calibration, though the system uses blood glucose readings to adjust sensor data.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardian 4 sensor enables continuous glucose monitoring by providing real-time glucose readings.</data>
  <data key="d10">calibration,glucose tracking,real-time data,sensor compatibility</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707701</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
