  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Instinct sensor is used in CGM and requires the MiniMed Mobile App to start a new sensor session.&lt;SEP&gt;Instinct sensor is used for continuous glucose monitoring and integrates with the pump system.</data>
  <data key="d10">app dependency,glucose tracking,real-time data,sensor compatibility</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900</data>
