  <data key="d13">1778707922</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sensor" target="SG Value">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The sensor generates SG values by measuring interstitial glucose levels in real time.&lt;SEP&gt;The SG value is derived from the sensor’s continuous glucose monitoring function.</data>
  <data key="d10">data generation,data source,glucose monitoring,real-time monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707996</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sensor" target="First 12 Hours">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Sensor performance may vary during the first 12 hours of use, requiring additional verification with a BG meter.</data>
  <data key="d10">initial calibration,performance variability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708009</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sensor" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature relies on sensor readings to adjust insulin delivery, but sensor accuracy may vary, especially during the first 12 hours of use.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature requires the sensor to provide SG readings in order to function; if the sensor is turned off or not providing data, the feature may exit.</data>
  <data key="d10">data dependency,performance limitation,system requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-53048131930fe8817679e51d5bec009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e</data>
