<edge source="Sensor" target="Sensor Expired">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When the sensor reaches the end of its functional life, the Sensor Expired alert is triggered, prompting replacement.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Expired indicates the sensor has reached the end of its approved usage period.</data>
