<edge source="Interstitial Fluid" target="Glucose Sensor">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The glucose sensor measures glucose concentration in the interstitial fluid rather than directly in the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;The Glucose Sensor operates by measuring glucose concentration in the interstitial fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;The Glucose Sensor measures glucose concentration in the interstitial fluid surrounding cells.</data>
  <data key="d10">measurement environment, physiological medium, physiological measurement, fluid sampling, measurement medium, physiological monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86d3bb81c7595510175054c288b122fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5904918561a819f1c95321943d91162</data>
