<edge source="Smartphone" target="Real-Time Continuous Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Real-time continuous glucose monitoring systems transmit glucose data to smartphones, enabling immediate access and visualization for patients.</data>
