<edge source="Smartphone" target="Dexcom G6">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Dexcom G6 system transmits glucose data to a smartphone via a dedicated app for real-time monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">data integration,wireless communication</data>
