<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Glucagon">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Glucagon is used to treat severe hypoglycemic episodes when the patient becomes unconscious.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucagon administered subcutaneously or intramuscularly is used to treat severe hypoglycemia with neurological symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucagon prevents hypoglycemia by stimulating the liver to release stored glucose into the bloodstream.</data>
  <data key="d10">treatment, emergency response, preventive mechanism, metabolic balance, treatment, severe episode management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ef496454c12f85ff1f62de19e8a22be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b139e060742a21ffc13eee0fdbf0be4a</data>
