<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Diathermy Devices">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin pumps must not be exposed to diathermy devices as the strong electromagnetic fields can cause device malfunction and serious injury.&lt;SEP&gt;Exposure to diathermy devices or strong magnetic fields can disrupt insulin pump function, leading to hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
