<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump uses SmartGuard to enable automated insulin delivery based on glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is a feature of the insulin pump that enables automated insulin delivery and alert settings.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is a functionality integrated into the insulin pump that enables automated insulin delivery adjustments based on glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is a feature embedded within the insulin pump that automates insulin delivery based on sensor and user inputs.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is an advanced mode in the insulin pump that automatically adjusts basal insulin based on CGM data.&gt;</data>
