<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Infusion Set">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump delivers insulin through an infusion set that must be replaced regularly.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set is a critical component of the insulin pump system, enabling insulin delivery from the pump to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set is used by the insulin pump to deliver insulin and must be changed periodically.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set connects the insulin pump to the body and delivers insulin from the reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;The Infusion Set is connected to the insulin pump to deliver insulin from the reservoir to the body.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,delivery mechanism,device component,drug delivery,insulin delivery,insulin delivery system,replacement,tubing system</data>
