  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump triggers a glucose level high alert when sensor values approach or exceed the upper limit.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump allows users to configure alerts for high glucose levels, including activation before and at the high limit.</data>
