<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Danielle">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Danielle uses an insulin pump to manage her insulin delivery and disconnects it for certain activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Danielle disconnects and manually suspends her insulin pump when swimming to prevent insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">device usage,personal management,suspension</data>
