</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Trend Arrows">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump displays trend arrows based on glucose data from the CGM device to indicate glucose level trends.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump displays Trend Arrows to show the direction and speed of glucose level changes.&gt;</data>
