</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Suspend Before Low">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend Before Low feature uses the insulin pump to automatically stop insulin delivery before a low glucose event occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump uses Suspend Before Low to pause insulin delivery when low glucose is predicted.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">automated suspension,hypoglycemia prevention,insulin control,predictive safety</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
