  <data key="d13">1778708245</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Suspend On Low">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend On Low function commands the insulin pump to halt insulin delivery when sensor glucose reaches or falls below the preset limit.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump activates Suspend On Low to stop insulin when glucose levels fall below a threshold.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">automatic suspension,hypoglycemia response,insulin control,threshold-based action</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708246</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Low Snooze">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low Snooze feature is set on the insulin pump to control how often a low glucose alert repeats if the condition continues.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert management,repeated notification</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708251</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump is a key component of the MiniMed 780G system responsible for delivering insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">device integration,system component</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708310</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Air Travel">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Changes in air pressure during air travel can cause over- or under-delivery of insulin from the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">environmental factor,operational risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708315</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Infusion Site">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump should not be placed more than 14 inches above the infusion site to avoid over-delivery of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery mechanism,positional requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708316</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Battery Life">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Physical impacts such as dropping the insulin pump can reduce battery life and risk interruption of insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">device maintenance,operational continuity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708317</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Low Battery Pump Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low Battery Pump Alert signals the need to replace batteries immediately to maintain insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">device notification,maintenance trigger</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708318</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Hypoglycemic Event">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Over-delivery of insulin from the insulin pump, such as when placed above the infusion site, can lead to a hypoglycemic event.</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse effect,insulin over-delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708323</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Hyperglycemic Event">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Under-delivery of insulin due to air pressure changes during flight or pump malfunction can result in a hyperglycemic event.</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse effect,insulin under-delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708324</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="User">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The user must have adequate vision and hearing to recognize insulin pump alerts and alarms to prevent hypoglycemic or hyperglycemic events.</data>
  <data key="d10">device operation,sensory requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c35705afcd32698e0eb1756f2c3484a4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708331</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Power Save Mode">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Power save mode allows the insulin pump to remain functional while conserving energy by dimming the screen.</data>
  <data key="d10">device function,energy management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708344</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Food Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The food bolus is delivered through the insulin pump to manage post-meal glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">device function,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708345</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Manual Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The manual bolus feature allows the user to input and deliver an insulin dose using the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump allows users to deliver a Manual Bolus without assistance from dose calculation tools.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">immediate delivery,insulin delivery,user control,user interaction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708346</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Preset Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The preset bolus is configured and delivered through the insulin pump for recurring meals or snacks.</data>
  <data key="d10">device programming,dose automation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708347</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Preset Temp Basal">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The preset temp basal is set up and used within the insulin pump to apply temporary basal rates repeatedly.</data>
  <data key="d10">basal rate programming,device function</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708349</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Lock">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The lock feature is part of the insulin pump that prevents accidental button presses.</data>
  <data key="d10">safety feature,user interface</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708354</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Notifications">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Notifications are generated by the insulin pump to inform the user of alarms, alerts, reminders, and messages.</data>
  <data key="d10">device feedback,user alert system</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708355</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="High Limit">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The high limit is a user-defined setting on the insulin pump that triggers alerts when sensor glucose levels exceed the threshold.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose monitoring,threshold setting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708356</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Low Limit">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The low limit is a user-defined setting on the insulin pump that triggers alerts and suspends insulin delivery when sensor glucose levels fall below the threshold.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose monitoring,threshold setting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708361</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Occlusion">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">An occlusion in the infusion set causes the insulin pump to detect a blockage and alert the user.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery interruption,system alert</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708363</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Max Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Max bolus is a configurable parameter within the insulin pump that limits single bolus deliveries.&lt;SEP&gt;The max bolus is a configurable limit on the insulin pump that restricts the largest single bolus dose that can be delivered.</data>
  <data key="d10">device setting,dosage control,dose restriction,safety setting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73b840edccb54a2c256450df95d80f4f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708364</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Max Basal Rate">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The max basal rate is a user-programmed upper limit on the amount of basal insulin the insulin pump can deliver per hour.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery limit,programming constraint</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708365</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Piston">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The piston is an internal component of the insulin pump that drives insulin from the reservoir through the tubing.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin delivery,mechanical operation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708365</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="iCGM">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The iCGM (integrated continuous glucose monitor) shares glucose data directly with the insulin pump for coordinated management.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose data sharing,system integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708366</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump integrates with the Guardian 4 Sensor to receive glucose data for automated insulin delivery decisions.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">data exchange,device integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708368</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump is compatible with the Instinct Sensor for continuous glucose monitoring and treatment adjustments.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">device integration,real-time monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708369</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Transmitter">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The transmitter sends glucose readings from the sensor to the insulin pump for analysis and response.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">data transmission,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708370</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Square Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump supports Square Wave Bolus as a delivery option for managing post-meal glucose spikes.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">extended bolus,insulin delivery mode</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708372</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Temp Basal Rate">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump enables users to set a Temp Basal Rate to modify insulin delivery for short-term needs.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin modulation,temporary adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708378</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Startup Wizard">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Startup Wizard guides users through the initial setup process of the insulin pump.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration,initial setup</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708378</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Pump Software">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump software runs on the insulin pump and manages all functions including delivery, alarms, and user interface.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">firmware operation,system control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708379</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Storage Mode">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump can enter Storage Mode to preserve battery and system state during prolonged non-use.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">device maintenance,power management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708381</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Transfer Guard">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Transfer Guard ensures secure data transfer between the insulin pump and connected devices.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">data protection,secure communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708382</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Max Fill Reached Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump triggers the Max Fill Reached Alarm when the reservoir is full during the filling process.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">filling safety,reservoir monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708383</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Very High Basal Setting Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump issues a Very High Basal Setting Alert when an abnormally high basal rate is programmed.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">overdose prevention,safety warning</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d85d195e1f8c488146a71cdd978e8c82</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708384</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Stuck Button Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin pump detects prolonged button presses and triggers the Stuck Button Alarm to prevent unintended actions.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">hardware monitoring,user interface safety</data>
