<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Insulin Detemir">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin detemir is used as a basal insulin in patients with type 1 diabetes, showing improved glycemic control and lower hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d10">basal insulin therapy, clinical efficacy</data>
