<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Diabetic Ketoacidosis">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Untreated hyperglycemia in type 1 diabetes can progress to diabetic ketoacidosis, a potentially fatal condition.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">disease complication, progression</data>
