<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In type 1 diabetes, untreated hyperglycemia can progress to diabetic ketoacidosis, a life-threatening condition.&lt;SEP&gt;In type 1 diabetes, inadequate insulin treatment leads to hyperglycemia, which can progress to diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d10">complication risk,disease progression,metabolic complication</data>
