<edge source="Physical Activity" target="Insulin Application">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Physical activity increases insulin absorption, so injection sites should be chosen carefully to avoid active limbs.</data>
  <data key="d10">absorption rate,injection site selection</data>
