  <data key="d13">1778702769</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Physical Activity" target="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin pump therapy requires adjustments during physical activity to prevent hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose regulation,therapy adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f63b580c3efbe7e9a671badd7807ad11</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702817</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Physical Activity" target="Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Physical activity can lead to hyperglycemia, especially during intense or competitive exercise.</data>
  <data key="d10">exercise effect,metabolic response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f63b580c3efbe7e9a671badd7807ad11</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702821</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Physical Activity" target="Ketone Testing">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Ketone testing is required before physical activity if blood glucose is over 240 mg/dL and rising.</data>
  <data key="d10">DKA prevention,safety protocol</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f63b580c3efbe7e9a671badd7807ad11</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702831</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Physical Activity" target="Dennis">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Dennis must consider how physical activity impacts his glucose levels and adjust bolus insulin or consume carbohydrates accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d10">carbohydrate intake,insulin adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5</data>
