<edge source="Insulin Dosing" target="100-Unit Syringe">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The 100-unit syringe is graduated in 2-unit increments, making it impossible to measure odd-numbered doses accurately.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose limitation,even increments</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696033</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Dosing" target="Fixed-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Fixed-needle syringes allow accurate measurement of both even and odd insulin doses and prevent intramuscular injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">precise dosing,subcutaneous delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696036</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Regular Insulin">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH and Regular insulin can be mixed in the same syringe using a specific sequence to prevent contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;When used together, Regular insulin is drawn first, followed by NPH insulin to prevent contamination.&lt;SEP&gt;Regular and NPH insulin are often mixed in the same syringe, with regular insulin drawn first to prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d10">combination therapy,insulin combination,mixing order,sequential mixing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696019</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Ultrarapid Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Ultrarapid and NPH insulin are combined in one syringe with precise steps to maintain efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d10">combination therapy,mixing order</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-035472811a4a16d98e62eba23a86dceb</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695221</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Neutral Protamine Hagedorn Cartridges">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH insulin is delivered using neutral protamine hagedorn cartridges, which require proper mixing for consistent pharmacokinetics.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery mechanism,drug formulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695238</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Técnicas De Aplicação De Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Proper resuspension of NPH insulin before injection is a critical aspect of técnicas de aplicação de insulina to ensure therapeutic effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration protocol,pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8fc83e266bdeb54c4139a50adf2b793a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695238</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Insulin Application Technique">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH insulin must be gently rolled 20 times before use to ensure proper suspension.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration,mixing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695677</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Insulin Vial Shelf Life">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH insulin, once the vial is opened, remains valid for 30 days.</data>
  <data key="d10">expiration,storage duration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-afd148f1edc7929cecea8e4d981ed04e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695680</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Insulin Homogenization">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH insulin must be properly homogenized before use to ensure uniform insulin concentration.</data>
  <data key="d10">mixing requirement,suspension</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-dde6c55191737188788dc809811837cc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696002</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Insulin Suspension">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NPH insulin is a suspension that must be homogenized before use to ensure consistent dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">formulation type,mixing requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696018</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Insulin Detemir">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin detemir is compared with NPH insulin in terms of glycemic control and hypoglycemia frequency in patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir demonstrates a lower within-patient variability and more reproducible time-action profile compared to NPH insulin in patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir is compared with NPH insulin in multiple clinical trials for efficacy, safety, and variability in diabetic patients.</data>
  <data key="d10">comparative efficacy,comparative study,diabetes treatment,efficacy,safety,variability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-44f60a4106da6d70fe72d17aa2728296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-590fb2f5c50ef31a5fd415bb01def92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698115</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NPH Insulin" target="Study NN 304-1687">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Study NN 304-1687 compares NPH insulin with insulin detemir in the management of type 1 diabetes during pregnancy.</data>
  <data key="d10">clinical trial,comparative treatment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698295</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="4 Mm Needle">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adolescents with thin skin should use a 4 mm needle for safe and effective insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical recommendation,safety</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694482</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="Skin Thickness">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adolescents exhibit higher skin thickness (up to 2.29 mm in buttocks) compared to younger children.</data>
  <data key="d10">age factor,anatomical variation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-4fee4c8681a7629eb6ff0eb2470a98e3</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695241</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="Subcutaneous Pinch">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adolescents are advised to use a subcutaneous pinch during insulin injection, especially when subcutaneous tissue is limited.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection safety,patient requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696013</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="Needle Angle">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adolescents should use a 45° needle angle during insulin injection, particularly with longer needles.</data>
  <data key="d10">patient-specific technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696016</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adolescents" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adolescents aged 13–17 were included in a study on Novolin® R, showing pharmacokinetic similarities to adults but with noted differences in Cmax.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage titration,pharmacokinetic study</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-001d95b4722fb6304af5e929d80557ac</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699170</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Rapid-acting insulin can be mixed in the same syringe as intermediate-acting insulin when following the correct sequence.</data>
  <data key="d10">medication preparation,mixing protocol</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694552</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Intermediate-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Intermediate-acting insulin is mixed with rapid-acting insulin in a syringe using a specific order to prevent contamination.</data>
  <data key="d10">medication preparation,mixing protocol</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694553</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Used Syringe Disposal">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">After use, the insulin syringe must be disposed of in a designated sharps container to prevent needlestick injuries.</data>
  <data key="d10">safety protocol,waste management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694557</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Injection Technique">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin syringes with 30U or 50U capacity allow for accurate dosing and are recommended for patients needing fine insulin adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery method,dosing precision</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ee3024e95a663f89ec3c7a35028cc636</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695234</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U100 Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin syringes must be calibrated for U100 insulin to ensure accurate dosing in international units.</data>
  <data key="d10">compatibility,dose measurement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695235</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="International Unit">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Using syringes marked in international units prevents errors since insulin is prescribed in IU, not milliliters.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin syringes are calibrated in international units (UI) to match the standard prescription units for insulin, ensuring accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">calibration,dosage measurement,dosing accuracy,measurement system</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e883257c402587c2aedd0509191bc233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696041</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Vial Rubber Stopper">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The rubber stopper of the insulin vial must be disinfected with alcohol before the syringe needle penetrates it.</data>
  <data key="d10">infection control,sterile technique</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696017</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Air Bubbles">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Air bubbles in the syringe reduce the actual insulin dose delivered and must be removed before injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose accuracy,preparation error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-78692c868b2064d1fbeaf7aec1c44948</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696018</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U40 Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">U40 insulin must be used with syringes calibrated for 40 units per milliliter to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">concentration-specific equipment,dosing accuracy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696033</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U200 Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">U200 insulin requires syringes or pens specifically designed for high-concentration insulin to ensure accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">concentration-specific equipment,dosing accuracy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696033</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="U500 Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">U500 insulin requires specialized syringes or pens to ensure accurate administration due to its high concentration.</data>
  <data key="d10">concentration-specific equipment,dosing accuracy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696034</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="6 mm Needle">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The 6 mm needle is the shortest available for syringes and is recommended for safe subcutaneous insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">minimal pain,safe injection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb4a4dec39574c303988e93b87c351d4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696035</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Fixed-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Fixed-needle syringes are recommended for insulin preparation because they eliminate residual space and improve dosing accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fixed-needle syringes are recommended over removable-needle types for safer and more accurate insulin preparation.</data>
  <data key="d10">device recommendation,device type,dosing accuracy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696368</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Removable-Needle Syringe">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Removable-needle syringes may retain insulin in the dead space, increasing the risk of dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d10">device type,dosing error risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a81bec86298f297d9be7cc985a7eddb6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696040</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Milliliter Syringe">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Syringes graduated in milliliters should not be used for insulin due to the high risk of dosing errors, as insulin is prescribed in international units.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage error risk,unit mismatch</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696370</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Insulin Application Devices">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin syringes are a type of insulin application device used for accurate delivery of insulin doses.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration tool,device category</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c8702ff00244abf3caabafff5aad4a65</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696371</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Novolin® R Penfill">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In emergencies, Novolin® R can be aspirated from the cartridge using an insulin syringe when a vial is unavailable.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration method,emergency use</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ff021af578e58080f6a865c5f105e6d3</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699086</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R vials must be used with insulin syringes that match the unit scale for accurate dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration tool,dosage accuracy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b2339435aa42eeb6f0cb8bffbf4d5184</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699198</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Syringe" target="Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">An insulin syringe is used to administer corrective insulin doses when treating severe hyperglycemia, especially if ketones are present.</data>
  <data key="d10">emergency use,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e910e1b2954d8b793bb4671174d8d92f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704381</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Administration" target="Syringe and Vial">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Syringe and Vial is a conventional method for insulin delivery requiring careful preparation.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery method,traditional use</data>
