<edge source="Intermediate-Acting Insulin" target="Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed with rapid-acting insulin in the same syringe for immediate or later use, following manufacturer guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid-acting and intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed in the same syringe when prepared in the correct order for optimal effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermediate-acting insulin can be mixed with rapid-acting insulin in the same syringe to reduce the number of injections and tailor therapy.</data>
  <data key="d10">combination therapy,insulin combination,insulin compatibility,insulin mixing,treatment flexibility</data>
