</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Therapy" target="Edema">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Edema has been reported during insulin therapy, especially in patients with previously poor metabolic control who improve with intensified treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Edema has been reported as a condition associated with insulin therapy, especially when metabolic control improves significantly after intensification of treatment.</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse effect,metabolic change,metabolic improvement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2df8f5e1333eed2f8c4d2dca734d5e21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8938c7b2cdfb8e023d3ebcda62fd027</data>
