  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin detemir is used in combination with liraglutide and metformin in subjects with type 2 diabetes to evaluate glycemic outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir is studied in combination with liraglutide and metformin for the treatment of type 2 diabetes.</data>
