  <data key="d13">1778694518</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Test Strip" target="Glucose Meter">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The glucose meter relies on test strips containing an enzyme that reacts with blood sugar to generate an electrical signal for measurement.</data>
  <data key="d10">chemical reaction,device component</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694576</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Healthcare Professional">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Healthcare professionals teach patients how to apply insulin correctly and verify understanding by having them repeat the process.</data>
  <data key="d10">education, training</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694531</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
  <data key="d15">Healthcare Professional</data>
  <data key="d16">Patient</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Insulin Application">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Patients must learn and practice insulin application techniques to manage their diabetes effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The patient is learning how to apply insulin independently, with guidance from Chat.&lt;SEP&gt;After instruction, patients or caregivers should repeat the insulin application process to confirm understanding and proper technique.</data>
  <data key="d10">learning process,self-care,self-management,skill verification,treatment adherence,treatment initiation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695456</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Distraction Technique">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Distraction techniques are used to help small children cope during insulin application.</data>
  <data key="d10">pain reduction,pediatric care</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694534</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Chat">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Chat provides step-by-step instructions and answers questions to help the patient safely begin insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical guidance,patient education</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694980</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Application Site">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The patient selects an appropriate application site for insulin injection based on body fat distribution.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection procedure,subcutaneous delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694981</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Skin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The patient must clean the skin with alcohol 70% before injecting insulin to prevent infection.</data>
  <data key="d10">hygiene,injection site preparation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694981</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Cotton">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The patient uses cotton to gently press the injection site if minor bleeding occurs.</data>
  <data key="d10">bleeding management,post-injection care</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694982</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Patient" target="Diabetes Education">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Diabetes education must consider the patient's age, emotional state, and life stage, addressing fears and encouraging questions.</data>
  <data key="d10">emotional support,individualized care</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
