</edge>
<edge source="Blood Glucose" target="Blood Glucose Meter">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Blood glucose levels are measured using a blood glucose meter after changing the infusion set or reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blood Glucose Meter is used to obtain accurate blood glucose readings for insulin dosing and system calibration.</data>
