</edge>
<edge source="Blood Glucose" target="Bolus Wizard Feature">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Elevated blood glucose may trigger a correction bolus through the Bolus Wizard, which prevents the delivery of a Square Wave bolus.&gt;</data>
