</edge>
<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="Levemir">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Proper use of Levemir helps prevent hyperglycemia in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Inadequate Levemir dosing or discontinuation can lead to hyperglycemia, especially in type 1 diabetes.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse effect,control,prevention,treatment indication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-00bac63e27caeb094fe802c0bfe00a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a4232687a569d10d6942d933172488f</data>
