  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="Diabetic Ketoacidosis">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Untreated hyperglycemia in type 1 diabetes can progress to diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Untreated hyperglycemia in type 1 diabetes can result in diabetic ketoacidosis, a life-threatening condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Untreated hyperglycemia, especially with positive ketones, can lead to diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;High blood glucose levels are a defining characteristic of diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d10">acute complication,clinical feature,complication,disease severity,progression,progression risk,symptom association</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-00bac63e27caeb094fe802c0bfe00a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23235296c6ccfffc5ec397dd6b0dc7b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ec727091282384bd8f9c91eb1d29b78</data>
