  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="Insulin Action">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">If insulin action does not match food intake, especially with slow-digesting meals, hyperglycemia may occur after an initial rise.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed glucose rise,insufficient insulin</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0</data>
