<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="MiniMed™ 640G System">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed™ 640G System detects and alerts users to high glucose levels associated with hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G System helps manage and prevent Hyperglycemia using real-time glucose data and bolus guidance.</data>
