<edge source="Healthcare Professional" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A healthcare professional must provide training before using the MiniMed 780G insulin pump and is responsible for prescribing the device.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients using the MiniMed 780G insulin pump are advised to maintain contact with their healthcare professional for safe operation and treatment decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A Healthcare Professional determines the appropriate settings for the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump before insulin use.</data>
  <data key="d10">device setup,medical guidance,prescription,training,treatment oversight</data>
