<edge source="Bolus Insulin" target="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin pump therapy enables flexible bolus insulin delivery, including standard and extended options.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump therapy delivers bolus insulin to manage mealtime or corrective insulin needs.</data>
