  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus insulin is administered to manage blood glucose increases caused by carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus insulin must be adjusted based on accurate carbohydrate intake and individual insulin-to-carbohydrate ratios.</data>
