  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Patients must consume carbohydrates within 30 minutes after injecting Novolin® R to avoid low blood sugar.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients must consume a meal or snack containing Carbohydrate Intake within 30 minutes after injecting Novolin® R to prevent low blood sugar.</data>
