  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Carbohydrate intake is a key input for Bolus Wizard to calculate the required insulin dose for a meal.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohydrate intake in grams is used by the Bolus Wizard to determine the required insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard calculates mealtime insulin dosage based on the amount of carbohydrate intake.</data>
