<edge source="Infusion Set" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump delivers insulin through an infusion set designed for subcutaneous use only.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump connects to the infusion set to deliver insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump connects to an infusion set to deliver insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The Infusion Set connects to the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump to deliver insulin to the body.</data>
