<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Tubing">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Tubing is a component of the infusion set that transports insulin from the reservoir to the cannula.&lt;SEP&gt;The tubing is a component of the infusion set that carries insulin from the reservoir to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The tubing is a part of the infusion set that carries insulin from the reservoir to the body.</data>
