</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Cannula">
  <data key="d8">6.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The cannula is part of the infusion set inserted into the body to deliver insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The cannula is a component of the insertion piece used to deliver insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The cannula is a part of the infusion set used for subcutaneous insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The cannula is part of the infusion set that is inserted into the body to deliver insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The cannula is a key component of the infusion set used to deliver insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Cannula is a key component of the infusion set inserted under the skin for insulin infusion.</data>
