<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Tubing Connector">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The tubing connector links parts of the infusion set and can block vents if liquid enters.&lt;SEP&gt;The tubing connector is part of the infusion set that attaches the tubing to the reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;The tubing connector is part of the infusion set and must be turned clockwise to lock onto the reservoir.</data>
