</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infusion set is a key component of the MiniMed 780G system used for subcutaneous insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Only MiniMed or Medtronic infusion sets specifically designed for the MiniMed 780G system should be used.</data>
