<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Set Change Reminder">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Set Change Reminder tracks the duration between infusion set changes to ensure proper usage and prevent complications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Set Change reminder tracks the duration of infusion set usage and prompts timely replacement based on labeled guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d10">maintenance schedule,maintenance tracking,time monitoring,usage tracking</data>
