</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Reservoir &amp; Set Option">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Reservoir &amp; Set Option initiates the procedure to replace both the Reservoir and Infusion Set simultaneously.</data>
