  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Criticalpump">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infusion set is connected to the Criticalpump for insulin delivery and must be removed if the pump fails.</data>
  <data key="d10">device connection,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c79aff2bfb4c32e8089ffd4b1e5eb5dd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708122</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="General Precautions">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Users must check for leaks in the infusion set to ensure proper insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin delivery,leak detection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a4f0986d34b7b73e98fe14c73abfb6f3</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708205</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Insulin Flow Blocked">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When insulin flow is blocked, the infusion set must be inspected for obstructions or disconnections.</data>
  <data key="d10">system inspection,troubleshooting step</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54631c5494eb3fe006ea9eb279a14651</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708259</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Occlusion">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Occlusions in the infusion set can interrupt insulin delivery, leading to hyperglycemia and diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;An occlusion is a blockage in the infusion set that prevents proper insulin flow.</data>
  <data key="d10">blockage,delivery failure,delivery interruption,hyperglycemia risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708271</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Skin Irritation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Skin irritation, redness, bruising, and pain are potential side effects associated with infusion set use.</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse effect,local reaction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ecf9d231ade525ec71253e4464a9682e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708273</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Rewind">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Following a rewind, a new infusion set must be used when starting a new reservoir setup.</data>
  <data key="d10">component replacement,setup process</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708416</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infusion Set" target="MiniMed 780G">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infusion set delivers insulin from the reservoir to the body in the MiniMed 780G system.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin delivery,site connection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-faf5718341c7a791a86f965a94ffbdbc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
