</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Aspart" target="Study NN 304-1687">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In Study NN 304-1687, insulin aspart is used as the bolus insulin in combination with either insulin detemir or NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">bolus insulin use,combination therapy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
