</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Aspart" target="Study NN 1250-3561">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In Study NN 1250-3561, insulin aspart is used as the bolus insulin in combination with either insulin degludec or insulin detemir.</data>
  <data key="d10">bolus insulin,combination therapy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
