<edge source="Diabetic Ketoacidosis" target="Sensor Glucose Reading">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When sensor glucose readings are inaccurate and significantly lower than actual blood glucose levels, the risk of undetected hyperglycemia increases, potentially leading to diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
