<edge source="Bolus" target="Dual Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A dual wave bolus is a type of bolus that combines immediate and extended insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A Dual Wave bolus is a specific type of bolus dose that includes both immediate and extended delivery components.</data>
