<edge source="Bolus" target="Square Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A square wave bolus is a type of bolus that delivers insulin gradually over a specified duration.&lt;SEP&gt;A Square Wave bolus is a type of bolus that delivers insulin over an extended period.</data>
