<edge source="Correction Bolus" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard is used to calculate and administer a correction bolus to address elevated blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard calculates correction bolus amounts based on the current blood glucose level, BG target, and insulin sensitivity factor.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">dose calculation,glucose correction</data>
