</edge>
<edge source="Correction Bolus" target="Bolus Wizard™">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard™ calculates the insulin required for a correction bolus to address high blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard™ calculates the correction bolus based on current blood glucose, target levels, insulin sensitivity, and active insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard™ applies the FSI to calculate the correction bolus based on current and target glucose levels.</data>
