<edge source="Correction Bolus" target="Insulin Sensitivity Factor">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin sensitivity factor directly influences the amount of insulin needed in a correction bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;The correction bolus is calculated using the insulin sensitivity factor to determine how much insulin is needed to lower blood glucose.</data>
