<edge source="Insulin Glargine" target="Insulin Detemir">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin detemir has a less variable time-action profile than insulin glargine, as shown in pharmacodynamic studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir provides glycemic control comparable to insulin glargine but with less weight gain.&lt;SEP&gt;The pharmacodynamic profile of insulin detemir shows significantly less intraindividual variability compared to insulin glargine.</data>
  <data key="d10">comparative pharmacodynamics, variability, comparative efficacy, glycemic control, pharmacodynamic variability, insulin profile</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-590fb2f5c50ef31a5fd415bb01def92d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-975d0ad130a42cf2fe8a0f91e4da2b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c23215af0c479dce9c09bed4cc782d20</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698201</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
  <data key="d15">Insulin Detemir</data>
  <data key="d16">Insulin Glargine</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Detemir" target="Weight Gain">
