  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir is approved for use in pediatric patients aged 1 year and older, with safety and efficacy not established for those under 1 year.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir is approved for use in pediatric patients aged 1 year and older, with safety and efficacy not established in infants under 1 year of age.</data>
