<edge source="Insulina Degludeca" target="Levemir">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir was compared to insulin degludeca in clinical trials, showing similar HbA1c control but a higher rate of hypoglycemia with ketosis.&lt;SEP&gt;In a clinical study, Levemir showed a significantly higher rate of hyperglycemic episodes with ketosis compared to insulina degludeca in patients with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir was compared to Insulina Degludeca, showing a higher rate of hyperglycemic episodes with ketosis for Levemir.</data>
  <data key="d10">clinical comparison,clinical trial,comparative efficacy,hypoglycemia risk,safety profile</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d80de93eae49980367cf11700b83b1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24500f5f12a941115e4e44763af8133&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302e8ebf2cacce3164fd241fd39db173</data>
