<edge source="Square Wave Bolus" target="Dual Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Both Square Wave and Dual Wave boluses are advanced delivery methods for managing insulin over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Dual Wave bolus incorporates a Square Wave bolus as part of its delayed insulin delivery component.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dual Wave bolus includes a Square Wave bolus component to provide extended insulin delivery following an immediate bolus.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The Dual Wave bolus combines a normal bolus with a Square Wave bolus for immediate and extended insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">bolus combination,bolus types,combination therapy,combined use,component integration,extended delivery,sequential delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654d7a203c4eab9f3a89f577edc2a5ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90de561bcfc1f3544a690722c75e6f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707635</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Square Wave Bolus" target="Duration">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Duration defines the time period over which the Square Wave bolus is delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Duration sets the time over which a Square Wave Bolus is delivered.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery parameter,delivery profile,time configuration,time setting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04894d0f5474b256de7a1a0bab9d3d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242a9653f8dc2ed51da6a6ddd865d93f</data>
