  <data key="d13">1778707681</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Square Wave Bolus" target="Preset Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">To set a Preset bolus as a Square Wave bolus, the Square Wave bolus feature must be turned on.&lt;SEP&gt;A Preset Bolus can be configured as a Square Wave Bolus, which delivers insulin over a set duration.</data>
  <data key="d10">bolus type,configuration requirement,feature dependency,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04894d0f5474b256de7a1a0bab9d3d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242a9653f8dc2ed51da6a6ddd865d93f</data>
