  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Wave Bolus" target="Preset Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">To set a Preset bolus as a Dual Wave bolus, the Dual Wave bolus feature must be enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;A Preset Bolus can be configured as a Dual Wave Bolus, delivering part immediately and part over time.</data>
  <data key="d10">bolus type,configuration requirement,feature dependency,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04894d0f5474b256de7a1a0bab9d3d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242a9653f8dc2ed51da6a6ddd865d93f</data>
