<edge source="Dual Wave Bolus" target="Elevated Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A Dual Wave bolus can be used when a meal bolus is combined with a correction bolus to address elevated blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">combined therapy,correction dosing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708121</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Wave Bolus" target="Bolus Delivery">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Dual Wave bolus is used when both immediate and extended insulin delivery are needed, such as for complex meals or combined corrections.</data>
  <data key="d10">combined strategy,extended release</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450</data>
