  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Dual Wave bolus feature must be turned on in Delivery Settings before a Dual Wave bolus can be delivered.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation requirement,feature dependency</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ca312edfca5f05d148819c17f1d55943</data>
