</edge>
<edge source="Dual Wave Bolus" target="Square Percentage">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Square Percentage determines the portion of the Dual Wave bolus delivered gradually over the set duration.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage distribution,extended delivery</data>
