  <data key="d9">Acetaminophen can falsely elevate sensor glucose readings, leading to inaccurate glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;Acetaminophen can cause falsely elevated sensor glucose readings, which may lead to incorrect insulin dosing.</data>
