  <data key="d13">1778708401</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Basal Rate Pattern">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Basal rate patterns determine the amount and timing of insulin delivery throughout the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal rate patterns define the scheduled insulin delivery rates throughout the day, which can be customized based on activity levels or lifestyle needs.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage control,insulin adjustment,insulin scheduling,programmable schedule</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b2f934e06027507283d7abfd94d072e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8190aff898356450e3514b751c9193c1</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704310</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SmartGuard adjusts insulin delivery automatically based on CGM glucose trends and thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard controls insulin delivery based on sensor readings and system rules, suspending or resuming as needed.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard assists in insulin delivery by managing meal boluses and providing graphical feedback.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated control,automation,bolus management,delivery control,glucose response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a4dae9b37ffd9805fb682b2152950552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4edd508820d00eb32799ddeb35366f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707539</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="High SG Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When a High SG Alert occurs, users are advised to check BG, treat as necessary, and inspect the infusion set.</data>
  <data key="d10">hyperglycemia management,treatment response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a4dae9b37ffd9805fb682b2152950552</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707540</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Low SG Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low SG Alert does not suspend insulin delivery, so users must manually confirm with BG and treat accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d10">hypoglycemia prevention,safety protocol</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a4dae9b37ffd9805fb682b2152950552</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707541</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Suspend Before Low">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend Before Low feature automatically suspends insulin delivery when low glucose levels are predicted.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated control,suspension</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-77d9c07e6a38b29ecca31e8c42df37e6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707765</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Suspend On Low">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend On Low feature suspends insulin delivery when sensor glucose levels fall below the set threshold.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated control,suspension</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-77d9c07e6a38b29ecca31e8c42df37e6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707767</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Basal Insulin Delivery">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Basal insulin delivery is a component of insulin delivery that resumes automatically after suspension under specific glucose conditions.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery mode,resumption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-77d9c07e6a38b29ecca31e8c42df37e6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707769</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="iCGM 25">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">iCGM 25 supports insulin delivery through integrated continuous glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose monitoring,system integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
