  <data key="d13">1778707925</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Insulin Flow Blocked Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Insulin Flow Blocked Alarm is triggered when there is an obstruction in the insulin delivery mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery failure,system alert</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707928</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Low Battery Pump Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low Battery Pump Alert indicates that insulin delivery may be compromised due to insufficient power.</data>
  <data key="d10">power dependency,system reliability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707930</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Low Reservoir Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low Reservoir Alert warns that insulin delivery may soon be interrupted due to low insulin supply.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery continuity,supply monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707932</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="No Reservoir Detected Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The No Reservoir Detected Alarm indicates a failure to initiate insulin delivery due to missing reservoir.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery failure,setup error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707934</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Pump Restarted Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Pump Restarted Alarm may indicate a temporary disruption in insulin delivery due to unexpected reboot.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery interruption,system stability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707936</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Replace Battery Now Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Replace Battery Now Alarm signals an urgent need to maintain power for continued insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery risk,power critical</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3e357d257472a32b4391dbea0465b3b0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707938</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Suspend Before Low Event">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend before low event causes insulin delivery to be suspended when low glucose is predicted.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin suspension,predictive control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2ef0e6e09cd17187cd967e6d49a3e718</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708026</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Suspend On Low Event">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend on low event stops insulin delivery when sensor glucose reaches or falls below the low limit.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin suspension,threshold trigger</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2ef0e6e09cd17187cd967e6d49a3e718</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708027</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature controls insulin delivery automatically based on glucose readings and system settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature controls insulin delivery based on SG readings to minimize hypoglycemia risk and maintain target glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated control,dependency,glucose regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-53048131930fe8817679e51d5bec009b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708069</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="CareLink Uploader">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The CareLink uploader enables data retrieval from the pump, which supports monitoring of insulin delivery and therapy adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d10">data access,therapy monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-7d37ccd138ed8a095eb197006a33b8a7</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708070</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Bolus Speed">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus speed determines how fast insulin is delivered during a bolus, with standard or quick rate options available.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery rate,pump operation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708119</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Pump">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump delivers insulin, which is temporarily suspended during the self test for up to two minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump is responsible for insulin delivery, which stops when the battery is low or a system error occurs.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery mechanism,interruption,suspension during test,treatment function</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-6cf249079ffd8aa0f06700895b8b7e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708157</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="General Precautions">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump does not alert for insulin degradation or infusion set leaks, requiring manual checks.</data>
  <data key="d10">error detection,system monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a4f0986d34b7b73e98fe14c73abfb6f3</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708207</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Battery">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin delivery depends on battery power and stops when the battery is too low and not replaced.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery continuity,power requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708413</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Delivery" target="Reservoir">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin delivery requires a filled reservoir, and delivery stops if the reservoir is empty.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery necessity,supply source</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708414</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Adverse Events" target="ООО «Рош Диабетес Кеа Рус»">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Reports of adverse events associated with the use of medical devices must be submitted to ООО «Рош Диабетес Кеа Рус» as the authorized representative.</data>
  <data key="d10">incident reporting,regulatory requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a66c98111c91022bbcbc621e0fea07fe</data>
