</edge>
<edge source="Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics" target="Bode B">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bode B et al. published a study on the Guardian Continuous Monitoring System in Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics.</data>
