<edge source="Metformina" target="Liraglutida">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Liraglutida and metformina are used together as an initial treatment regimen in type 2 diabetes patients before adding Levemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Liraglutida and metformina are used together in clinical studies to improve glycemic outcomes in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Liraglutida and Metformina are used together as initial therapy in type 2 diabetes, with 61% of patients achieving HbA1c &lt;7% in the combination group.</data>
  <data key="d10">combination therapy,diabetes management,initial treatment,synergistic effect</data>
