<edge source="Pregnant Women" target="45° Angle Injection">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pregnant women should inject insulin at a 45° angle to reduce the risk of intramuscular injection due to stretched abdominal skin.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection technique,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694484</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pregnant Women" target="Subcutaneous Skin Fold">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pregnant women are advised to use the subcutaneous skin fold technique as a safety measure during insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d10">maternal health,safety precaution</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695440</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pregnant Women" target="Subcutaneous Pinch">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pregnant women should use a subcutaneous pinch during insulin injection regardless of needle length.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection safety,patient requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696014</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pregnant Women" target="Needle Angle">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pregnant women should use a 45° needle angle when using needles longer than 5 mm during insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">patient-specific technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696015</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pregnant Women" target="Third Trimester Of Pregnancy">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">During the third trimester of pregnancy, insulin injections should not be administered in the abdomen.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical guideline,temporal restriction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5bbc7b2df438b8290a4da57f63f1ff5d</data>
