  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Crianças" target="Prega Subcutânea">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Children, especially those under 6 years, should use a 4 mm needle with a skin pinch to ensure safe and effective insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">pediatric use,safety protocol</data>
