</edge>
<edge source="Subcutaneous Injection" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R FlexPen® is primarily administered via subcutaneous injection, especially in the abdominal wall for faster absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R FlexPen® is administered subcutaneously in the abdomen, thigh, gluteal, or deltoid regions with site rotation.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration route,drug delivery,injection method</data>
