</edge>
<edge source="Seringa" target="Descarte De Serings E Agulhas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Used syringes must be disposed of properly in rigid containers and through healthcare services to prevent injury and environmental harm.</data>
  <data key="d10">disposal protocol,medical waste</data>
