  <data key="d13">1778698234</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Excipients">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hypersensitivity to any of the excipients in Levemir is a contraindication for its use.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">contraindication,pharmaceutical formulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-7a4232687a569d10d6942d933172488f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698235</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Penfill">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir is available in a formulation compatible with the Penfill injection device.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Penfill is a device used for the subcutaneous administration of Levemir insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration method,device compatibility,drug delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-7a4232687a569d10d6942d933172488f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef496454c12f85ff1f62de19e8a22be4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698236</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Oral Antidiabetic">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir may be combined with oral antidiabetic agents for the treatment of type 2 diabetes in adults.</data>
  <data key="d10">combination therapy,diabetes management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-fdd292edf157383567920d27a920c13f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698239</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Dose Titration">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dose of Levemir must be adjusted based on individual patient needs and fasting glucose measurements.</data>
  <data key="d10">individualized dosing,treatment adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-fdd292edf157383567920d27a920c13f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698239</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Levemir® Flexpen®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir is the insulin medication administered using the Levemir® FlexPen® device.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir is available in the form of Levemir® FlexPen®, a pre-filled insulin pen device.</data>
  <data key="d10">brand variant,drug delivery,medication delivery,pharmaceutical formulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c04e4797bbd8720e9c40ccd6a195cf12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c339ce22a1216d3b019fe67db4ddc37</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698241</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir" target="Levemir® Penfill®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir is the insulin contained within the Levemir® Penfill® cartridge for use in insulin pens.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir is also available as Levemir® Penfill®, a cartridge system for use with reusable insulin pens.</data>
  <data key="d10">brand variant,drug delivery,drug formulation,medication container</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c04e4797bbd8720e9c40ccd6a195cf12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c339ce22a1216d3b019fe67db4ddc37</data>
