  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin is applied to recommended injection sites such as the abdomen, thigh, arm, or flanks using correct technique.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should be injected into recommended areas such as the abdomen, thigh, arm, or flanks for optimal absorption.</data>
