  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Alcohol 70% is applied to the injection site to disinfect the skin before insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection site should be cleaned with alcohol 70% and allowed to dry before insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection site must be cleaned with alcohol 70% before insulin administration to prevent infection.</data>
