  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Armazenamento de Insulina" target="Vacinas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Vaccines and insulin should not be stored in the same refrigerator section to maintain proper temperature and prevent confusion.</data>
  <data key="d10">storage separation,temperature control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696025</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Aplicação de Insulina" target="Safe Insulin Injection Procedure">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The safe insulin injection procedure outlines the correct steps for administering insulin, including skin pinching and waiting 10 seconds before needle removal.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection technique,step-by-step process</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694559</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ajuste de Dose de Insulina" target="Profissional de Saúde">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">O ajuste de dose de insulina deve ser feito com orientação de um profissional de saúde, com base em mudanças no peso, rotina ou saúde.</data>
  <data key="d10">orientação,revisão</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694558</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Cold Compress">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Applying a cold compress can slow insulin absorption and potentially increase blood sugar levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">hyperglycemia risk,slower absorption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778694568</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Buttock">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The buttock has one of the slowest insulin absorption rates and is often used for longer-acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection site,slowest absorption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695434</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Cold">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Cold exposure from cold compresses or baths slows insulin absorption, potentially increasing blood sugar levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">hyperglycemia risk,slowed absorption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695438</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Absorption Rate" target="Massage">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Massaging the injection site after insulin administration increases absorption speed and the risk of hypoglycemia; it should be avoided.</data>
  <data key="d10">accelerated absorption,hypoglycemia risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695439</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Elliott P. Joslin" target="Diabetes Education">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Elliott P. Joslin emphasized patient education and pioneered home-based diabetes training for insulin use.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin emphasized patient education and helped train nurses to teach diabetes management at home after insulin's discovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin promoted patient education in diabetes care and expanded the role of nurses in community-based instruction.</data>
  <data key="d10">advocacy,historical contribution,patient training</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04357a03a35f68e0068d23b80593b8c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778695991</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Diabetes Education" target="Healthcare Professionals">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Healthcare professionals are responsible for educating patients and caregivers on safe and effective insulin use.</data>
  <data key="d10">patient support,training responsibility</data>
