<edge source="Músculo" target="Insulina Humana">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In muscle tissue, human insulin facilitates intracellular glucose and amino acid transport and promotes protein anabolism while inhibiting catabolism.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose uptake,protein anabolism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b24ac2a9beff09325af7272be567cf82</data>
