  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Premixed insulin formulations require homogenization to maintain consistent potency and dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Premixed insulin formulations require correct homogenization to maintain consistent concentration and clinical effectiveness.</data>
