<edge source="Insulina R" target="Enfermeira">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The nurse administered insulin R using an inappropriate syringe, contributing to patient hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosing error,incorrect administration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696020</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enfermeira" target="Seringa de 1 mL">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The nurse used a 1 mL syringe graduated in mL to aspirate insulin, which is not intended for insulin preparation.</data>
  <data key="d10">improper use,medication error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696019</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enfermeira" target="Desconhecimento das Diferenças entre Escalas de Seringas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The nurse's lack of understanding about syringe graduations led to using a 1 mL syringe for insulin preparation.</data>
  <data key="d10">knowledge gap,medication error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696022</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enfermeira" target="Risco de Aplicação IM">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The nurse was unaware of the risks associated with using a 13 mm needle for insulin injection, increasing the chance of intramuscular delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">injection risk,knowledge gap</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696022</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Técnico de Enfermagem" target="Frascos-Ampola de Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The nursing technician failed to agitate the insulin vial before drawing the dose, resulting in inconsistent insulin concentration.</data>
  <data key="d10">improper handling,preparation error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778696022</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Responsável" target="Caneta de Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The caregiver left the needle attached to the insulin pen, causing air entry and insulin leakage from the cartridge.</data>
  <data key="d10">device misuse,medication error</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9c96e22adae6d8c02ec9ce8430d0cf64</data>
