<edge source="Cutaneous Amyloidosis" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">7.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Cutaneous amyloidosis has been reported at injection sites of insulin, including Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous amyloidosis is a rare adverse effect linked to repeated insulin injections, including Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Long-term use of Novolin® R without site rotation may lead to cutaneous amyloidosis, which can delay insulin absorption and worsen glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous amyloidosis is a rare skin complication from repeated insulin injections, reducible by site rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous amyloidosis may develop at injection sites with Novolin® R, potentially causing delayed insulin absorption and metabolic instability.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated injections of Novolin® R at the same site may lead to Cutaneous Amyloidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutaneous amyloidosis is a rare condition that may develop at the site of repeated Novolin® R injections.</data>
  <data key="d10">absorption impairment,adverse effect,complication,injection risk,injection site reaction,injection site risk,prevention,rare complication,risk factor,skin disorder,tissue effect</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2d59277cc4b25262a26a88992bfb526f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1d7f92cdb7923807a9067d937837a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db353458c93e1b1abc9f696ebf195a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001d95b4722fb6304af5e929d80557ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2339435aa42eeb6f0cb8bffbf4d5184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc71d03de36b3a734f3f7eff9922da5d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699069</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cutaneous Amyloidosis" target="Injection Site Reaction">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Cutaneous amyloidosis is a potential consequence of repeated insulin injections at the same site, leading to delayed insulin absorption and poor glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d10">impaired absorption,tissue damage</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a0ee5ffd422bf5c38703d11eefbcff6f</data>
