  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir® is used in combination with liraglutida to enhance glycemic control in patients with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;No clinically relevant pharmacokinetic or pharmacodynamic interaction was observed between Levemir® and liraglutida when administered together.</data>
  <data key="d10">co-administration,combination therapy,drug interaction,pharmacological interaction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2e2fd1844a95ab6fd4f7d89cdbddbc58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba8a91b916675f6f4ef560f6976957e</data>
