<edge source="Levemir®" target="FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir® is administered using the FlexPen® device, which facilitates precise and convenient insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexPen® is a pen device used for the subcutaneous administration of Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® is available in the FlexPen® pre-filled pen format.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration method,delivery method,drug delivery,pharmaceutical device,product compatibility</data>
