  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Dose Selector">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dose selector is a key component of the Levemir® FlexPen® used to set the desired insulin dose before injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose setting,mechanism control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698347</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Injection Button">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The injection button on the Levemir® FlexPen® must be fully pressed to deliver the insulin dose and confirm complete administration.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation,dose delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698348</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Dose Indicator">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dose indicator on the Levemir® FlexPen® must align with zero after injection to confirm that the full insulin dose was delivered.</data>
  <data key="d10">alignment,dose verification</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698349</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Residual Scale">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The residual scale on the Levemir® FlexPen® gives an approximate view of remaining insulin but should not be used to determine exact dose amounts.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin estimation,non-precision</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698350</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Countdown">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">After pressing the injection button, the user must hold it for at least 6 seconds to ensure complete insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose assurance,timing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698355</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Contamination">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Leaving the needle attached after injection increases the risk of contamination and infection, so it must be removed.</data>
  <data key="d10">device safety,risk prevention</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698362</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Cross-Infection">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Sharing the Levemir® FlexPen® or needles can lead to cross-infection, so the device must be used by one person only.</data>
  <data key="d10">infection control,personal use</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698363</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Carpule">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The carpule is a component of the Levemir® FlexPen® that stores the insulin before injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,insulin storage</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698387</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Seletor De Dose">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The seletor de dose is part of the Levemir® FlexPen® used to select the required insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose control,mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698390</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Botão Injetor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The botão injetor is pressed to deliver insulin from the Levemir® FlexPen® after dose selection.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation,injection mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698390</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Escala Residual">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The escala residual on the Levemir® FlexPen® indicates the amount of insulin remaining in the carpule.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose monitoring,remaining insulin</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698394</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Dose Inaccuracy">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Malfunction or improper use of the Levemir® FlexPen® may result in dose inaccuracy, affecting blood sugar control.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage error,malfunction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698400</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Needle Blockage">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A blocked needle prevents insulin from being delivered through the Levemir® FlexPen®, even if the dose counter moves.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery failure,obstruction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698402</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® FlexPen®" target="Device Malfunction">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">If the Levemir® FlexPen® shows signs of device malfunction, it must be replaced with a new system.</data>
  <data key="d10">replacement,system failure</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5d212ccdded1e4ccf51af243a8d38b4c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698404</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Levemir® Flexpen®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir® FlexPen® and Levemir® Penfill® are related as compatible components for insulin delivery, with Penfill® cartridges used in FlexPen® devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Both Levemir® FlexPen® and Levemir® Penfill® are delivery forms of the same insulin product.</data>
  <data key="d10">compatibility,delivery system,medical device integration,product variant</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c04e4797bbd8720e9c40ccd6a195cf12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c339ce22a1216d3b019fe67db4ddc37</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698238</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Cuidados De Armazenamento Do Medicamento">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Cuidados de Armazenamento do Medicamento apply to Levemir® Penfill® to ensure the insulin remains effective.</data>
  <data key="d10">product stability,storage conditions</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c04e4797bbd8720e9c40ccd6a195cf12</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698239</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Carpule">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Levemir® Penfill® insulin is supplied in 3 mL carpules, each containing 300 units of insulin detemir.</data>
  <data key="d10">packaging,storage</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698350</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="NOVO NORDISK FARM. DO BRASIL LTDA.">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NOVO NORDISK FARM. DO BRASIL LTDA. is the manufacturer responsible for producing Levemir® Penfill®.</data>
  <data key="d10">manufacturing,production</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698353</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Glycerol">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Glycerol is an excipient in Levemir® Penfill® that helps maintain the solution's osmotic balance.</data>
  <data key="d10">excipient function,formulation component</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698353</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Fenol">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Fenol is included in Levemir® Penfill® to prevent microbial contamination.</data>
  <data key="d10">formulation component,preservative</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-5561a191d3b525d406e49933648e27bf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778698360</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir® Penfill®" target="Metacresol">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Metacresol acts as a preservative in Levemir® Penfill® to ensure the solution remains sterile.</data>
