</edge>
<edge source="Thermal Protection Packaging" target="Novolin® R Penfill">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">During transport, Novolin® R Penfill must be kept in thermal protection packaging to avoid temperature changes and light exposure.</data>
  <data key="d10">environmental protection,transport requirement</data>
