<edge source="Carpule" target="Novolin® R Penfill®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R Penfill® is contained in a carpule designed for use with insulin pens, and the carpule must be kept in its outer packaging to protect from light.&lt;SEP&gt;The Novolin® R Penfill® insulin solution is contained within a carpule designed for use with insulin pens.</data>
  <data key="d10">device compatibility,dosage unit,medication containment,product containment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-62a6c42a674563e36382f398efac64a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a0b8b861ae9af417a572907fe16408</data>
