<edge source="Dose Selector" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dose selector is a key component of the Novolin® R FlexPen® used to set the desired insulin dose before injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">device operation,dose setting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699187</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dose Selector" target="Residual Scale">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The residual scale provides an approximate measure of remaining insulin, but the dose selector must be used for accurate dose setting.</data>
  <data key="d10">device feature,dose estimation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-fc3409d91fe33592f741a0002d70749c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699188</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Injection Button" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The injection button on the Novolin® R FlexPen® must be fully pressed to deliver the selected insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">device operation,dose delivery</data>
