<edge source="Escala Residual" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The escala residual allows users to monitor the remaining insulin volume in the Novolin® R FlexPen® cartridge.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose monitoring,remaining volume</data>
