  <data key="d13">1778699038</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Seletor De Dose" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The seletor de dose allows users to adjust the insulin dose from 1 to 60 units in 1-unit increments on the Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose control,user interface</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699033</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Botão Injetor" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Pressing the botão injetor delivers the selected insulin dose and resets the dose selector to zero.</data>
  <data key="d10">drug delivery,mechanical activation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699034</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tampa Externa" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The tampa externa protects the needle before and after use and should be saved for reattachment after injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">needle protection,usability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699036</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tampa Interna" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The tampa interna must be discarded after needle attachment and should never be reused to prevent injury.</data>
  <data key="d10">disposal,needle safety</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699036</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Selo Protetor" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The selo protetor maintains the sterility of the needle before use and must be removed prior to attaching the needle to the device.</data>
  <data key="d10">needle integrity,preparation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b93b5769e8df2e4aa6c2c1dc9e65fd85</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699037</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Penfill®" target="Novolin R® FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin R® FlexPen® and Penfill® are related as insulin delivery systems, with Penfill® being a compatible cartridge type.</data>
  <data key="d10">compatibility,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3f59efd4d9af0314b057127c7fefd45c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699139</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Novolin® R Penfill">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R Penfill contains insulin human as its active pharmaceutical ingredient.</data>
  <data key="d10">active ingredient,pharmaceutical composition</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ff021af578e58080f6a865c5f105e6d3</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699073</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R contains insulin human as its active substance, which is responsible for its therapeutic effect in diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d10">active ingredient,pharmaceutical composition</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699209</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Metabolism">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin human is metabolized by insulin protease or insulin-degrading enzymes, and possibly protein disulfide isomerase, resulting in inactive metabolites.</data>
  <data key="d10">drug degradation,enzyme activity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699212</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Insulin Antibodies">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin human may bind to circulating insulin antibodies, which affects its distribution and pharmacokinetic behavior in the body.</data>
  <data key="d10">pharmacokinetic influence,protein binding</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699213</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R FlexPen® delivers human insulin as its active pharmaceutical ingredient.</data>
  <data key="d10">drug content,therapeutic agent</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c2e44a4ca961f1a97305607fa263ed91</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699235</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Human" target="Medication Incompatibility">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin human can degrade when mixed with medications containing thiols or sulfides, making such combinations incompatible.</data>
  <data key="d10">degradation risk,drug interaction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c2e44a4ca961f1a97305607fa263ed91</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699235</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Metabolism" target="Protease">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin is metabolized in the body through the action of protease enzymes such as insulin-degrading enzyme.</data>
  <data key="d10">degradation,enzyme action</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699029</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Metabolism" target="Protein Disulfide Isomerase">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Protein disulfide isomerase may play a role in the enzymatic degradation of insulin during metabolism.</data>
  <data key="d10">enzyme involvement,molecular breakdown</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699030</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hypersensitivity" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hypersensitivity to the active ingredient or excipients is a contraindication for using Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
  <data key="d10">allergic reaction,contraindication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699025</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hypersensitivity" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R is contraindicated in patients with hypersensitivity to insulin human or any of the excipients in its formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypersensitivity to Novolin® R or its excipients is a contraindication for its use.</data>
  <data key="d10">adverse reaction,allergic reaction,contraindication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-001d95b4722fb6304af5e929d80557ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43208e8857e43453277beecb7a6c55d5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699171</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Transfer" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Transferring patients to Novolin® R FlexPen® from other insulins requires medical supervision and possible dose or frequency changes.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose adjustment,treatment transition</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-849980827afbc1e3097aed3d19640efe</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699028</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Terminal Half-Life" target="Novolin® R">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The terminal half-life of Novolin® R is determined by its absorption rate from subcutaneous tissue, not by plasma elimination.</data>
  <data key="d10">absorption rate,pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-001d95b4722fb6304af5e929d80557ac</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699169</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Insulina Humana">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R contém insulina humana como ingrediente ativo em sua formulação.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R contains human insulin as its active substance, produced via recombinant DNA technology.</data>
  <data key="d10">active ingredient,formulation,pharmaceutical formulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699057</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Início Da Ação">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The onset of action for Novolin® R occurs within 30 minutes after administration.</data>
  <data key="d10">therapeutic onset,time-action profile</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699058</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Efeito Máximo">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The maximum effect of Novolin® R is achieved between 1.5 and 3.5 hours after injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">peak activity,time-action profile</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699058</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Duração Da Ação">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The total duration of action for Novolin® R lasts approximately 7 to 8 hours.</data>
  <data key="d10">therapeutic duration,time-action profile</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699059</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Via De Administração">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R can be administered subcutaneously, intravenously, or intramuscularly depending on clinical needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R can be administered via subcutaneous, intravenous, or intramuscular routes.</data>
  <data key="d10">administration route,clinical application,clinical use</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699061</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Farmacodinâmica">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R lowers blood glucose by facilitating glucose absorption in cells and inhibiting hepatic glucose production.&lt;SEP&gt;O efeito farmacodinâmico do Novolin® R inclui a redução da glicemia por meio da absorção facilitada de glicose e inibição da produção hepática.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R lowers blood glucose by facilitating glucose uptake in muscle and fat cells and inhibiting hepatic glucose production.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose metabolism,glucose regulation,mechanism of action,pharmacological effect</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699062</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Normoglicemia">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R is used to achieve normoglycemia in diabetic patients, particularly in intensive care settings.&lt;SEP&gt;A administração intravenosa de Novolin® R induziu normoglicemia em pacientes críticos, reduzindo a mortalidade.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous administration of Novolin® R induces normoglycemia, which has been associated with reduced mortality in critically ill patients.</data>
  <data key="d10">clinical outcome,glucose control,glucose regulation,therapeutic goal,therapeutic outcome,treatment goal</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699062</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Farmacocinética">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pharmacokinetics of Novolin® R determine its onset, peak effect, and duration, influenced by administration factors.&lt;SEP&gt;A farmacocinética do Novolin® R é caracterizada por absorção subcutânea com pico entre 1,5 e 2,5 horas e meia-vida terminal de 2 a 5 horas.&lt;SEP&gt;The pharmacokinetics of Novolin® R determine its onset, peak, and duration of action, with peak plasma concentration occurring 1.5–2.5 hours after subcutaneous injection.</data>
  <data key="d10">absorption profile,duration of action,pharmacokinetic behavior,time-action characteristics</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d9cc89371adea01fc1a946ca6d1690</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699063</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Mortalidade">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Intravenous administration of Novolin® R reduced mortality by 42% in surgical patients by maintaining normal glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Induction of normoglycemia with intravenous Novolin® R reduced mortality by 42% in patients undergoing major surgery.</data>
  <data key="d10">clinical benefit,clinical outcome,mortality reduction,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e53353cd9fcafe8d9581b3d0e7980b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a0f540a03b366d4d206f9c895849de</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699064</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Frozen Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulin preparations like Novolin® R that have been frozen become ineffective and should not be used.</data>
  <data key="d10">efficacy loss,storage warning</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2d59277cc4b25262a26a88992bfb526f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778699070</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Infusion Bag">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R can be delivered intravenously using an Infusion Bag made of polypropylene, stable for 24 hours at room temperature.</data>
  <data key="d10">intravenous delivery,stability</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2d59277cc4b25262a26a88992bfb526f</data>
