</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Sodium Chloride 0.9%">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R is compatible with 0.9% sodium chloride solution for intravenous infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium chloride 0.9% is a compatible fluid for intravenous infusion of Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R is compatible with Sodium Chloride 0.9% for intravenous infusion.</data>
  <data key="d10">fluid formulation,infusion compatibility,intravenous use,solution compatibility</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2d59277cc4b25262a26a88992bfb526f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e1d7f92cdb7923807a9067d937837a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2339435aa42eeb6f0cb8bffbf4d5184</data>
