  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R is stable when mixed with 5% dextrose solution in intravenous infusions.&lt;SEP&gt;Dextrose 5% is a compatible fluid for intravenous infusion of Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R can be mixed with Dextrose 5% for intravenous administration.</data>
  <data key="d10">fluid formulation,infusion compatibility,intravenous use,solution compatibility</data>
