</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R" target="Dextrose 10%">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R is stable when combined with 10% dextrose solution in intravenous infusions.&lt;SEP&gt;Dextrose 10% is a compatible fluid for intravenous infusion of Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R is compatible with Dextrose 10% for use in intravenous infusions.</data>
  <data key="d10">fluid formulation,infusion compatibility,intravenous use,solution compatibility</data>
