</edge>
<edge source="Medication Interactions" target="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dosage of Novolin® R FlexPen® may be affected by concomitant use of drugs such as oral antidiabetics, beta-blockers, corticosteroids, and alcohol.</data>
