  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Novolin® R FlexPen® is a delivery device containing insulina humana at a concentration of 100 UI/mL for subcutaneous administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R FlexPen® contains human insulin as its active pharmaceutical ingredient.</data>
