</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R FlexPen®" target="Novolin® R FlexPen® Bula">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Novolin® R FlexPen® Bula provides detailed medical and safety instructions for healthcare professionals regarding the use of the medication.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical guidance,product documentation</data>
