</edge>
<edge source="Novolin® R FlexPen®" target="Air Travel">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">During air travel, Novolin® R FlexPen® should not be placed in checked luggage due to freezing temperatures in the baggage compartment.</data>
