  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Absorption of Novolin® R Penfill occurs subcutaneously, with peak plasma concentration reached in 1.5–2.5 hours.</data>
  <data key="d10">bioavailability,pharmacokinetic process</data>
