<edge source="Insulina Humana" target="Insulina Suina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insulina Humana Biossintética is a safe alternative to Insulina Suína, though with slightly higher glycemic and immunological differences.</data>
  <data key="d10">comparative efficacy,therapeutic alternative</data>
