<edge source="Insulin Degradation" target="Thiols">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Thiols can cause degradation of Novolin® R when mixed in solution, leading to loss of efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d10">chemical incompatibility,drug interaction</data>
