<edge source="Glucosa" target="Higado">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">El hígado almacena glucosa cuando hay insulina y la libera cuando hay glucagón, ayudando a mantener el equilibrio glucémico.</data>
  <data key="d10">release,storage</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-dfd7b4fa0ccd15d540a9299e77dbf1dd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702648</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Indice Basal">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The basal insulin rate is designed to keep glucose levels stable during fasting periods, including overnight and before meals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Indice Basal is adjusted to keep Glucosa levels within the target range before meals, at bedtime, and during the night.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose control,glucose regulation,insulin delivery,insulin regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702652</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Bolus Wizard™">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard™ uses current Glucosa levels to calculate an appropriate insulin bolus.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose correction,insulin calculation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702652</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Factor de Sensibilidad a la Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Factor de Sensibilidad a la Insulina is used to determine how much Glucosa will decrease per unit of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose correction,insulin sensitivity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702653</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Actividad">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Actividad affects Glucosa levels and must be considered when evaluating insulin requirements.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose fluctuation,metabolic impact</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702654</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Cenar Tarde">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Cenar Tarde can lead to unexpected Glucosa fluctuations during the night.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose variability,meal timing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51d265f691032645cfa3e43210043f3a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702655</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Medicamentos Sin Receta">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Over-the-counter medications may affect glucose levels, requiring caution and professional advice before use.</data>
  <data key="d10">drug impact,glucose fluctuation</data>
