  <data key="d13">1778702657</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Insulina En Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus insulin enables the body to utilize glucose that enters the bloodstream after eating.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose regulation,postprandial response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-6900fc7e5ef921c29efe412333f2e7ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702937</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Liquido Intersticial">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When insulin is insufficient, glucose accumulates in the blood and interstitial fluid, leading to elevated levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">fluid accumulation,hyperglycemia</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-6900fc7e5ef921c29efe412333f2e7ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702948</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Hidratos de Carbono">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Consuming carbohydrates raises blood glucose levels, requiring appropriate insulin dosing for control.</data>
  <data key="d10">glycemic response,nutrient impact</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702997</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Proteinas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Proteins, especially when combined with carbohydrates, can lead to a prolonged glucose response requiring adjusted insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed glucose response,macronutrient effect</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703002</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Grasas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Fats slow down digestion and glucose absorption, potentially leading to late post-meal glucose rises.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed absorption,postprandial glucose</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703004</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Actividad Fisica">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Physical activity increases glucose uptake and can increase the risk of hypoglycemia, especially during or after exercise.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose utilization,hypoglycemia risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703011</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Cena Tardia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Eating late at night can alter glucose patterns during sleep, affecting basal insulin needs and hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin timing,nocturnal glucose fluctuation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703016</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Sensor de Glucosa">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The glucose sensor provides real-time glucose readings and trends, enabling detection of lows and informing therapy adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d10">continuous monitoring,trend analysis</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703021</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Páncreas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">El páncreas regula los niveles de glucosa produciendo insulina de forma natural.</data>
  <data key="d10">hormone production,physiological function</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d0fdf7fe6f512616144e110952e56f02</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703081</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa" target="Bolus Cuadrado">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The bolus cuadrado is used to counteract the delayed rise in glucose levels after certain meals.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed elevation,glucose regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e15921d1b7d6415709a3d0c795cefc3c</data>
