  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Basal 1 is an instance of a basal pattern with specific time segments and insulin delivery rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 is a specific instance of a basal pattern used in insulin pump programming.</data>
