<edge source="Basal Pattern" target="Basal Rate">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A basal pattern is composed of multiple basal rates set for different time intervals throughout the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal rates are organized into one or more 24-hour basal patterns that must be manually entered and saved.&lt;SEP&gt;A basal pattern consists of multiple basal rates set for specific time intervals over 24 hours.</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration,insulin programming,rate configuration,scheduling,time-based delivery</data>
