</edge>
<edge source="Basal Pattern" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature evaluates basal patterns and issues a warning if a pattern delivers significantly more insulin than typically required.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature exits if the active basal pattern delivers significantly more insulin than typically needed.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin delivery,safety check,safety warning,system deactivation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-92b103916c0aae66fd1ad9496d81e3dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d37ccd138ed8a095eb197006a33b8a7</data>
