</edge>
<edge source="Basal 1" target="Ufh">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The insulin infusion rate (Ufh) is a key value set within the Basal 1 pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 includes specific Ufh values that define the hourly insulin delivery rate for each time segment.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage configuration,dosage setting,infusion rate,insulin rate</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-cae8b84f90a8e9c929a19f036d8f1e1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1134674d4e1ab07998567f3fa77e251d</data>
