<edge source="Carbohydrate Ratio" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Carbohydrate Ratio is one of the required parameters set in the Bolus Wizard to calculate insulin dosage.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the carbohydrate ratio setting to calculate the appropriate insulin dose based on food intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The Carbohydrate Ratio is a required input parameter for configuring the Bolus Wizard to calculate appropriate insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Carbohydrate Ratio is a required input parameter for the Bolus Wizard to calculate insulin dosage.</data>
