  <data key="d9">The Duration Of Insulin Activity is set in the Bolus Wizard to account for residual insulin when calculating new bolus doses.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard considers the duration of insulin activity to account for insulin still active in the body when calculating new doses.</data>
