  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard™ feature in the MiniMed™ 640G system tracks active insulin and assists in calculating safe bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G insulin pump includes the Bolus Wizard™ feature to calculate insulin doses and display active insulin.</data>
