<edge source="Bolus Wizard™" target="Active Insulin">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard™ checks active insulin levels before suggesting a new bolus to avoid insulin stacking and hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard™ displays active insulin to prevent overdosing by accounting for insulin still in effect.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard™ automatically accounts for Active Insulin when calculating the recommended bolus dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose adjustment,dosing safety,insulin management,insulin tracking,safety check</data>
