  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard™ feature in the MiniMed™ pump calculates recommended bolus insulin doses based on user inputs.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ pump uses the Bolus Wizard™ feature to calculate the appropriate insulin correction dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard™ is a built-in function of the MiniMed™ pump that records bolus data and carbohydrate intake.</data>
