<edge source="Bolus Dual" target="Bolus Cuadrado">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus dual incorporates bolus cuadrado to deliver part of the insulin dose over time, addressing delayed glucose rise from high-fat meals.&lt;SEP&gt;The bolus dual includes a bolus cuadrado component that delivers insulin over time to manage prolonged glucose elevation.</data>
  <data key="d10">combined therapy,delayed digestion,extended administration,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f4b8d4c3fde5ebf7bc3593f47b765f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15921d1b7d6415709a3d0c795cefc3c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704428</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Dual" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard can be used to calculate the total insulin dose for a bolus dual, determining how much is delivered immediately and how much is extended over time.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose calculation,dual-phase delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f4b8d4c3fde5ebf7bc3593f47b765f41</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704429</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Cuadrado" target="Karen">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Karen’s eating pattern at work may benefit from using a bolus cuadrado due to prolonged meal duration.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen uses a bolus cuadrado over 45 minutes to align insulin action with her slow digestion due to distracted eating at work.</data>
  <data key="d10">eating behavior,insulin adjustment,meal timing,personalized treatment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39f2ee843ae28cc44b37c7f51f7722a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b8d4c3fde5ebf7bc3593f47b765f41</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704429</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Cuadrado" target="Gastroparesia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus cuadrado is recommended for patients with gastroparesia due to delayed food digestion.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed digestion,insulin timing</data>
