</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Cuadrado" target="Square Bolus Duration">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The bolus cuadrado is administered over a user-defined square bolus duration, which can be set between 30 minutes and 8 hours.</data>
