<edge source="Glucosa En Sangre" target="Hipoglucemia">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hipoglucemia is defined by low glucosa en sangre levels, specifically below 70 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Glucosa En Sangre levels define the condition of Hipoglucemia, requiring immediate treatment with food or drink.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglucemia occurs when glucosa en sangre is too low, requiring prompt intervention.</data>
  <data key="d10">blood sugar level,low blood sugar,low glucose,low levels,medical condition,symptom response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39f2ee843ae28cc44b37c7f51f7722a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369c90dae1a79813d89bb9a0b31ebfe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc23f53afc0fcecdd9527e9dab84cb8b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702810</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa En Sangre" target="Hiperglucemia">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hiperglucemia occurs when glucosa en sangre exceeds the target range or 250 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Elevated Glucosa En Sangre levels define the condition of Hiperglucemia, requiring treatment and follow-up checks.</data>
  <data key="d10">blood sugar level,elevated levels,high glucose,medical condition</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39f2ee843ae28cc44b37c7f51f7722a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc23f53afc0fcecdd9527e9dab84cb8b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703139</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucosa En Sangre" target="Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Frequent monitoring of glucosa en sangre is required during terapia con bomba de insulina to adjust pump settings.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage adjustment,treatment monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39f2ee843ae28cc44b37c7f51f7722a7</data>
