  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Insulina Activa">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard uses the value of Insulina Activa to adjust the recommended insulin dose and prevent overdose.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard accounts for active insulin from prior boluses (Insulina Activa) when calculating a new corrective dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard adjusts the recommended insulin dose by subtracting the amount of Insulina Activa to prevent insulin overdose.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard accounts for Insulina Activa by subtracting it from the recommended corrective insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">correction factor,dose adjustment,insulin adjustment,insulin calculation,safety mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-edf22db77193377cf626b08881757226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4f908910b79b1f9ccf095fd5fb4035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9acad938fa761961897e399e22d5c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b83b1b837df0b960758dfd02d42d69</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704334</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="GS">
  <data key="d8">6.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard requires the current GS value to determine if a corrective bolus is needed.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard uses the current blood glucose level (GS) as an input to calculate the appropriate insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the current GS reading as an input to calculate the appropriate insulin bolus dose.&lt;SEP&gt;GS values are entered into Bolus Wizard to determine if a corrective insulin dose is needed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the GS value to determine the correct insulin bolus for current glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard uses current GS values to determine if a corrective insulin dose is needed.</data>
  <data key="d10">blood glucose input,blood glucose monitoring,correction factor,corrective dosing,dosage calculation,dose calculation,glucose input,glucose monitoring,input data,input parameter</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-edf22db77193377cf626b08881757226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4f908910b79b1f9ccf095fd5fb4035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed9acad938fa761961897e399e22d5c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b83b1b837df0b960758dfd02d42d69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d74e338f7a37de66d4b2268a49021c4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e15921d1b7d6415709a3d0c795cefc3c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704336</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Hidratos De Carbono">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard uses the amount of Hidratos de Carbono to calculate the mealtime insulin bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the amount of carbohydrates to be consumed to determine the required insulin bolus.</data>
  <data key="d10">carbohydrate counting,dosage calculation,meal dosing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-edf22db77193377cf626b08881757226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89156e5c9ff284920f8f122774e1ee34</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778700987</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Square Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard function is used to configure a square bolus by inputting blood glucose and carbohydrate values.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose calculation,insulin timing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-69f89cc6358f0fe2b490d63a60ae0581</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701004</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Dual Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard function is used to set up a dual bolus by determining the immediate and extended insulin delivery amounts.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose calculation,insulin timing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-69f89cc6358f0fe2b490d63a60ae0581</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701007</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Active Insulin">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard accounts for active insulin in the body to avoid overdosing by adjusting the recommended bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses active insulin data to calculate recommended bolus doses but does not include manually injected insulin in this calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard adjusts the recommended insulin dose by subtracting active insulin from previous boluses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard relies on active insulin data to calculate accurate insulin doses.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculation dependency,dosage accuracy,dose adjustment,insulin calculation,insulin on board,insulin tracking,safety mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-97d9a9de5f40419555bf7bf36cc9f84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0deeba398b22b91d8da1b31653eede4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcdcd9414b427304808016daa676e270</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707611</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Medtronic MiniMed, Inc.">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Medtronic MiniMed, Inc. owns the Bolus Wizard trademark and integrates it into its insulin pump systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard is a registered trademark owned by Medtronic MiniMed, Inc.</data>
  <data key="d10">intellectual property,trademark ownership</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ec9910e322fb247c0bf85c8b8cb3e948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bc46b3924459ec23a123df1dad4bdcb</data>
