<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard feature on the MiniMed 780G insulin pump helps calculate and deliver insulin boluses, including Square Wave and Dual Wave types.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump uses the Bolus Wizard to calculate insulin bolus doses based on user inputs and settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump includes the Bolus Wizard feature to assist users in calculating accurate bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard feature loses active insulin tracking after storage mode, affecting insulin dosage calculations.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated delivery,bolus calculation,data reset,dosage calculation,dose calculation,therapy support,user assistance</data>
