<edge source="Bolus Wizard" target="Carb Ratio">
  <data key="d8">7.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard uses the carb ratio setting to calculate mealtime insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the Carb Ratio to determine the appropriate insulin dose for carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the carb ratio setting to calculate the required insulin dose for carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The carb ratio is a key input used by the Bolus Wizard to calculate insulin doses for carbohydrate coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Carb Ratio setting is used by the Bolus Wizard to determine the amount of insulin needed to cover carbohydrate intake during a meal.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard uses the carb ratio setting to calculate the appropriate insulin dose based on carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Carb ratio is used by the Bolus Wizard to determine insulin dose based on carbohydrate intake.</data>
  <data key="d10">carbohydrate management,configuration,dosage calculation,dose calculation,insulin calculation,insulin dosing,insulin therapy,insulin-to-carb ratio,meal bolus,meal bolus calculation,personalization</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe3d4956e4290b26b4d22092a403c4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d89ab5e0b88b0b0ff15b22db8ae4450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73b840edccb54a2c256450df95d80f4f</data>
