<edge source="Inicio" target="Fin">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The period between Inicio and Fin defines the duration of a basal insulin infusion segment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Inicio and Fin times define the duration over which a specific basal insulin rate is applied.</data>
