  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulina Activa" target="Bolus Wizard®">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bolus Wizard® does not account for insulin administered manually via syringe or pen, so it may miscalculate the active insulin, leading to potential overdose if not manually adjusted.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard® accounts for Insulina Activa by subtracting it from the recommended corrective insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose adjustment,insulin calculation,overdose prevention,safety mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ed9acad938fa761961897e399e22d5c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b83b1b837df0b960758dfd02d42d69</data>
