<edge source="Notification Light" target="Pump">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The red notification light on the pump does not blink when a message occurs, indicating a passive visual status signal.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump uses a notification light, including a red light, to communicate alerts to the user.</data>
