</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Active Insulin">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Active Insulin is displayed on the Home Screen to help users track remaining insulin effect for safe dosing decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The current amount of active insulin, derived from bolus insulin delivered, is displayed on the Home screen for user monitoring.&gt;</data>
