</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Suspend By Sensor Icon">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend By Sensor Icon appears on the Home Screen when low glucose conditions trigger suspension features.&lt;SEP&gt;The suspend by sensor icon appears on the Home screen and shows a red X when suspension features are unavailable.</data>
