  <data key="d13">1778707770</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The home screen displays the SmartGuard shield, current SG value, and active insulin, providing real-time feedback on system status.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard status and controls are accessible from the home screen of the pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">feature access,status display,user interface</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ecb2783153f277b98dbb01bd056cf9a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ad78a5db5d547aed7e2552fb1ec900</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707790</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Delivery Settings">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Users access Delivery Settings from the Home Screen to configure the Bolus Wizard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;Users access Delivery Settings by navigating from the Home Screen through specific button inputs.&lt;SEP&gt;Users access Delivery Settings from the Home Screen to enable or disable the Dual Wave feature.&lt;SEP&gt;Delivery Settings is accessed from the Home Screen through user interaction.</data>
  <data key="d10">menu access,navigation,navigation path,system access,user interface flow</data>
