</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Sensor Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The appearance and functionality of the Home Screen change depending on whether the Sensor Feature is enabled or disabled.&lt;SEP&gt;When the Sensor Feature is active, the Home Screen displays real-time CGM data including the sensor graph and status icons.</data>
  <data key="d10">data display,feature dependency,interface change,interface integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8a6d7d1adf71e2872a4ddf28d3170247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cc4a95eb5f47fc9afc3b30fb1364490</data>
