  <data key="d13">1778707982</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Home Screen interface is modified when the SmartGuard Feature is active, requiring different navigation and display logic.&lt;SEP&gt;The Home Screen displays messages related to the SmartGuard feature, such as "Exit in X:XX hr" or required actions like "Enter BG", informing the user of system status.</data>
  <data key="d10">feature dependency,interface change,status display,user notification</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8a6d7d1adf71e2872a4ddf28d3170247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53048131930fe8817679e51d5bec009b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707984</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Status Icons">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Status Icons are displayed on the Home Screen to provide real-time system status information.&lt;SEP&gt;Status icons, including the alert silence icon, are displayed on the Home screen for system status monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">status display,system monitoring,visual indicator</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8a6d7d1adf71e2872a4ddf28d3170247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-555df1669205bcfa737c81d6936e696e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707986</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="Current Time">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Current Time is displayed on the Home Screen and must be set during the startup process for accurate timekeeping.</data>
  <data key="d10">information display,time reference</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8a6d7d1adf71e2872a4ddf28d3170247</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707987</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Home Screen" target="BG Reading">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The BG Reading is shown on the Home Screen to display the latest blood glucose measurement from a meter.</data>
