<edge source="Basal Index" target="Quick Reference Guide">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The quick reference guide provides instructions for adding and editing basal indices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Quick Reference Guide provides users with information on how to review and adjust basal indices.</data>
