<edge source="Square Bolus" target="Dual Bolus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dual bolus includes a square bolus component that delivers insulin gradually over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Both square and dual bolus are alternative insulin delivery methods used for meals with delayed glucose absorption.</data>
  <data key="d10">alternative delivery methods,delivery method,extended infusion,extended insulin release</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e96a4da2f877f1b93eb7d982c91358ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702753</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Square Bolus" target="Fat And Protein Meal">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The square bolus is suitable for meals with high fat and protein content because it spreads insulin delivery over time.</data>
  <data key="d10">digestion delay,meal-specific therapy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702759</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Bolus" target="William">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">William uses a dual bolus to prevent postprandial hyperglycemia after eating foods like pizza.</data>
  <data key="d10">diabetes management,treatment method</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e96a4da2f877f1b93eb7d982c91358ea</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701040</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Bolus" target="Carbohydrate Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The carbohydrate bolus is divided into 50% immediate and 50% square wave in a dual bolus configuration.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage split,insulin distribution</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e96a4da2f877f1b93eb7d982c91358ea</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701041</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Bolus" target="Corrective Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The corrective bolus is fully added to the immediate portion of the dual bolus.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose addition,immediate delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e96a4da2f877f1b93eb7d982c91358ea</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701042</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual Bolus" target="Fat And Protein Meal">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The dual bolus is recommended for meals high in fat and protein due to their slower digestion and delayed glucose impact.</data>
  <data key="d10">digestion delay,meal-specific therapy</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-835d0624a6c9c20cffbc5a61e5f42de0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702765</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Start Screen">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Start Screen shows the amount of insulin still active from a previous bolus.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage monitoring,insulin tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-08ad1da3ea94a4990f8ed72edc46798f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704424</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Manual Insulin Injection">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Manual insulin injections are not included in the active insulin count, which may lead to incorrect dosage recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculation error,insulin tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704448</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature uses active insulin data to determine safe correction bolus amounts and avoid insulin stacking.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature considers active insulin when calculating bolus adjustments to avoid over-insulinization.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">data tracking,dose calculation,dosing calculation,insulin management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9cb3ef3e959b16d99ac4debc0210965b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707536</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Active Insulin Time">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Active Insulin Time determines the duration for which Active Insulin is tracked in the system.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin tracking,pharmacological modeling</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-583197b9760861a9bb1ee261914759fc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707550</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Bolus Delivery">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Active Insulin levels influence current bolus delivery decisions to avoid excessive insulin in the body.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosing consideration,physiological impact</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04894d0f5474b256de7a1a0bab9d3d9c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707688</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SmartGuard tracks active insulin to determine if and when an auto-correction bolus should be delivered.</data>
  <data key="d10">correction dosing,insulin tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ecb2783153f277b98dbb01bd056cf9a8</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707788</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Preset Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Active Insulin (0.0u) is displayed during Preset Bolus review to indicate current insulin on board.</data>
  <data key="d10">delivery context,pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-242a9653f8dc2ed51da6a6ddd865d93f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708060</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump requires Active Insulin to be cleared before first use to prevent inaccurate delivery and injury.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump displays the current level of active insulin, such as 0.0 U.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin tracking,operational requirement,safety protocol,status monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-30fd82ff17ab8577d82477ed97f94075&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc1664dd2b2f62661bb5b9e88843be38</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708101</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Sensor Glucose">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Active insulin can cause sensor glucose levels to decrease, influencing treatment decisions and insulin dosing.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose decline,insulin effect</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8d8c5703a9383d7fd4b6f1d14f5d5424</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708241</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Bolus Wizard Feature">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard feature uses the active insulin amount to calculate accurate insulin bolus doses.</data>
  <data key="d10">dose calculation,insulin tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39a29f6130bd8284c7277df75ae0e90d</data>
