  <data key="d13">1778708266</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin" target="Clear Active Insulin">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Clear Active Insulin function resets the active insulin value, ensuring accurate future bolus calculations.</data>
  <data key="d10">confirmation,reset</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-39a29f6130bd8284c7277df75ae0e90d</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708267</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Dual/Square Bolus" target="Infusion Settings">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Dual/square bolus is a configurable infusion setting that modifies how insulin is delivered over time.</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration,delivery mode</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-97d9a9de5f40419555bf7bf36cc9f84c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701008</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Predefined Bolus" target="Infusion Settings">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Predefined bolus is a user-configured setting within the infusion settings that allows for quick administration of a saved insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration,dose management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-97d9a9de5f40419555bf7bf36cc9f84c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701009</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Jessica" target="Glucose Level">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Jessica had consistently high glucose levels in the morning before adjusting her basal pattern.</data>
  <data key="d10">blood sugar monitoring,morning hyperglycemia</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701010</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Level" target="Patricia">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Patricia observes that her glucose levels often decrease when she works in the garden, prompting her to adjust her insulin management.&lt;SEP&gt;Patricia observes that her glucose levels decrease during gardening, prompting her to adjust her insulin delivery using a temporary basal rate.</data>
  <data key="d10">health monitoring,physical activity impact,physiological response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b2f934e06027507283d7abfd94d072e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8190aff898356450e3514b751c9193c1</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704310</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Level" target="Dennis">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Dennis checks his glucose level at 22:30 and observes a value of 110 mg/dL, indicating stable glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d10">diabetes management,glucose monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703091</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Level" target="High Fat And Protein Meals">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">High fat and protein meals delay glucose absorption, leading to a slower rise in blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d10">delayed absorption,glycemic response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-75fbd29c63ccce2c6bea49f0301c1cf5</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703097</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Level" target="Basic Status">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Basic Status screen displays the last glucose level entered, along with the time of entry.</data>
  <data key="d10">recent data,status display</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2dc8e0765ea263fbb6747a09d204c99a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704454</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="0.750 U/h" target="Basal 1 Total 24 Hr: 18 U">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A basal rate of 0.750 U/h delivers a total of 18 units of insulin over 24 hours.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage calculation,insulin output</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701014</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="0.900 U/h" target="Basal 1 Total 24 Hr: 21.6 U">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Setting Basal 1 to 0.900 U/h results in a total daily insulin delivery of 21.6 units.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage calculation,insulin output</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701013</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="8:00 A To 6:00 P" target="Basal Insulin Pattern">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A lower basal rate of 0.650 U/h is set for the time segment from 8:00 A to 6:00 P within the basal insulin pattern.</data>
  <data key="d10">rate variation,time-based dosing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e9947b75a4183c17b6384b798fcda161</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704353</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="0.650 U/h" target="Time Segment">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The time segment from 8:00 A to 6:00 P is assigned a basal rate of 0.650 U/h.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage assignment,temporal insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701013</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Edit Basal 1" target="Time Segment">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Within Edit Basal 1, the time segment can be selected to apply different basal rates at different times of the day.</data>
  <data key="d10">rate adjustment,time-based control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d15ff52c19d3f9036826d6260fd4dc1a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701014</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Save" target="Personal Reminder">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Save function stores a newly created or edited Personal Reminder.</data>
  <data key="d10">confirmation,persistence</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-95d8f5f8ae713f2ed252ad1087051b50</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708020</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Save" target="Missed Meal Bolus Reminder">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Save function is used to store the configuration of a Missed Meal Bolus Reminder after setting the Start Time and End Time.</data>
  <data key="d10">confirmation,persistence</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-95d8f5f8ae713f2ed252ad1087051b50</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708026</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Save" target="Preset Bolus Setup">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Save is used to store a configured preset bolus after setting its parameters.</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration completion,data storage</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-242a9653f8dc2ed51da6a6ddd865d93f</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708059</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Save" target="Set Change Reminder">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">After configuring the Set Change reminder, users must select Save to store the changes in the pump system.</data>
  <data key="d10">data persistence,setting confirmation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-54631c5494eb3fe006ea9eb279a14651</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708255</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Time Segment" target="High SG Settings">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">High SG Settings are divided into up to eight time segments to allow customized glucose thresholds throughout the day.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert scheduling,time-based configuration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04fa4143c79ef368662ed10679dc02f0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708236</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Max" target="Equipo Medico">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Adjustments to Basal Max should be made only after consultation with the Equipo Medico.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical oversight,setting adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b28f926a642d5f692433ed41fafafa4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701014</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Max" target="Indice">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Indice value for any time interval must not exceed the Basal Max limit set on the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">rate limit,safety constraint</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b28f926a642d5f692433ed41fafafa4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701015</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus Max" target="Equipo Medico">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Changes to Bolus Max must be approved by the Equipo Medico to ensure patient safety.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical oversight,setting adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b28f926a642d5f692433ed41fafafa4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701015</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Autoapagado" target="Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Autoapagado triggers an alarm when inactivity is detected beyond the set duration.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation,alert system</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-4dc17381a558f271a9da13b99091c2ac</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778701055</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Autoapagado" target="Thomas">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Thomas uses the Autoapagado function to increase his safety during sleep, especially after running days when he is more prone to hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Thomas uses the Autoapagado feature to stop insulin delivery automatically and receive an alarm, helping him sleep more peacefully.</data>
  <data key="d10">device usage,feature usage,personal safety,safety mechanism</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-4dc17381a558f271a9da13b99091c2ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac418ceabab52352571a8024e5602ec4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704341</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Autoapagado" target="Alarmas">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When the Autoapagado function activates, it triggers an alarm to alert the user if they do not respond.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert system,notification trigger</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ac418ceabab52352571a8024e5602ec4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704344</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Equipo Medico" target="Ratio Insulina/Racion">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Equipo Medico helps patients determine their individualized Ratio Insulina/Racion when starting insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;The medical team helps evaluate and adjust the insulin-to-carbohydrate ratio if postprandial glucose levels are too low.</data>
  <data key="d10">carbohydrate management,insulin dosing,medical guidance,ratio determination</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd60281301900b9df0acbe6be09fa2f2</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778702998</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Equipo Medico" target="Factor de Sensibilidad a la Insulina">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The medical team reviews the insulin sensitivity factor if glucose drops too low after a correction bolus.</data>
  <data key="d10">correction bolus,glucose response</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703003</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Equipo Medico" target="Actividad Fisica">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Patients are advised to consult their medical team about managing insulin therapy during physical activity.</data>
  <data key="d10">medical guidance,therapy planning</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b7fe03750967000c5e6da4698616f3cc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703026</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Equipo Medico" target="Ajuste De La Terapia">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The medical team should be consulted to determine appropriate insulin adjustments for alcohol consumption.</data>
  <data key="d10">consultation,treatment adjustment</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b7fe03750967000c5e6da4698616f3cc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778703029</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
