<edge source="SmartGuard" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SmartGuard is an integrated feature of the MiniMed 780G insulin pump that enables automated insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature is implemented within the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to automate insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is a key feature of the MiniMed 780G insulin pump that enables automated basal and correction bolus delivery.</data>
