  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SmartGuard may automatically deliver an Auto Correction bolus to correct high glucose levels and maximize time in range.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto correction bolus is a SmartGuard feature that delivers corrective insulin doses when blood glucose levels are out of range.</data>
