<edge source="SmartGuard" target="Suspend Before Low">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SmartGuard includes the Suspend Before Low feature to prevent hypoglycemia by pausing insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The Suspend Before Low feature is part of the SmartGuard system, which proactively suspends insulin delivery when a low glucose event is predicted.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspend Before Low is a proactive measure by SmartGuard to pause insulin delivery in anticipation of low glucose.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated suspension,glucose anticipation,predictive control,predictive suspension,safety feature</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1ef4fd0fa0c26a81460d7687cc37cf95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60422265d298e0482f6b78dc36f2a16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f39c0ebbd9b32994a3bb5daf68794d7</data>
