<edge source="Basal Rate" target="Basal Rate Pattern">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A basal rate pattern consists of one or more basal rates programmed into the insulin pump to match the user's metabolic needs.&lt;SEP&gt;The basal rate is organized into a basal rate pattern to adjust insulin delivery at specific times.</data>
  <data key="d10">insulin delivery,insulin programming,rate configuration,rate scheduling</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-113df8f96ec77242ec482c5116a12b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f0c4f9a47c13cec124412ac6628a9b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704350</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate" target="0.650 Units Per Hour">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">During the period from 8:00 A.M. to 6:00 P.M., the basal rate is set to 0.650 units per hour.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage level,rate value</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-113df8f96ec77242ec482c5116a12b1e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704351</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate" target="0.900 Units Per Hour">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Outside the 8:00 A.M. to 6:00 P.M. window, the basal rate is set to 0.900 units per hour.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage level,rate value</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-113df8f96ec77242ec482c5116a12b1e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704352</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate" target="0.700 Units Per Hour">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The basal rate is adjusted to 0.700 units per hour from 8:00 A.M. to 5:30 P.M. in the updated configuration.</data>
  <data key="d10">dosage adjustment,rate value</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-113df8f96ec77242ec482c5116a12b1e</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778704352</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate" target="Status Screens">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The status screens show the current basal rate setting and infusion status.</data>
