  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A basal rate for Manual mode must be set before the SmartGuard feature can be enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature adjusts the basal rate based on SG readings to maintain glucose levels within target; when SG data is unavailable, it defaults to a fixed basal rate.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated adjustment,configuration requirement,insulin control,system setup</data>
