<edge source="Alarm" target="Audio/Vibration Pattern">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Audio and vibration patterns for alarms repeat every minute for 10 minutes and then escalate to a siren if not addressed.&lt;SEP&gt;Alarms on the insulin pump use repeated audio and vibration signals every minute for 10 minutes, escalating to a siren if not cleared.</data>
