</edge>
<edge source="Low Blood Sugar" target="15-15 Rule">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The 15-15 rule is applied to treat low blood sugar by administering 15 grams of carbohydrates and reassessing glucose levels after 15 minutes.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose management,treatment protocol</data>
