</edge>
<edge source="Basal Rate Pattern" target="Additional Basal Pattern">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">An additional basal pattern is a type of basal rate pattern specifically designed for use on days with different insulin requirements, which can be created by copying and modifying an existing pattern.</data>
  <data key="d10">pattern customization,schedule adaptation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8190aff898356450e3514b751c9193c1</data>
