</edge>
<edge source="Resume Basal Alert" target="Suspend Before Low">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">After a Suspend Before Low event, the Resume Basal Alert is triggered to prompt the user to restart insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">event response,insulin resumption</data>
