</edge>
<edge source="Resume Basal Alert" target="Suspend Delivery">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Resume Basal Alert occurs when basal insulin delivery resumes after a suspend event, either due to glucose recovery or expiration of the two-hour maximum suspend time.</data>
