</edge>
<edge source="Active Insulin Duration" target="Bolus Wizard Function">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard function considers active insulin duration to avoid overdosing by accounting for insulin still active in the body.</data>
