</edge>
<edge source="Backlight" target="Pump">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump's backlight turns off after inactivity to save battery, and pressing any button reactivates the screen.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump's backlight illuminates the screen and turns off to save power after a period of inactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump's backlight may turn off and can be reactivated by pressing any button to restore the screen display.</data>
  <data key="d10">display control,interface control,interface illumination,power management,power saving,user interaction</data>
