<edge source="Self Test" target="Pump">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump runs a self test to confirm its operational status, during which insulin delivery is suspended.&lt;SEP&gt;The Self Test is performed to check the proper functioning of the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Self Test is a diagnostic function used to verify the proper operation of the pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">diagnostic,diagnostic check,diagnostic procedure,system verification,verification</data>
