<edge source="Pump" target="Sleep Mode">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">After the backlight turns off, the pump enters sleep mode and locks, requiring the user to unlock it before accessing the menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Sleep mode adjusts pump alerts and display to reduce disturbances during sleep.&lt;SEP&gt;Sleep mode is a state of the pump that alters its responsiveness and enables specific features like Easy Bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Sleep Mode adjusts pump behavior for nighttime use, including reduced alerts.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert management,alert reduction,device locking,device state,nighttime setting,operational mode,power management,user setting</data>
