  <data key="d13">1778708300</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Device Not Found">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Device Not Found indicates the pump cannot locate a required connected device such as a sensor or transmitter.</data>
  <data key="d10">connection loss,hardware detection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3f39c0ebbd9b32994a3bb5daf68794d7</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708310</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Device No Longer Compatible">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Device No Longer Compatible indicates that a previously functional device is no longer supported by the pump system.</data>
  <data key="d10">compatibility issue,system update</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3f39c0ebbd9b32994a3bb5daf68794d7</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708311</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature operates through the insulin pump, relying on its hardware and software capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature operates through the pump to adjust insulin but should not be used immediately after manual insulin injections.</data>
  <data key="d10">automated insulin adjustment,device integration,operational platform,safety restriction</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-636516fe857b1b2139aff0d472d8f1ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708363</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Error Code">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump displays error codes during alarms, which can be recorded and used for technical support.</data>
  <data key="d10">diagnostic output,troubleshooting</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0c3f268f97351e2e386387fc46cbd05a</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708419</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Atmospheric Pressure Changes">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Atmospheric pressure changes can cause the pump buttons to become unresponsive for up to 45 minutes.</data>
  <data key="d10">environmental effect,operational impact</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708421</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Airplane Travel">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">During airplane travel, atmospheric pressure changes may cause pump buttons to get stuck and trigger alarms.</data>
  <data key="d10">environmental condition,usage context</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708426</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Pump Buttons">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump buttons are part of the pump interface and may malfunction during pressure changes.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,functionality</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708431</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Tubing Connector">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The tubing connector is part of the infusion set and should be checked for cracks or damage.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,inspection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708432</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Display">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump display times out after 15 seconds to conserve battery power.</data>
  <data key="d10">interface,power management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b570c57fffa2f2a8caae92eb75f2bfd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708433</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Low Battery Pump Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Low Battery Pump alert indicates that the pump battery is low and needs replacement.</data>
