</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Instinct Sensor must be paired with the pump to transmit glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump works with the Instinct sensor, which must be started using the MiniMed Mobile app.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation process,data transmission,device pairing,sensor integration</data>
