  <data key="d13">1778708525</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Wireless Connection">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The pump uses a wireless connection to communicate with the CGM device during pairing and data transmission.</data>
  <data key="d10">communication method,data transfer</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-6f114a018f4d8b34373a039564245abf</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708526</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="MiniMed Mobile App">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed Mobile app pairs with the pump to enable control and monitoring of insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">device pairing,remote control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-636516fe857b1b2139aff0d472d8f1ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708527</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Battery Alarm">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The battery alarm is triggered when the pump loses power, and the pump will shut down after 10 minutes without a new battery.</data>
  <data key="d10">power management,system shutdown</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-636516fe857b1b2139aff0d472d8f1ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708528</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Daily History Screen">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Daily History screen on the pump displays records of insulin delivery, including bolus amounts delivered before an alarm.</data>
  <data key="d10">data display,delivery tracking</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-636516fe857b1b2139aff0d472d8f1ec</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708529</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Sensor Feature">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Sensor feature communicates with the pump when active, enabling glucose monitoring and insulin delivery control.</data>
  <data key="d10">monitoring,system communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-52b837d1e7373efe5b2f10e88f8f3ae4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708531</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Suspend By Sensor Icon">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Suspend By Sensor Icon controls insulin delivery suspension on the pump based on sensor glucose values.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert system,insulin delivery control</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-52b837d1e7373efe5b2f10e88f8f3ae4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708531</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Temporary Network Connection Icon">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Temporary Network Connection Icon indicates when the pump is connected to a remote upload device for data transfer.</data>
  <data key="d10">data transfer,remote connectivity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-52b837d1e7373efe5b2f10e88f8f3ae4</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708533</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sleep Mode" target="Pump Lock">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When the pump enters sleep mode with Block mode enabled, it automatically locks to restrict access to critical features.</data>
  <data key="d10">automatic locking,security</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a9155c2d6ee74c467d00906235fe430b</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707630</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sleep Mode" target="Easy Bolus Feature">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Easy Bolus feature only functions when the pump is in Sleep mode.</data>
  <data key="d10">activation condition,operational requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-04894d0f5474b256de7a1a0bab9d3d9c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707684</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Sleep Mode" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump enters Sleep mode after a period of inactivity to conserve battery power, which does not affect insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d10">power management,user interface</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e7b678b0be6db859b75d0af252e808c1</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708276</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Margaret" target="Status Screens">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Margaret used the status screens to monitor device behavior and adjust settings accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d10">information access,user experience</data>
