  <data key="d13">1778704362</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Blue Adapter" target="CareLink Software">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Blue Adapter uploads system data from the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to CareLink software via a USB connection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blue Adapter enables data transfer from the insulin pump to CareLink Software without using the mobile app.</data>
  <data key="d10">connectivity,data transfer,data upload,hardware interface</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3323a205200ffe0b547b90ddb5919e0</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707688</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Blue Adapter" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Blue Adapter connects the insulin pump to a computer and should be disconnected when not in use to prevent unauthorized access.</data>
  <data key="d10">hardware connection,security practice</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-4a597a39961d2cb246ad385f39cfb886</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708174</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Julia" target="Product Certified Instructor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Julia may consult a product certified instructor to learn about insulin pump use and address frequently asked questions.</data>
  <data key="d10">training,user education</data>
