<edge source="MiniMed™ 640G" target="SAP">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">SAP therapy is implemented using the MiniMed™ 640G system, which integrates insulin pumping with sensor data for automated features.&lt;SEP&gt;El sistema MiniMed™ 640G implementa la terapia SAP para combinar monitoreo continuo y administración de insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G system is designed to support Sensor-Augmented Pump (SAP) therapy by integrating insulin delivery with sensor-based glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">integrated technology,integrated treatment,system function,therapy implementation,therapy system</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-632920359f020e0873ff5b7621b1a7a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b47e3679b82b031ef2f4cb55f5d1ca61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7c10f0a011d51190fa761b5c0aff4ed</data>
