  <data key="d9">The Contour Next Link 2.4 meter is used to obtain blood glucose values that are directly transferred to the MiniMed™ 640G for calibration.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed™ 640G is designed to accept calibration data from the Contour Next Link 2.4 meter for seamless integration.</data>
