<edge source="High-Fat Foods" target="Glucose Absorption">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">High-fat foods slow down digestion and delay glucose absorption, which can result in late postprandial hypoglycemia if insulin timing is not adjusted.</data>
