  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Bolus Wizard feature considers Active Insulin Time to account for insulin still active in the body when calculating new bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard feature uses active insulin time to account for insulin still active in the body when calculating new bolus doses.</data>
