  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature uses sensor glucose readings as primary input to make automated insulin delivery decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature relies on sensor glucose readings to determine bolus insulin amounts.</data>
