<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The SmartGuard feature is an integral function of the MiniMed 780G system that automates insulin dosing based on glucose trends.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature is implemented within the MiniMed 780G system to enable automated insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature is a component of the MiniMed 780G system that provides automated insulin delivery and generates specific alerts.</data>
  <data key="d10">alert generation,automated insulin delivery,device functionality,integrated functionality,system functionality,system integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550045a3f1fc05491e77159dba8b4fd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64e8ebad9c2de6a1aeba1645920f2e35</data>
