  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Clear Active Insulin Feature">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Clear Active Insulin feature must be used to reset tracked insulin data before using the SmartGuard feature if the pump was used for practice or incorrect insulin was programmed.</data>
  <data key="d10">safety procedure,system reset</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708370</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Software Update">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A software update triggers a 5-hour update period during which SmartGuard active insulin information is being refreshed and the feature is unavailable.</data>
  <data key="d10">data refresh,system reset</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708371</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Power Loss">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A power loss causes a complete pump reset, initiating a 5-hour update period before SmartGuard active insulin data becomes valid.</data>
  <data key="d10">data refresh,system reset</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8556667d5fd37aa22e0f1652c667c62c</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708372</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Warning">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">A Warning advises against using the SmartGuard feature soon after a manual insulin injection due to inaccurate active insulin tracking and risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d10">contraindication,safety hazard</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
