</edge>
<edge source="CGM Device" target="Guardian 4">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter connects to the CGM sensor and sends glucose data to the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardian 4 is a specific model within the category of CGM devices used for glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">data transmission,device model,product type,transmitter integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-92b103916c0aae66fd1ad9496d81e3dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fd001e1c01f7ba101b7beb19f131c79</data>
