<edge source="CGM Device" target="Pair New Sensor Alert">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Pair New Sensor Alert is triggered when attempting to pair a new sensor while a CGM device is already paired, requiring user decision to switch.</data>
