<edge source="CGM Device" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump integrates with various CGM devices to monitor glucose levels and deliver insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The CGM Device communicates glucose readings to the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump via a wireless connection.</data>
  <data key="d10">data transmission,glucose monitoring,system integration,wireless communication</data>
