</edge>
<edge source="Guardian 4" target="Simplera Sync">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Guardian 4 and Simplera Sync are both CGM systems referenced in the context of alerts and sensor calibration with the insulin pump.</data>
