  <data key="d13">1778708157</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Restore Settings" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Restore Settings option allows the MiniMed 780G system to reload previously saved configurations after a restart.</data>
  <data key="d10">configuration recovery,system reset</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-64e8ebad9c2de6a1aeba1645920f2e35</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708222</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Appendix A" target="Pump Data">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Appendix A provides instructions for handling the download of pump data, including troubleshooting delays.</data>
  <data key="d10">data management,procedural guidance</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-583197b9760861a9bb1ee261914759fc</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707551</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="AA Battery" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump relies on an AA battery for operation, and users are instructed to reseat the battery if buttons become stuck.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d10">device maintenance,power source</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d536bf636b4a29c1f9f46de648b2b306</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707534</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="AA Battery" target="Battery Power">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The AA battery is the component that supplies battery power and must be replaced when depleted.</data>
  <data key="d10">power source,replacement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c79aff2bfb4c32e8089ffd4b1e5eb5dd</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708127</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="AA Battery" target="Power Loss">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Power Loss alarm is triggered when the AA battery is removed for more than 10 minutes.</data>
  <data key="d10">battery removal,power interruption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-64e8ebad9c2de6a1aeba1645920f2e35</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708220</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Compatible CGM Device" target="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Simplera Sync sensor is a component of the compatible CGM device that measures glucose and communicates with the pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,glucose monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9cb557f99f1234ecc2b21be31e823064</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707491</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Compatible CGM Device" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Instinct sensor is part of the compatible CGM device and requires the MiniMed Mobile app to start a new sensor.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,glucose monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9cb557f99f1234ecc2b21be31e823064</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707492</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Compatible CGM Device" target="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 sensor measures glucose and, together with the transmitter, forms the compatible CGM device.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,glucose monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9cb557f99f1234ecc2b21be31e823064</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707493</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Compatible CGM Device" target="Guardian 4 Transmitter">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter communicates glucose data from the sensor to the pump wirelessly as part of the CGM device.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9cb557f99f1234ecc2b21be31e823064</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707494</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Guardian 4 Transmitter" target="Bluetooth">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter uses Bluetooth technology to send glucose data to the MiniMed 780G pump.</data>
  <data key="d10">data transmission,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778707999</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Guardian 4 Transmitter" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter with Bluetooth is approved for use with the MiniMed 780G system to ensure accurate SG readings.</data>
  <data key="d10">approved device,system requirement</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708009</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Guardian 4 Transmitter" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter works with the Guardian 4 sensor to send glucose data to the MiniMed 780G insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian 4 transmitter is part of the MiniMed 780G system and integrates with the pump to enable continuous glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d10">data integration,data transmission,device compatibility,device integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e3323a205200ffe0b547b90ddb5919e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36</data>
  <data key="d12">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1778708051</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Guardian 4 Transmitter" target="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Guardian 4 transmitter sends glucose data from the Guardian 4 sensor to the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian 4 transmitter pairs exclusively with the Guardian 4 sensor to collect glucose data and wirelessly transmit it to monitoring devices.</data>
