<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="SmartGuard Mode">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In SmartGuard mode, the MiniMed 780G insulin pump automatically adjusts basal insulin and delivers correction boluses.</data>
