<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Bolus Stopped Screen">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When a bolus is stopped, the MiniMed 780G insulin pump displays the Bolus Stopped screen showing delivered and original bolus amounts.&gt;</data>
