<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="MiniMed Mobile App">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed Mobile app is required to start the Instinct sensor and supports connectivity with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App wirelessly updates the software of the MiniMed 780G insulin pump and provides a secondary display.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile app communicates with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to display data, upload system information, and enable remote software updates.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App must be used to pair the mobile device with the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump before starting a new sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App communicates with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to manage settings and perform software updates.</data>
  <data key="d10">data transmission,device connectivity,device control,device pairing,remote update,sensor startup,software integration,software update,system control,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-eb234cb663874d4e5a473c7f3e19383b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3323a205200ffe0b547b90ddb5919e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5f110b7de186509276c52b62487bf1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-888320702c9e96ce857f425bcf24f293</data>
