<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Instinct sensor is a compatible CGM device used with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump is compatible with the Instinct sensor for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The Instinct sensor is compatible with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump system and is used for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The Instinct Sensor pairs wirelessly with the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump after scanning, enabling glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The Instinct sensor pairs with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to enable SmartGuard features.</data>
  <data key="d10">device compatibility,glucose monitoring,interoperability,pairing,sensor pairing,wireless connection</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e3323a205200ffe0b547b90ddb5919e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5f110b7de186509276c52b62487bf1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea171e9afedb933e838f1349ebb0fe50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-888320702c9e96ce857f425bcf24f293</data>
