<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Predictive Low Glucose Technology">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G insulin pump operates in Manual mode using Predictive Low Glucose technology when SmartGuard is not active.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump uses Predictive Low Glucose technology to suspend insulin delivery when low glucose is predicted.&lt;SEP&gt;Predictive Low Glucose technology is integrated into the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to suspend insulin delivery when low glucose levels are detected or predicted.</data>
  <data key="d10">glucose prediction,hypoglycemia prevention,integration,manual mode operation,safety function,technology integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-d5f110b7de186509276c52b62487bf1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb895500e1ede1e328c1d3f50e5e9b36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-200c1e93d7f4cbc3027cec4d0898dc00</data>
