<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Serter">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The serter is used to insert the infusion set for the MiniMed 780G insulin pump and is associated with potential skin infection risks.</data>
  <data key="d10">accessory use,device insertion</data>
