  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Backlight Setting">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Backlight setting on the MiniMed 780G insulin pump determines screen timeout before Sleep mode activation.</data>
