<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Manual Bolus">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Manual bolus feature on the MiniMed 780G insulin pump allows users to deliver insulin directly, including extended and combination boluses.</data>
