<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump is a core component of the MiniMed 780G system and requires proper care for overall system performance.</data>
  <data key="d10">component integration,system dependency</data>
