</edge>
<edge source="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump" target="Battery Cap">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The battery cap of the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump requires cleaning with a dry, clean cotton swab to remove battery residue.</data>
