<edge source="Simplera Sync Sensor" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G system can use the Simplera Sync sensor, but users should not solely rely on its low glucose alerts at or below 60 mg/dL.</data>
