<edge source="Guardian 4 Sensor" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed 780G system is designed to work specifically with the Guardian 4 sensor for accurate glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G system is designed to work with the Guardian 4 sensor, which must be properly paired with the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G system integrates with the Guardian 4 sensor and uses every blood glucose reading to automatically calibrate the sensor.</data>
  <data key="d10">automatic calibration,device compatibility,device integration,sensor compatibility,sensor integration,system integration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1a9dd84e2a3b75afe80757b7b6e602a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f9bd562c68fc510780d6f6629360a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f4df342459d4afd90a81b1a3f13d859</data>
