<edge source="MiniMed Mobile App" target="CareLink Software">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed Mobile app uploads system data to CareLink software for monitoring and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App uploads device data from the MiniMed 780G system to CareLink Software for analysis.</data>
