<edge source="MiniMed Mobile App" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d8">6.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The MiniMed Mobile app is required to start a new Instinct sensor and cannot be initiated directly from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App is required to start and set up the Instinct Sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App is used to restart the Instinct Sensor if it becomes unpaired.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile App is required to start a new sensor when using the Instinct Sensor, as direct pump pairing commands are not supported.&lt;SEP&gt;The Instinct Sensor must be started using the MiniMed Mobile App, and cannot be used if already paired with a different user account.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile app displays error messages during Instinct sensor startup if conditions are not met.</data>
  <data key="d10">device pairing,device setup,error generation,mandatory use,required accessory,restart function,sensor activation,sensor initialization,sensor management,startup process,user authentication</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-e26750d1b6c495640b752a31b9f0e262&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03820ea21d982bc029e8a55fe1be600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3323a205200ffe0b547b90ddb5919e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33e0b546270469b67078fda39a4e47d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f114a018f4d8b34373a039564245abf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-888320702c9e96ce857f425bcf24f293</data>
