<edge source="Max Basal Rate" target="Max Basal Error Alert">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Max Basal Error Alert is triggered when the user attempts to set the Max Basal Rate lower than an existing basal rate.&lt;SEP&gt;The Max Basal Error Alert occurs when an invalid change is attempted for the max basal rate setting.</data>
