<edge source="Backfilled SG Values" target="Sensor Graph">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The sensor graph shows backfilled SG values as a dotted line when the sensor is out of wireless range from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Backfilled SG Values are inserted into the Sensor Graph to restore missing glucose data after connection interruptions.</data>
