</edge>
<edge source="Alert Before High" target="Time Before High">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Time Before High setting controls how many minutes in advance the Alert Before High is issued before the high limit may be reached.&lt;SEP&gt;Alert Before High uses the Time Before High setting to determine how many minutes in advance to issue a warning.</data>
  <data key="d10">advance warning,predictive alert,time configuration,timing configuration</data>
