  <data key="d9">Blood Glucose Meter Readings can be entered on the Bolus Wizard Screen in Manual mode to support bolus calculations and system verification.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bolus Wizard Screen displays the most recent Blood Glucose Meter Reading if available, indicated by the O icon.</data>
